-- Proofs for sorts.mm0.

szip_congr
----------
l1: $ seqt i i $ by seqt_refl
l2: $ cdm A ≐ cdm B $ by cdm_congr [#1]
l3: $ (i ∊ cdm A) ⟺ (i ∊ cdm B) $ by welc_congr [l1, l2]
l4: $ cv i ≐ cv i $ by ceqt_refl
l5: $ fv A i ≐ fv B i $ by fv_congr [#1, l4]
l6: $ fv C i ≐ fv D i $ by fv_congr [#2, l4]
l7: $ ⟨ fv A i , fv C i ⟩ ≐ ⟨ fv B i , fv D i ⟩ $ by opair_congr [l5, l6]
l8: $ cv z ≐ cv z $ by ceqt_refl
l9: $ (z = ⟨ fv A i , fv C i ⟩) ⟺ (z = ⟨ fv B i , fv D i ⟩) $ by ceq_congr [l8, l7]
l10: $ (i ∊ cdm A ∧ z = ⟨ fv A i , fv C i ⟩) ⟺ (i ∊ cdm B ∧ z = ⟨ fv B i , fv D i ⟩) $ by and_congr [l3, l9]
l11: $ (∃ i (i ∊ cdm A ∧ z = ⟨ fv A i , fv C i ⟩)) ⟺ (∃ i (i ∊ cdm B ∧ z = ⟨ fv B i , fv D i ⟩)) $ by ex_congr [l10]
l12: $ {z | ∃ i (i ∊ cdm A ∧ z = ⟨ fv A i , fv C i ⟩)} ≐ {z | ∃ i (i ∊ cdm B ∧ z = ⟨ fv B i , fv D i ⟩)} $ by cab_congr [l11]

--| `szip_intro` and `szip_elim`, ahead of their statements.
lemma u1_szip_intro (G: hyps) (A S: class) (i: set):
  $ G ⇒ i ∊ cdm A $ > $ G ⇒ ⟨ fv A i , fv S i ⟩ ∈ szip A S $
----
m1: $ G ⇒ isset ⟨ fv A i , fv S i ⟩ $ by opair_isset
m2: $ G , w = ⟨ fv A i , fv S i ⟩ ⇒ w = ⟨ fv A i , fv S i ⟩ $ by ax
m3: $ G , w = ⟨ fv A i , fv S i ⟩ ⇒ i ∊ cdm A $ by weaken [#1]
m4: $ G , w = ⟨ fv A i , fv S i ⟩ ⇒ i ∊ cdm A ∧ w = ⟨ fv A i , fv S i ⟩ $ by and_intro [m3, m2]
m5: $ G , w = ⟨ fv A i , fv S i ⟩ ⇒ ∃ j (j ∊ cdm A ∧ w = ⟨ fv A j , fv S j ⟩) $ by ex_intro [m4]
m6: $ G , w = ⟨ fv A i , fv S i ⟩ ⇒ w ∊ {z | ∃ j (j ∊ cdm A ∧ z = ⟨ fv A j , fv S j ⟩)} $ by cab_intro [m5]
m7: $ G , w = ⟨ fv A i , fv S i ⟩ ⇒ w ∊ szip A S $ by weaken [m6]
m8: $ G , w = ⟨ fv A i , fv S i ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ fv A i , fv S i ⟩ ∈ szip A S $ by wcel_intro [m2, m7]
m9: $ G ⇒ ⟨ fv A i , fv S i ⟩ ∈ szip A S $ by isset_elim [m1, m8]

lemma u1_szip_elim (G: hyps) {i: set} (A S: class) (z: set):
  $ G ⇒ z ∊ szip A S $ > $ G ⇒ ∃ i (i ∊ cdm A ∧ z = ⟨ fv A i , fv S i ⟩) $
----
l1: $ G ⇒ z ∊ {w | ∃ i (i ∊ cdm A ∧ w = ⟨ fv A i , fv S i ⟩)} $ by weaken [#1]
l2: $ G ⇒ ∃ i (i ∊ cdm A ∧ z = ⟨ fv A i , fv S i ⟩) $ by cab_elim [l1]

lemma u1_szip_sub (G: hyps) (A B C D: class) (z: set):
  $ G ⇒ A = B $ > $ G ⇒ C = D $ > $ G ⇒ z ∊ szip A C $ > $ G ⇒ z ∊ szip B D $
----
t1: $ G ⇒ ∃ i (i ∊ cdm A ∧ z = ⟨ fv A i , fv C i ⟩) $ by u1_szip_elim [#3]
t2: $ G , i ∊ cdm A ∧ z = ⟨ fv A i , fv C i ⟩ ⇒ i ∊ cdm A ∧ z = ⟨ fv A i , fv C i ⟩ $ by ax
t3: $ G , i ∊ cdm A ∧ z = ⟨ fv A i , fv C i ⟩ ⇒ i ∊ cdm A $ by and_elim_l [t2]
t4: $ G , i ∊ cdm A ∧ z = ⟨ fv A i , fv C i ⟩ ⇒ z = ⟨ fv A i , fv C i ⟩ $ by and_elim_r [t2]
t5: $ G , i ∊ cdm A ∧ z = ⟨ fv A i , fv C i ⟩ ⇒ A = B $ by weaken [#1]
t6: $ G , i ∊ cdm A ∧ z = ⟨ fv A i , fv C i ⟩ ⇒ C = D $ by weaken [#2]
t7: $ G , i ∊ cdm A ∧ z = ⟨ fv A i , fv C i ⟩ ⇒ cdm A = cdm B $ by cdm_eq [t5]
t8: $ G , i ∊ cdm A ∧ z = ⟨ fv A i , fv C i ⟩ ⇒ i ∊ cdm B $ by welc_eq [t7, t3]
t9: $ G , i ∊ cdm A ∧ z = ⟨ fv A i , fv C i ⟩ ⇒ i = i $ by eq_refl
t10: $ G , i ∊ cdm A ∧ z = ⟨ fv A i , fv C i ⟩ ⇒ fv A i = fv B i $ by fv_eq [t5, t9]
t11: $ G , i ∊ cdm A ∧ z = ⟨ fv A i , fv C i ⟩ ⇒ fv C i = fv D i $ by fv_eq [t6, t9]
t12: $ G , i ∊ cdm A ∧ z = ⟨ fv A i , fv C i ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ fv A i , fv C i ⟩ = ⟨ fv B i , fv D i ⟩ $ by opair_eq [t10, t11]
t13: $ G , i ∊ cdm A ∧ z = ⟨ fv A i , fv C i ⟩ ⇒ z = ⟨ fv B i , fv D i ⟩ $ by eq_trans [t4, t12]
t14: $ G , i ∊ cdm A ∧ z = ⟨ fv A i , fv C i ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ fv B i , fv D i ⟩ ∈ szip B D $ by u1_szip_intro [t8]
t15: $ G , i ∊ cdm A ∧ z = ⟨ fv A i , fv C i ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ fv B i , fv D i ⟩ = z $ by eq_sym [t13]
t16: $ G , i ∊ cdm A ∧ z = ⟨ fv A i , fv C i ⟩ ⇒ z ∈ szip B D $ by wcel_eq_l [t15, t14]
t17: $ G , i ∊ cdm A ∧ z = ⟨ fv A i , fv C i ⟩ ⇒ z ∊ szip B D $ by wcel_welc [t16]
t18: $ G ⇒ z ∊ szip B D $ by ex_elim [t1, t17]

szip_eq
-------
q1: $ G , z ∊ szip A C ⇒ z ∊ szip A C $ by ax
q2: $ G , z ∊ szip A C ⇒ A = B $ by weaken [#1]
q3: $ G , z ∊ szip A C ⇒ C = D $ by weaken [#2]
q4: $ G , z ∊ szip A C ⇒ z ∊ szip B D $ by u1_szip_sub [q2, q3, q1]
q5: $ G ⇒ B = A $ by eq_sym [#1]
q6: $ G ⇒ D = C $ by eq_sym [#2]
q7: $ G , z ∊ szip B D ⇒ z ∊ szip B D $ by ax
q8: $ G , z ∊ szip B D ⇒ B = A $ by weaken [q5]
q9: $ G , z ∊ szip B D ⇒ D = C $ by weaken [q6]
q10: $ G , z ∊ szip B D ⇒ z ∊ szip A C $ by u1_szip_sub [q8, q9, q7]
q11: $ G ⇒ szip A C = szip B D $ by eq_intro [q4, q10]

sb_c_szip
---------
l1: $ (⟦ x / t ⟧ {z | ∃ i (i ∊ cdm A ∧ z = ⟨ fv A i , fv B i ⟩)}) ≐ {z | ∃ i (i ∊ cdm (⟦ x / t ⟧ A) ∧ z = ⟨ fv (⟦ x / t ⟧ A) i , fv (⟦ x / t ⟧ B) i ⟩)} $ by ceqt_refl

szip_intro
----------
l1: $ G ⇒ ⟨ fv A i , fv S i ⟩ ∈ szip A S $ by u1_szip_intro [#1]

szip_elim
---------
l1: $ G ⇒ ∃ i (i ∊ cdm A ∧ z = ⟨ fv A i , fv S i ⟩) $ by u1_szip_elim [#1]

szip_empty
----------
e1: $ G , z ∊ szip ∅ S ⇒ z ∊ szip ∅ S $ by ax
e2: $ G , z ∊ szip ∅ S ⇒ ∃ i (i ∊ cdm ∅ ∧ z = ⟨ fv ∅ i , fv S i ⟩) $ by szip_elim [e1]
e3: $ G , i ∊ cdm ∅ ∧ z = ⟨ fv ∅ i , fv S i ⟩ ⇒ i ∊ cdm ∅ ∧ z = ⟨ fv ∅ i , fv S i ⟩ $ by ax
e4: $ G , i ∊ cdm ∅ ∧ z = ⟨ fv ∅ i , fv S i ⟩ ⇒ i ∊ cdm ∅ $ by and_elim_l [e3]
e5: $ G , i ∊ cdm ∅ ∧ z = ⟨ fv ∅ i , fv S i ⟩ ⇒ cdm ∅ = ∅ $ by cdm_empty
e6: $ G , i ∊ cdm ∅ ∧ z = ⟨ fv ∅ i , fv S i ⟩ ⇒ i ∊ ∅ $ by welc_eq [e5, e4]
e7: $ G , i ∊ cdm ∅ ∧ z = ⟨ fv ∅ i , fv S i ⟩ ⇒ ⊥ $ by empty_elim [e6]
e8: $ G , z ∊ szip ∅ S ⇒ ⊥ $ by ex_elim [e2, e7]
e9: $ G ⇒ szip ∅ S = ∅ $ by empty_eq_intro [e8]

--| The class form of `szip_intro`.
lemma u1_szip_intro_c (G: hyps) (A S I: class):
  $ G ⇒ isset I $ > $ G ⇒ I ∈ cdm A $ > $ G ⇒ ⟨ fv A I , fv S I ⟩ ∈ szip A S $
----
c1: $ G , i = I ⇒ i = I $ by ax
c2: $ G , i = I ⇒ I ∈ cdm A $ by weaken [#2]
c3: $ G , i = I ⇒ I = i $ by eq_sym [c1]
c4: $ G , i = I ⇒ i ∈ cdm A $ by wcel_eq_l [c3, c2]
c5: $ G , i = I ⇒ i ∊ cdm A $ by wcel_welc [c4]
c6: $ G , i = I ⇒ ⟨ fv A i , fv S i ⟩ ∈ szip A S $ by u1_szip_intro [c5]
c7: $ G , i = I ⇒ A = A $ by eq_refl
c8: $ G , i = I ⇒ fv A i = fv A I $ by fv_eq [c7, c1]
c9: $ G , i = I ⇒ S = S $ by eq_refl
c10: $ G , i = I ⇒ fv S i = fv S I $ by fv_eq [c9, c1]
c11: $ G , i = I ⇒ ⟨ fv A i , fv S i ⟩ = ⟨ fv A I , fv S I ⟩ $ by opair_eq [c8, c10]
c12: $ G , i = I ⇒ ⟨ fv A I , fv S I ⟩ ∈ szip A S $ by wcel_eq_l [c11, c6]
c13: $ G ⇒ ⟨ fv A I , fv S I ⟩ ∈ szip A S $ by isset_elim [#1, c12]

lemma u1_szip_scons_fwd (G: hyps) (a b s t z: set):
  $ G ⇒ z ∊ szip (scons a s) (scons b t) $ > $ G ⇒ z ∊ csn ⟨ a , b ⟩ ∪ szip s t $
----
f1: $ G ⇒ ∃ i (i ∊ cdm (scons a s) ∧ z = ⟨ fv (scons a s) i , fv (scons b t) i ⟩) $ by szip_elim [#1]
f2: $ G , i ∊ cdm (scons a s) ∧ z = ⟨ fv (scons a s) i , fv (scons b t) i ⟩ ⇒ i ∊ cdm (scons a s) ∧ z = ⟨ fv (scons a s) i , fv (scons b t) i ⟩ $ by ax
f3: $ G , i ∊ cdm (scons a s) ∧ z = ⟨ fv (scons a s) i , fv (scons b t) i ⟩ ⇒ i ∊ cdm (scons a s) $ by and_elim_l [f2]
f4: $ G , i ∊ cdm (scons a s) ∧ z = ⟨ fv (scons a s) i , fv (scons b t) i ⟩ ⇒ z = ⟨ fv (scons a s) i , fv (scons b t) i ⟩ $ by and_elim_r [f2]
f5: $ G , i ∊ cdm (scons a s) ∧ z = ⟨ fv (scons a s) i , fv (scons b t) i ⟩ , ⟨ i , y ⟩ ∈ scons a s ⇒ ⟨ i , y ⟩ ∈ scons a s $ by ax
f6: $ G , i ∊ cdm (scons a s) ∧ z = ⟨ fv (scons a s) i , fv (scons b t) i ⟩ , ⟨ i , y ⟩ ∈ scons a s ⇒ isset i $ by isset_var
f7: $ G , i ∊ cdm (scons a s) ∧ z = ⟨ fv (scons a s) i , fv (scons b t) i ⟩ , ⟨ i , y ⟩ ∈ scons a s ⇒ isset a $ by isset_var
f8: $ G , i ∊ cdm (scons a s) ∧ z = ⟨ fv (scons a s) i , fv (scons b t) i ⟩ , ⟨ i , y ⟩ ∈ scons a s ⇒ (i = ∅ ∧ y = a) ∨ ∃ j (i = suc j ∧ ⟨ j , y ⟩ ∈ s) $ by scons_pair [f5, f6, f7]
g1: $ G , i ∊ cdm (scons a s) ∧ z = ⟨ fv (scons a s) i , fv (scons b t) i ⟩ , ⟨ i , y ⟩ ∈ scons a s , i = ∅ ∧ y = a ⇒ i = ∅ ∧ y = a $ by ax
g2: $ G , i ∊ cdm (scons a s) ∧ z = ⟨ fv (scons a s) i , fv (scons b t) i ⟩ , ⟨ i , y ⟩ ∈ scons a s , i = ∅ ∧ y = a ⇒ i = ∅ $ by and_elim_l [g1]
g3: $ G , i ∊ cdm (scons a s) ∧ z = ⟨ fv (scons a s) i , fv (scons b t) i ⟩ , ⟨ i , y ⟩ ∈ scons a s , i = ∅ ∧ y = a ⇒ scons a s = scons a s $ by eq_refl
g4: $ G , i ∊ cdm (scons a s) ∧ z = ⟨ fv (scons a s) i , fv (scons b t) i ⟩ , ⟨ i , y ⟩ ∈ scons a s , i = ∅ ∧ y = a ⇒ fv (scons a s) i = fv (scons a s) ∅ $ by fv_eq [g3, g2]
g5: $ G , i ∊ cdm (scons a s) ∧ z = ⟨ fv (scons a s) i , fv (scons b t) i ⟩ , ⟨ i , y ⟩ ∈ scons a s , i = ∅ ∧ y = a ⇒ fv (scons a s) ∅ = a $ by scons_fv_zero
g6: $ G , i ∊ cdm (scons a s) ∧ z = ⟨ fv (scons a s) i , fv (scons b t) i ⟩ , ⟨ i , y ⟩ ∈ scons a s , i = ∅ ∧ y = a ⇒ fv (scons a s) i = a $ by eq_trans [g4, g5]
g7: $ G , i ∊ cdm (scons a s) ∧ z = ⟨ fv (scons a s) i , fv (scons b t) i ⟩ , ⟨ i , y ⟩ ∈ scons a s , i = ∅ ∧ y = a ⇒ scons b t = scons b t $ by eq_refl
g8: $ G , i ∊ cdm (scons a s) ∧ z = ⟨ fv (scons a s) i , fv (scons b t) i ⟩ , ⟨ i , y ⟩ ∈ scons a s , i = ∅ ∧ y = a ⇒ fv (scons b t) i = fv (scons b t) ∅ $ by fv_eq [g7, g2]
g9: $ G , i ∊ cdm (scons a s) ∧ z = ⟨ fv (scons a s) i , fv (scons b t) i ⟩ , ⟨ i , y ⟩ ∈ scons a s , i = ∅ ∧ y = a ⇒ fv (scons b t) ∅ = b $ by scons_fv_zero
g10: $ G , i ∊ cdm (scons a s) ∧ z = ⟨ fv (scons a s) i , fv (scons b t) i ⟩ , ⟨ i , y ⟩ ∈ scons a s , i = ∅ ∧ y = a ⇒ fv (scons b t) i = b $ by eq_trans [g8, g9]
g11: $ G , i ∊ cdm (scons a s) ∧ z = ⟨ fv (scons a s) i , fv (scons b t) i ⟩ , ⟨ i , y ⟩ ∈ scons a s , i = ∅ ∧ y = a ⇒ ⟨ fv (scons a s) i , fv (scons b t) i ⟩ = ⟨ a , b ⟩ $ by opair_eq [g6, g10]
g12: $ G , i ∊ cdm (scons a s) ∧ z = ⟨ fv (scons a s) i , fv (scons b t) i ⟩ , ⟨ i , y ⟩ ∈ scons a s , i = ∅ ∧ y = a ⇒ z = ⟨ fv (scons a s) i , fv (scons b t) i ⟩ $ by weaken [f4]
g13: $ G , i ∊ cdm (scons a s) ∧ z = ⟨ fv (scons a s) i , fv (scons b t) i ⟩ , ⟨ i , y ⟩ ∈ scons a s , i = ∅ ∧ y = a ⇒ z = ⟨ a , b ⟩ $ by eq_trans [g12, g11]
g14: $ G , i ∊ cdm (scons a s) ∧ z = ⟨ fv (scons a s) i , fv (scons b t) i ⟩ , ⟨ i , y ⟩ ∈ scons a s , i = ∅ ∧ y = a ⇒ z ∊ csn ⟨ a , b ⟩ $ by csn_intro [g13]
g15: $ G , i ∊ cdm (scons a s) ∧ z = ⟨ fv (scons a s) i , fv (scons b t) i ⟩ , ⟨ i , y ⟩ ∈ scons a s , i = ∅ ∧ y = a ⇒ z ∊ csn ⟨ a , b ⟩ ∪ szip s t $ by cun_intro_l [g14]
h1: $ G , i ∊ cdm (scons a s) ∧ z = ⟨ fv (scons a s) i , fv (scons b t) i ⟩ , ⟨ i , y ⟩ ∈ scons a s , i = suc j ∧ ⟨ j , y ⟩ ∈ s ⇒ i = suc j ∧ ⟨ j , y ⟩ ∈ s $ by ax
h2: $ G , i ∊ cdm (scons a s) ∧ z = ⟨ fv (scons a s) i , fv (scons b t) i ⟩ , ⟨ i , y ⟩ ∈ scons a s , i = suc j ∧ ⟨ j , y ⟩ ∈ s ⇒ i = suc j $ by and_elim_l [h1]
h3: $ G , i ∊ cdm (scons a s) ∧ z = ⟨ fv (scons a s) i , fv (scons b t) i ⟩ , ⟨ i , y ⟩ ∈ scons a s , i = suc j ∧ ⟨ j , y ⟩ ∈ s ⇒ ⟨ j , y ⟩ ∈ s $ by and_elim_r [h1]
h4: $ G , i ∊ cdm (scons a s) ∧ z = ⟨ fv (scons a s) i , fv (scons b t) i ⟩ , ⟨ i , y ⟩ ∈ scons a s , i = suc j ∧ ⟨ j , y ⟩ ∈ s ⇒ j ∊ cdm s $ by cdm_intro [h3]
h5: $ G , i ∊ cdm (scons a s) ∧ z = ⟨ fv (scons a s) i , fv (scons b t) i ⟩ , ⟨ i , y ⟩ ∈ scons a s , i = suc j ∧ ⟨ j , y ⟩ ∈ s ⇒ scons a s = scons a s $ by eq_refl
h6: $ G , i ∊ cdm (scons a s) ∧ z = ⟨ fv (scons a s) i , fv (scons b t) i ⟩ , ⟨ i , y ⟩ ∈ scons a s , i = suc j ∧ ⟨ j , y ⟩ ∈ s ⇒ fv (scons a s) i = fv (scons a s) (suc j) $ by fv_eq [h5, h2]
h7: $ G , i ∊ cdm (scons a s) ∧ z = ⟨ fv (scons a s) i , fv (scons b t) i ⟩ , ⟨ i , y ⟩ ∈ scons a s , i = suc j ∧ ⟨ j , y ⟩ ∈ s ⇒ fv (scons a s) (suc j) = fv s j $ by scons_fv_suc
h8: $ G , i ∊ cdm (scons a s) ∧ z = ⟨ fv (scons a s) i , fv (scons b t) i ⟩ , ⟨ i , y ⟩ ∈ scons a s , i = suc j ∧ ⟨ j , y ⟩ ∈ s ⇒ fv (scons a s) i = fv s j $ by eq_trans [h6, h7]
h9: $ G , i ∊ cdm (scons a s) ∧ z = ⟨ fv (scons a s) i , fv (scons b t) i ⟩ , ⟨ i , y ⟩ ∈ scons a s , i = suc j ∧ ⟨ j , y ⟩ ∈ s ⇒ scons b t = scons b t $ by eq_refl
h10: $ G , i ∊ cdm (scons a s) ∧ z = ⟨ fv (scons a s) i , fv (scons b t) i ⟩ , ⟨ i , y ⟩ ∈ scons a s , i = suc j ∧ ⟨ j , y ⟩ ∈ s ⇒ fv (scons b t) i = fv (scons b t) (suc j) $ by fv_eq [h9, h2]
h11: $ G , i ∊ cdm (scons a s) ∧ z = ⟨ fv (scons a s) i , fv (scons b t) i ⟩ , ⟨ i , y ⟩ ∈ scons a s , i = suc j ∧ ⟨ j , y ⟩ ∈ s ⇒ fv (scons b t) (suc j) = fv t j $ by scons_fv_suc
h12: $ G , i ∊ cdm (scons a s) ∧ z = ⟨ fv (scons a s) i , fv (scons b t) i ⟩ , ⟨ i , y ⟩ ∈ scons a s , i = suc j ∧ ⟨ j , y ⟩ ∈ s ⇒ fv (scons b t) i = fv t j $ by eq_trans [h10, h11]
h13: $ G , i ∊ cdm (scons a s) ∧ z = ⟨ fv (scons a s) i , fv (scons b t) i ⟩ , ⟨ i , y ⟩ ∈ scons a s , i = suc j ∧ ⟨ j , y ⟩ ∈ s ⇒ ⟨ fv (scons a s) i , fv (scons b t) i ⟩ = ⟨ fv s j , fv t j ⟩ $ by opair_eq [h8, h12]
h14: $ G , i ∊ cdm (scons a s) ∧ z = ⟨ fv (scons a s) i , fv (scons b t) i ⟩ , ⟨ i , y ⟩ ∈ scons a s , i = suc j ∧ ⟨ j , y ⟩ ∈ s ⇒ z = ⟨ fv (scons a s) i , fv (scons b t) i ⟩ $ by weaken [f4]
h15: $ G , i ∊ cdm (scons a s) ∧ z = ⟨ fv (scons a s) i , fv (scons b t) i ⟩ , ⟨ i , y ⟩ ∈ scons a s , i = suc j ∧ ⟨ j , y ⟩ ∈ s ⇒ z = ⟨ fv s j , fv t j ⟩ $ by eq_trans [h14, h13]
h16: $ G , i ∊ cdm (scons a s) ∧ z = ⟨ fv (scons a s) i , fv (scons b t) i ⟩ , ⟨ i , y ⟩ ∈ scons a s , i = suc j ∧ ⟨ j , y ⟩ ∈ s ⇒ ⟨ fv s j , fv t j ⟩ ∈ szip s t $ by szip_intro [h4]
h17: $ G , i ∊ cdm (scons a s) ∧ z = ⟨ fv (scons a s) i , fv (scons b t) i ⟩ , ⟨ i , y ⟩ ∈ scons a s , i = suc j ∧ ⟨ j , y ⟩ ∈ s ⇒ ⟨ fv s j , fv t j ⟩ = z $ by eq_sym [h15]
h18: $ G , i ∊ cdm (scons a s) ∧ z = ⟨ fv (scons a s) i , fv (scons b t) i ⟩ , ⟨ i , y ⟩ ∈ scons a s , i = suc j ∧ ⟨ j , y ⟩ ∈ s ⇒ z ∈ szip s t $ by wcel_eq_l [h17, h16]
h19: $ G , i ∊ cdm (scons a s) ∧ z = ⟨ fv (scons a s) i , fv (scons b t) i ⟩ , ⟨ i , y ⟩ ∈ scons a s , i = suc j ∧ ⟨ j , y ⟩ ∈ s ⇒ z ∊ szip s t $ by wcel_welc [h18]
h20: $ G , i ∊ cdm (scons a s) ∧ z = ⟨ fv (scons a s) i , fv (scons b t) i ⟩ , ⟨ i , y ⟩ ∈ scons a s , i = suc j ∧ ⟨ j , y ⟩ ∈ s ⇒ z ∊ csn ⟨ a , b ⟩ ∪ szip s t $ by cun_intro_r [h19]
h21: $ G , i ∊ cdm (scons a s) ∧ z = ⟨ fv (scons a s) i , fv (scons b t) i ⟩ , ⟨ i , y ⟩ ∈ scons a s , ∃ j (i = suc j ∧ ⟨ j , y ⟩ ∈ s) ⇒ ∃ j (i = suc j ∧ ⟨ j , y ⟩ ∈ s) $ by ax
h22: $ G , i ∊ cdm (scons a s) ∧ z = ⟨ fv (scons a s) i , fv (scons b t) i ⟩ , ⟨ i , y ⟩ ∈ scons a s , ∃ j (i = suc j ∧ ⟨ j , y ⟩ ∈ s) ⇒ z ∊ csn ⟨ a , b ⟩ ∪ szip s t $ by ex_elim [h21, h20]
f9: $ G , i ∊ cdm (scons a s) ∧ z = ⟨ fv (scons a s) i , fv (scons b t) i ⟩ , ⟨ i , y ⟩ ∈ scons a s ⇒ z ∊ csn ⟨ a , b ⟩ ∪ szip s t $ by or_elim [f8, g15, h22]
f10: $ G , i ∊ cdm (scons a s) ∧ z = ⟨ fv (scons a s) i , fv (scons b t) i ⟩ ⇒ z ∊ csn ⟨ a , b ⟩ ∪ szip s t $ by cdm_elim [f3, f9]
f11: $ G ⇒ z ∊ csn ⟨ a , b ⟩ ∪ szip s t $ by ex_elim [f1, f10]

lemma u1_szip_scons_bwd (G: hyps) (A: class) (a b s t z: set):
  $ G ⇒ s ∊ fseq A $ > $ G ⇒ z ∊ csn ⟨ a , b ⟩ ∪ szip s t $ > $ G ⇒ z ∊ szip (scons a s) (scons b t) $
----
b1: $ G ⇒ z ∊ csn ⟨ a , b ⟩ ∨ z ∊ szip s t $ by cun_elim [#2]
c1: $ G , z ∊ csn ⟨ a , b ⟩ ⇒ z ∊ csn ⟨ a , b ⟩ $ by ax
c2: $ G , z ∊ csn ⟨ a , b ⟩ ⇒ z = ⟨ a , b ⟩ $ by csn_elim [c1]
c3a: $ G , z ∊ csn ⟨ a , b ⟩ ⇒ s ∊ fseq A $ by weaken [#1]
c3: $ G , z ∊ csn ⟨ a , b ⟩ ⇒ cdm (scons a s) = suc (cdm s) $ by scons_len [c3a]
c4: $ G , z ∊ csn ⟨ a , b ⟩ ⇒ cdm s ∈ ω $ by fseq_len [c3a]
c5: $ G , z ∊ csn ⟨ a , b ⟩ , w = cdm s , w ∊ ω ⇒ w ∊ ω $ by ax
c6: $ G , z ∊ csn ⟨ a , b ⟩ , w = cdm s , w ∊ ω ⇒ ∅ ∈ suc w $ by nzero_lt_suc [c5]
c7: $ G , z ∊ csn ⟨ a , b ⟩ , w = cdm s , w ∊ ω ⇒ w = cdm s $ by ax
c8: $ G , z ∊ csn ⟨ a , b ⟩ , w = cdm s , w ∊ ω ⇒ suc w = suc (cdm s) $ by suc_eq [c7]
c9: $ G , z ∊ csn ⟨ a , b ⟩ , w = cdm s , w ∊ ω ⇒ ∅ ∈ suc (cdm s) $ by wcel_eq_r [c8, c6]
c10: $ G , z ∊ csn ⟨ a , b ⟩ ⇒ ∅ ∈ suc (cdm s) $ by wcel_elim [c4, c9]
c11: $ G , z ∊ csn ⟨ a , b ⟩ ⇒ suc (cdm s) = cdm (scons a s) $ by eq_sym [c3]
c12: $ G , z ∊ csn ⟨ a , b ⟩ ⇒ ∅ ∈ cdm (scons a s) $ by wcel_eq_r [c11, c10]
c13: $ G , z ∊ csn ⟨ a , b ⟩ ⇒ isset ∅ $ by ax_empty
c14: $ G , z ∊ csn ⟨ a , b ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ fv (scons a s) ∅ , fv (scons b t) ∅ ⟩ ∈ szip (scons a s) (scons b t) $ by u1_szip_intro_c [c13, c12]
c15: $ G , z ∊ csn ⟨ a , b ⟩ ⇒ fv (scons a s) ∅ = a $ by scons_fv_zero
c16: $ G , z ∊ csn ⟨ a , b ⟩ ⇒ fv (scons b t) ∅ = b $ by scons_fv_zero
c17: $ G , z ∊ csn ⟨ a , b ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ fv (scons a s) ∅ , fv (scons b t) ∅ ⟩ = ⟨ a , b ⟩ $ by opair_eq [c15, c16]
c18: $ G , z ∊ csn ⟨ a , b ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ a , b ⟩ ∈ szip (scons a s) (scons b t) $ by wcel_eq_l [c17, c14]
c19: $ G , z ∊ csn ⟨ a , b ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ a , b ⟩ = z $ by eq_sym [c2]
c20: $ G , z ∊ csn ⟨ a , b ⟩ ⇒ z ∈ szip (scons a s) (scons b t) $ by wcel_eq_l [c19, c18]
c21: $ G , z ∊ csn ⟨ a , b ⟩ ⇒ z ∊ szip (scons a s) (scons b t) $ by wcel_welc [c20]
d1: $ G , z ∊ szip s t ⇒ z ∊ szip s t $ by ax
d2: $ G , z ∊ szip s t ⇒ ∃ j (j ∊ cdm s ∧ z = ⟨ fv s j , fv t j ⟩) $ by szip_elim [d1]
d3: $ G , j ∊ cdm s ∧ z = ⟨ fv s j , fv t j ⟩ ⇒ j ∊ cdm s ∧ z = ⟨ fv s j , fv t j ⟩ $ by ax
d4: $ G , j ∊ cdm s ∧ z = ⟨ fv s j , fv t j ⟩ ⇒ j ∊ cdm s $ by and_elim_l [d3]
d5: $ G , j ∊ cdm s ∧ z = ⟨ fv s j , fv t j ⟩ ⇒ z = ⟨ fv s j , fv t j ⟩ $ by and_elim_r [d3]
d6: $ G , j ∊ cdm s ∧ z = ⟨ fv s j , fv t j ⟩ ⇒ s ∊ fseq A $ by weaken [#1]
d7: $ G , j ∊ cdm s ∧ z = ⟨ fv s j , fv t j ⟩ ⇒ cdm s ∈ ω $ by fseq_len [d6]
d8: $ G , j ∊ cdm s ∧ z = ⟨ fv s j , fv t j ⟩ ⇒ j ∈ cdm s $ by welc_wcel [d4]
d9: $ G , j ∊ cdm s ∧ z = ⟨ fv s j , fv t j ⟩ ⇒ suc j ∈ suc (cdm s) $ by omega_suc_mono_c [d7, d8]
d10: $ G , j ∊ cdm s ∧ z = ⟨ fv s j , fv t j ⟩ ⇒ cdm (scons a s) = suc (cdm s) $ by scons_len [d6]
d11: $ G , j ∊ cdm s ∧ z = ⟨ fv s j , fv t j ⟩ ⇒ suc (cdm s) = cdm (scons a s) $ by eq_sym [d10]
d12: $ G , j ∊ cdm s ∧ z = ⟨ fv s j , fv t j ⟩ ⇒ suc j ∈ cdm (scons a s) $ by wcel_eq_r [d11, d9]
d13a: $ G , j ∊ cdm s ∧ z = ⟨ fv s j , fv t j ⟩ ⇒ isset j $ by isset_var
d13: $ G , j ∊ cdm s ∧ z = ⟨ fv s j , fv t j ⟩ ⇒ isset (suc j) $ by suc_set [d13a]
d14: $ G , j ∊ cdm s ∧ z = ⟨ fv s j , fv t j ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ fv (scons a s) (suc j) , fv (scons b t) (suc j) ⟩ ∈ szip (scons a s) (scons b t) $ by u1_szip_intro_c [d13, d12]
d15: $ G , j ∊ cdm s ∧ z = ⟨ fv s j , fv t j ⟩ ⇒ fv (scons a s) (suc j) = fv s j $ by scons_fv_suc
d16: $ G , j ∊ cdm s ∧ z = ⟨ fv s j , fv t j ⟩ ⇒ fv (scons b t) (suc j) = fv t j $ by scons_fv_suc
d17: $ G , j ∊ cdm s ∧ z = ⟨ fv s j , fv t j ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ fv (scons a s) (suc j) , fv (scons b t) (suc j) ⟩ = ⟨ fv s j , fv t j ⟩ $ by opair_eq [d15, d16]
d18: $ G , j ∊ cdm s ∧ z = ⟨ fv s j , fv t j ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ fv s j , fv t j ⟩ ∈ szip (scons a s) (scons b t) $ by wcel_eq_l [d17, d14]
d19: $ G , j ∊ cdm s ∧ z = ⟨ fv s j , fv t j ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ fv s j , fv t j ⟩ = z $ by eq_sym [d5]
d20: $ G , j ∊ cdm s ∧ z = ⟨ fv s j , fv t j ⟩ ⇒ z ∈ szip (scons a s) (scons b t) $ by wcel_eq_l [d19, d18]
d21: $ G , j ∊ cdm s ∧ z = ⟨ fv s j , fv t j ⟩ ⇒ z ∊ szip (scons a s) (scons b t) $ by wcel_welc [d20]
d22: $ G , z ∊ szip s t ⇒ z ∊ szip (scons a s) (scons b t) $ by ex_elim [d2, d21]
b2: $ G ⇒ z ∊ szip (scons a s) (scons b t) $ by or_elim [b1, c21, d22]

szip_scons
----------
s1: $ G , z ∊ szip (scons a s) (scons b t) ⇒ z ∊ szip (scons a s) (scons b t) $ by ax
s2: $ G , z ∊ szip (scons a s) (scons b t) ⇒ z ∊ csn ⟨ a , b ⟩ ∪ szip s t $ by u1_szip_scons_fwd [s1]
s3: $ G , z ∊ csn ⟨ a , b ⟩ ∪ szip s t ⇒ z ∊ csn ⟨ a , b ⟩ ∪ szip s t $ by ax
s4: $ G , z ∊ csn ⟨ a , b ⟩ ∪ szip s t ⇒ s ∊ fseq A $ by weaken [#1]
s5: $ G , z ∊ csn ⟨ a , b ⟩ ∪ szip s t ⇒ z ∊ szip (scons a s) (scons b t) $ by u1_szip_scons_bwd [s4, s3]
s6: $ G ⇒ szip (scons a s) (scons b t) = csn ⟨ a , b ⟩ ∪ szip s t $ by eq_intro [s2, s5]

--| The class form of `crn_intro`.
lemma u1_crn_intro_c (G: hyps) (R A B: class):
  $ G ⇒ ⟨ A , B ⟩ ∈ R $ > $ G ⇒ isset A $ > $ G ⇒ isset B $ > $ G ⇒ B ∈ crn R $
----
l1: $ G , x = A , y = B ⇒ x = A $ by ax
l2: $ G , x = A , y = B ⇒ y = B $ by ax
l3: $ G , x = A , y = B ⇒ A = x $ by eq_sym [l1]
l4: $ G , x = A , y = B ⇒ B = y $ by eq_sym [l2]
l5: $ G , x = A , y = B ⇒ ⟨ A , B ⟩ = ⟨ x , y ⟩ $ by opair_eq [l3, l4]
l6: $ G , x = A , y = B ⇒ ⟨ A , B ⟩ ∈ R $ by weaken [#1]
l7: $ G , x = A , y = B ⇒ ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ R $ by wcel_eq_l [l5, l6]
l8: $ G , x = A , y = B ⇒ y ∊ crn R $ by crn_intro [l7]
l9: $ G , x = A , y = B ⇒ B ∈ crn R $ by wcel_intro [l2, l8]
l10: $ G , x = A ⇒ B ∈ crn R $ by isset_elim [#3, l9]
l11: $ G ⇒ B ∈ crn R $ by isset_elim [#2, l10]

--| The value of a set at a set is a set (whether or not it is functional).
lemma u1_fv_isset (G: hyps) (f i: set): $ G ⇒ isset (fv f i) $
----
v1: $ G ⇒ isset f $ by isset_var
v2: $ G ⇒ isset (ap f i) $ by ap_set [v1]
v3: $ G ⇒ isset (fv f i) $ by cuni_set [v2]

crn_szip
--------
p0: $ G , y ∊ crn (szip a s) ⇒ y ∊ crn (szip a s) $ by ax
p1: $ G , ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ szip a s ⇒ ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ szip a s $ by ax
p2: $ G , ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ szip a s , w = ⟨ x , y ⟩ , w ∊ szip a s ⇒ w ∊ szip a s $ by ax
p3: $ G , ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ szip a s , w = ⟨ x , y ⟩ , w ∊ szip a s ⇒ ∃ i (i ∊ cdm a ∧ w = ⟨ fv a i , fv s i ⟩) $ by szip_elim [p2]
p4: $ G , ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ szip a s , w = ⟨ x , y ⟩ , w ∊ szip a s , i ∊ cdm a ∧ w = ⟨ fv a i , fv s i ⟩ ⇒ i ∊ cdm a ∧ w = ⟨ fv a i , fv s i ⟩ $ by ax
p5: $ G , ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ szip a s , w = ⟨ x , y ⟩ , w ∊ szip a s , i ∊ cdm a ∧ w = ⟨ fv a i , fv s i ⟩ ⇒ i ∊ cdm a $ by and_elim_l [p4]
p6: $ G , ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ szip a s , w = ⟨ x , y ⟩ , w ∊ szip a s , i ∊ cdm a ∧ w = ⟨ fv a i , fv s i ⟩ ⇒ w = ⟨ fv a i , fv s i ⟩ $ by and_elim_r [p4]
p7: $ G , ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ szip a s , w = ⟨ x , y ⟩ , w ∊ szip a s , i ∊ cdm a ∧ w = ⟨ fv a i , fv s i ⟩ ⇒ w = ⟨ x , y ⟩ $ by ax
p7s: $ G , ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ szip a s , w = ⟨ x , y ⟩ , w ∊ szip a s , i ∊ cdm a ∧ w = ⟨ fv a i , fv s i ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ x , y ⟩ = w $ by eq_sym [p7]
p8: $ G , ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ szip a s , w = ⟨ x , y ⟩ , w ∊ szip a s , i ∊ cdm a ∧ w = ⟨ fv a i , fv s i ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ x , y ⟩ = ⟨ fv a i , fv s i ⟩ $ by eq_trans [p7s, p6]
p9a: $ G , ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ szip a s , w = ⟨ x , y ⟩ , w ∊ szip a s , i ∊ cdm a ∧ w = ⟨ fv a i , fv s i ⟩ ⇒ isset x $ by isset_var
p9b: $ G , ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ szip a s , w = ⟨ x , y ⟩ , w ∊ szip a s , i ∊ cdm a ∧ w = ⟨ fv a i , fv s i ⟩ ⇒ isset y $ by isset_var
p9c: $ G , ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ szip a s , w = ⟨ x , y ⟩ , w ∊ szip a s , i ∊ cdm a ∧ w = ⟨ fv a i , fv s i ⟩ ⇒ isset (fv a i) $ by u1_fv_isset
p9d: $ G , ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ szip a s , w = ⟨ x , y ⟩ , w ∊ szip a s , i ∊ cdm a ∧ w = ⟨ fv a i , fv s i ⟩ ⇒ isset (fv s i) $ by u1_fv_isset
p9: $ G , ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ szip a s , w = ⟨ x , y ⟩ , w ∊ szip a s , i ∊ cdm a ∧ w = ⟨ fv a i , fv s i ⟩ ⇒ x = fv a i ∧ y = fv s i $ by opair_inj_c [p8, p9a, p9b, p9c, p9d]
p10: $ G , ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ szip a s , w = ⟨ x , y ⟩ , w ∊ szip a s , i ∊ cdm a ∧ w = ⟨ fv a i , fv s i ⟩ ⇒ y = fv s i $ by and_elim_r [p9]
p11a: $ G , ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ szip a s , w = ⟨ x , y ⟩ , w ∊ szip a s , i ∊ cdm a ∧ w = ⟨ fv a i , fv s i ⟩ ⇒ cdm a = cdm s $ by weaken [#2]
p11: $ G , ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ szip a s , w = ⟨ x , y ⟩ , w ∊ szip a s , i ∊ cdm a ∧ w = ⟨ fv a i , fv s i ⟩ ⇒ i ∊ cdm s $ by welc_eq [p11a, p5]
p12a: $ G , ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ szip a s , w = ⟨ x , y ⟩ , w ∊ szip a s , i ∊ cdm a ∧ w = ⟨ fv a i , fv s i ⟩ ⇒ s ∊ fseq A $ by weaken [#1]
p12: $ G , ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ szip a s , w = ⟨ x , y ⟩ , w ∊ szip a s , i ∊ cdm a ∧ w = ⟨ fv a i , fv s i ⟩ ⇒ functional s $ by fseq_functional [p12a]
p13: $ G , ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ szip a s , w = ⟨ x , y ⟩ , w ∊ szip a s , i ∊ cdm a ∧ w = ⟨ fv a i , fv s i ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ i , fv s i ⟩ ∈ s $ by fv_in [p12, p11]
p14: $ G , ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ szip a s , w = ⟨ x , y ⟩ , w ∊ szip a s , i ∊ cdm a ∧ w = ⟨ fv a i , fv s i ⟩ ⇒ fv s i = y $ by eq_sym [p10]
p15a: $ G , ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ szip a s , w = ⟨ x , y ⟩ , w ∊ szip a s , i ∊ cdm a ∧ w = ⟨ fv a i , fv s i ⟩ ⇒ i = i $ by eq_refl
p15: $ G , ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ szip a s , w = ⟨ x , y ⟩ , w ∊ szip a s , i ∊ cdm a ∧ w = ⟨ fv a i , fv s i ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ i , fv s i ⟩ = ⟨ i , y ⟩ $ by opair_eq [p15a, p14]
p16: $ G , ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ szip a s , w = ⟨ x , y ⟩ , w ∊ szip a s , i ∊ cdm a ∧ w = ⟨ fv a i , fv s i ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ i , y ⟩ ∈ s $ by wcel_eq_l [p15, p13]
p17: $ G , ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ szip a s , w = ⟨ x , y ⟩ , w ∊ szip a s , i ∊ cdm a ∧ w = ⟨ fv a i , fv s i ⟩ ⇒ y ∊ crn s $ by crn_intro [p16]
p18: $ G , ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ szip a s , w = ⟨ x , y ⟩ , w ∊ szip a s ⇒ y ∊ crn s $ by ex_elim [p3, p17]
p19: $ G , ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ szip a s ⇒ y ∊ crn s $ by wcel_elim [p1, p18]
p20: $ G , y ∊ crn (szip a s) ⇒ y ∊ crn s $ by crn_elim [p0, p19]
r0: $ G , y ∊ crn s ⇒ y ∊ crn s $ by ax
r1: $ G , ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ s ⇒ ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ s $ by ax
r2: $ G , ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ s ⇒ x ∊ cdm s $ by cdm_intro [r1]
r3: $ G , ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ s ⇒ cdm a = cdm s $ by weaken [#2]
r4: $ G , ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ s ⇒ cdm s = cdm a $ by eq_sym [r3]
r5: $ G , ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ s ⇒ x ∊ cdm a $ by welc_eq [r4, r2]
r6: $ G , ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ s ⇒ ⟨ fv a x , fv s x ⟩ ∈ szip a s $ by szip_intro [r5]
r7a: $ G , ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ s ⇒ s ∊ fseq A $ by weaken [#1]
r7: $ G , ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ s ⇒ functional s $ by fseq_functional [r7a]
r8: $ G , ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ s ⇒ fv s x = y $ by fv_val [r7, r1]
r9: $ G , ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ s ⇒ fv a x = fv a x $ by eq_refl
r10: $ G , ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ s ⇒ ⟨ fv a x , fv s x ⟩ = ⟨ fv a x , y ⟩ $ by opair_eq [r9, r8]
r11: $ G , ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ s ⇒ ⟨ fv a x , y ⟩ ∈ szip a s $ by wcel_eq_l [r10, r6]
r12: $ G , ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ s ⇒ isset (fv a x) $ by u1_fv_isset
r12b: $ G , ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ s ⇒ isset y $ by isset_var
r13: $ G , ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ s ⇒ y ∈ crn (szip a s) $ by u1_crn_intro_c [r11, r12, r12b]
r14: $ G , ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ s ⇒ y ∊ crn (szip a s) $ by wcel_welc [r13]
r15: $ G , y ∊ crn s ⇒ y ∊ crn (szip a s) $ by crn_elim [r0, r14]
r16: $ G ⇒ crn (szip a s) = crn s $ by eq_intro [p20, r15]

sig_congr
---------
l1: $ ω × (ω × fseq ω) ≐ ω × (ω × fseq ω) $ by ceqt_refl
l2: $ (A ⊆ ω × (ω × fseq ω)) ⟺ (B ⊆ ω × (ω × fseq ω)) $ by subset_congr [#1, l1]
l3: $ ω ≐ ω $ by ceqt_refl
l4: $ (C ⊆ ω) ⟺ (D ⊆ ω) $ by subset_congr [#2, l3]
l5: $ (A ⊆ ω × (ω × fseq ω) ∧ C ⊆ ω) ⟺ (B ⊆ ω × (ω × fseq ω) ∧ D ⊆ ω) $ by and_congr [l2, l4]

sb_f_sig
--------
l1: $ [x/t] (A ⊆ ω × (ω × fseq ω) ∧ B ⊆ ω) ⟺ ((⟦ x / t ⟧ A) ⊆ ω × (ω × fseq ω) ∧ (⟦ x / t ⟧ B) ⊆ ω) $ by iff_refl

sig_intro
---------
l1: $ G ⇒ sig T O $ by and_intro [#1, #2]

sig_table
---------
l1: $ G ⇒ T ⊆ ω × (ω × fseq ω) $ by and_elim_l [#1]

sig_open
--------
l1: $ G ⇒ O ⊆ ω $ by and_elim_r [#1]

sig_table_set
-------------
l1: $ G ⇒ T ⊆ ω × (ω × fseq ω) $ by sig_table [#1]
l2: $ G ⇒ isset ω $ by omega_set
l3: $ G ⇒ isset (fseq ω) $ by fseq_set [l2]
l4: $ G ⇒ isset (ω × fseq ω) $ by cxp_set [l2, l3]
l5: $ G ⇒ isset (ω × (ω × fseq ω)) $ by cxp_set [l2, l4]
l6: $ G ⇒ isset T $ by subset_isset [l5, l1]

sig_entry
---------
l1: $ G ⇒ T ⊆ ω × (ω × fseq ω) $ by sig_table [#1]
l2: $ G ⇒ ⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ ω × (ω × fseq ω) $ by wcel_subset [l1, #2]
l3: $ G ⇒ isset ⟨ k , a ⟩ $ by opair_isset
l4: $ G , w = ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⇒ w = ⟨ k , a ⟩ $ by ax
l5: $ G , w = ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ k , a ⟩ = w $ by eq_sym [l4]
l6: $ G , w = ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⇒ c = c $ by eq_refl
l7: $ G , w = ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ = ⟨ c , w ⟩ $ by opair_eq [l6, l5]
l8: $ G , w = ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ ω × (ω × fseq ω) $ by weaken [l2]
l9: $ G , w = ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ c , w ⟩ ∈ ω × (ω × fseq ω) $ by wcel_eq_l [l7, l8]
l10: $ G , w = ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⇒ c ∊ ω ∧ w ∊ ω × fseq ω $ by cxp_elim_pair [l9]
l11: $ G , w = ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⇒ c ∊ ω $ by and_elim_l [l10]
l12: $ G , w = ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⇒ w ∊ ω × fseq ω $ by and_elim_r [l10]
l13: $ G , w = ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⇒ w ∈ ω × fseq ω $ by welc_wcel [l12]
l14: $ G , w = ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ k , a ⟩ ∈ ω × fseq ω $ by wcel_eq_l [l4, l13]
l15: $ G , w = ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⇒ k ∊ ω ∧ a ∊ fseq ω $ by cxp_elim_pair [l14]
l16: $ G , w = ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⇒ c ∊ ω ∧ k ∊ ω ∧ a ∊ fseq ω $ by and_intro [l11, l15]
l17: $ G ⇒ c ∊ ω ∧ k ∊ ω ∧ a ∊ fseq ω $ by isset_elim [l3, l16]

sgstep_congr
------------
l0: $ ⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ≐ ⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ $ by ceqt_refl
l1: $ (⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ A) ⟺ (⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ B) $ by wcel_congr [l0, #1]
l2: $ crn E ≐ crn F $ by crn_congr [#3]
l3: $ fseq (crn E) ≐ fseq (crn F) $ by fseq_congr [l2]
l4: $ seqt j j $ by seqt_refl
l5: $ (j ∊ fseq (crn E)) ⟺ (j ∊ fseq (crn F)) $ by welc_congr [l4, l3]
l6: $ (cdm j = cdm a) ⟺ (cdm j = cdm a) $ by iff_refl
l7: $ szip a j ≐ szip a j $ by ceqt_refl
l8: $ (szip a j ⊆ E) ⟺ (szip a j ⊆ F) $ by subset_congr [l7, #3]
l9: $ (z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩) ⟺ (z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩) $ by iff_refl
l10: $ (szip a j ⊆ E ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩) ⟺ (szip a j ⊆ F ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩) $ by and_congr [l8, l9]
l11: $ (cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ E ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩) ⟺ (cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ F ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩) $ by and_congr [l6, l10]
l12: $ (j ∊ fseq (crn E) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ E ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩) ⟺ (j ∊ fseq (crn F) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ F ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩) $ by and_congr [l5, l11]
l13: $ (⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ A ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn E) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ E ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩) ⟺ (⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ B ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn F) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ F ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩) $ by and_congr [l1, l12]
l14: $ (∃ j (⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ A ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn E) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ E ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩)) ⟺ (∃ j (⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ B ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn F) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ F ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩)) $ by ex_congr [l13]
l15: $ (∃ a ∃ j (⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ A ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn E) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ E ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩)) ⟺ (∃ a ∃ j (⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ B ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn F) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ F ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩)) $ by ex_congr [l14]
l16: $ (∃ k ∃ a ∃ j (⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ A ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn E) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ E ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩)) ⟺ (∃ k ∃ a ∃ j (⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ B ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn F) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ F ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩)) $ by ex_congr [l15]
l17: $ (∃ c ∃ k ∃ a ∃ j (⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ A ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn E) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ E ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩)) ⟺ (∃ c ∃ k ∃ a ∃ j (⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ B ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn F) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ F ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩)) $ by ex_congr [l16]
m1: $ seqt k k $ by seqt_refl
m2: $ (k ∊ C) ⟺ (k ∊ D) $ by welc_congr [m1, #2]
m3: $ (i ∊ ω ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ∅ ⟩ ⟩) ⟺ (i ∊ ω ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ∅ ⟩ ⟩) $ by iff_refl
m4: $ (k ∊ C ∧ i ∊ ω ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ∅ ⟩ ⟩) ⟺ (k ∊ D ∧ i ∊ ω ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ∅ ⟩ ⟩) $ by and_congr [m2, m3]
m5: $ (∃ i (k ∊ C ∧ i ∊ ω ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ∅ ⟩ ⟩)) ⟺ (∃ i (k ∊ D ∧ i ∊ ω ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ∅ ⟩ ⟩)) $ by ex_congr [m4]
m6: $ (∃ k ∃ i (k ∊ C ∧ i ∊ ω ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ∅ ⟩ ⟩)) ⟺ (∃ k ∃ i (k ∊ D ∧ i ∊ ω ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ∅ ⟩ ⟩)) $ by ex_congr [m5]
o1: $ (∃ c ∃ k ∃ a ∃ j (⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ A ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn E) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ E ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩) ∨ ∃ k ∃ i (k ∊ C ∧ i ∊ ω ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ∅ ⟩ ⟩)) ⟺ (∃ c ∃ k ∃ a ∃ j (⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ B ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn F) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ F ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩) ∨ ∃ k ∃ i (k ∊ D ∧ i ∊ ω ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ∅ ⟩ ⟩)) $ by or_congr [l17, m6]
o2: $ {z | ∃ c ∃ k ∃ a ∃ j (⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ A ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn E) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ E ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩) ∨ ∃ k ∃ i (k ∊ C ∧ i ∊ ω ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ∅ ⟩ ⟩)} ≐ {z | ∃ c ∃ k ∃ a ∃ j (⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ B ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn F) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ F ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩) ∨ ∃ k ∃ i (k ∊ D ∧ i ∊ ω ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ∅ ⟩ ⟩)} $ by cab_congr [o1]

--| `sgstep_node`, `sgstep_leaf` and `sgstep_elim`, ahead of their statements.
lemma u1_sgstep_node (G: hyps) (T O X: class) (c k a j: set):
  $ G ⇒ ⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T $ > $ G ⇒ j ∊ fseq (crn X) $ > $ G ⇒ cdm j = cdm a $ >
  $ G ⇒ szip a j ⊆ X $ > $ G ⇒ ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩ ∈ sgstep T O X $
----
m1: $ G ⇒ isset ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩ $ by opair_isset
m2: $ G , w = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ w = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩ $ by ax
m3: $ G , w = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T $ by weaken [#1]
m4: $ G , w = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ j ∊ fseq (crn X) $ by weaken [#2]
m5: $ G , w = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ cdm j = cdm a $ by weaken [#3]
m6: $ G , w = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ szip a j ⊆ X $ by weaken [#4]
m7: $ G , w = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ szip a j ⊆ X ∧ w = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩ $ by and_intro [m6, m2]
m8: $ G , w = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ X ∧ w = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩ $ by and_intro [m5, m7]
m9: $ G , w = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ j ∊ fseq (crn X) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ X ∧ w = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩ $ by and_intro [m4, m8]
m10: $ G , w = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn X) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ X ∧ w = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩ $ by and_intro [m3, m9]
m11: $ G , w = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ ∃ g (⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ g ∊ fseq (crn X) ∧ cdm g = cdm a ∧ szip a g ⊆ X ∧ w = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , g ⟩ ⟩) $ by ex_intro [m10]
m12: $ G , w = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ ∃ f ∃ g (⟨ c , ⟨ k , f ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ g ∊ fseq (crn X) ∧ cdm g = cdm f ∧ szip f g ⊆ X ∧ w = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , g ⟩ ⟩) $ by ex_intro [m11]
m13: $ G , w = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ ∃ v ∃ f ∃ g (⟨ c , ⟨ v , f ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ g ∊ fseq (crn X) ∧ cdm g = cdm f ∧ szip f g ⊆ X ∧ w = ⟨ v , ⟨ c , g ⟩ ⟩) $ by ex_intro [m12]
m14: $ G , w = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ ∃ u ∃ v ∃ f ∃ g (⟨ u , ⟨ v , f ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ g ∊ fseq (crn X) ∧ cdm g = cdm f ∧ szip f g ⊆ X ∧ w = ⟨ v , ⟨ u , g ⟩ ⟩) $ by ex_intro [m13]
m15: $ G , w = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ ∃ u ∃ v ∃ f ∃ g (⟨ u , ⟨ v , f ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ g ∊ fseq (crn X) ∧ cdm g = cdm f ∧ szip f g ⊆ X ∧ w = ⟨ v , ⟨ u , g ⟩ ⟩) ∨ ∃ v ∃ y (v ∊ O ∧ y ∊ ω ∧ w = ⟨ v , ⟨ y , ∅ ⟩ ⟩) $ by or_intro_l [m14]
m16: $ G , w = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ w ∊ {z | ∃ u ∃ v ∃ f ∃ g (⟨ u , ⟨ v , f ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ g ∊ fseq (crn X) ∧ cdm g = cdm f ∧ szip f g ⊆ X ∧ z = ⟨ v , ⟨ u , g ⟩ ⟩) ∨ ∃ v ∃ y (v ∊ O ∧ y ∊ ω ∧ z = ⟨ v , ⟨ y , ∅ ⟩ ⟩)} $ by cab_intro [m15]
m17: $ G , w = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ w ∊ sgstep T O X $ by weaken [m16]
m18: $ G , w = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩ ∈ sgstep T O X $ by wcel_intro [m2, m17]
m19: $ G ⇒ ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩ ∈ sgstep T O X $ by isset_elim [m1, m18]

lemma u1_sgstep_leaf (G: hyps) (T O X: class) (k i: set):
  $ G ⇒ k ∊ O $ > $ G ⇒ i ∊ ω $ > $ G ⇒ ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ sgstep T O X $
----
m1: $ G ⇒ isset ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ $ by opair_isset
m2: $ G , w = ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ w = ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ $ by ax
m3: $ G , w = ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ k ∊ O $ by weaken [#1]
m4: $ G , w = ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ i ∊ ω $ by weaken [#2]
m5: $ G , w = ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ i ∊ ω ∧ w = ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ $ by and_intro [m4, m2]
m6: $ G , w = ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ k ∊ O ∧ i ∊ ω ∧ w = ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ $ by and_intro [m3, m5]
m7: $ G , w = ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ ∃ y (k ∊ O ∧ y ∊ ω ∧ w = ⟨ k , ⟨ y , ∅ ⟩ ⟩) $ by ex_intro [m6]
m8: $ G , w = ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ ∃ v ∃ y (v ∊ O ∧ y ∊ ω ∧ w = ⟨ v , ⟨ y , ∅ ⟩ ⟩) $ by ex_intro [m7]
m9: $ G , w = ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ ∃ u ∃ v ∃ f ∃ g (⟨ u , ⟨ v , f ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ g ∊ fseq (crn X) ∧ cdm g = cdm f ∧ szip f g ⊆ X ∧ w = ⟨ v , ⟨ u , g ⟩ ⟩) ∨ ∃ v ∃ y (v ∊ O ∧ y ∊ ω ∧ w = ⟨ v , ⟨ y , ∅ ⟩ ⟩) $ by or_intro_r [m8]
m10: $ G , w = ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ w ∊ {z | ∃ u ∃ v ∃ f ∃ g (⟨ u , ⟨ v , f ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ g ∊ fseq (crn X) ∧ cdm g = cdm f ∧ szip f g ⊆ X ∧ z = ⟨ v , ⟨ u , g ⟩ ⟩) ∨ ∃ v ∃ y (v ∊ O ∧ y ∊ ω ∧ z = ⟨ v , ⟨ y , ∅ ⟩ ⟩)} $ by cab_intro [m9]
m11: $ G , w = ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ w ∊ sgstep T O X $ by weaken [m10]
m12: $ G , w = ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ sgstep T O X $ by wcel_intro [m2, m11]
m13: $ G ⇒ ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ sgstep T O X $ by isset_elim [m1, m12]

lemma u1_sgstep_elim (G: hyps) {c k a j i: set} (T O X: class) (z: set):
  $ G ⇒ z ∊ sgstep T O X $ > $ G ⇒ ∃ c ∃ k ∃ a ∃ j (⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn X) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ X ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩) ∨ ∃ k ∃ i (k ∊ O ∧ i ∊ ω ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ∅ ⟩ ⟩) $
----
l1: $ G ⇒ z ∊ {w | ∃ c ∃ k ∃ a ∃ j (⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn X) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ X ∧ w = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩) ∨ ∃ k ∃ i (k ∊ O ∧ i ∊ ω ∧ w = ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ∅ ⟩ ⟩)} $ by weaken [#1]
l2: $ G ⇒ ∃ c ∃ k ∃ a ∃ j (⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn X) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ X ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩) ∨ ∃ k ∃ i (k ∊ O ∧ i ∊ ω ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ∅ ⟩ ⟩) $ by cab_elim [l1]

lemma u1_sgstep_sub (G: hyps) (A B C D E F: class) (z: set):
  $ G ⇒ A ⊆ B $ > $ G ⇒ C ⊆ D $ > $ G ⇒ E ⊆ F $ > $ G ⇒ z ∊ sgstep A C E $ > $ G ⇒ z ∊ sgstep B D F $
----
t1: $ G ⇒ ∃ c ∃ k ∃ a ∃ j (⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ A ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn E) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ E ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩) ∨ ∃ k ∃ i (k ∊ C ∧ i ∊ ω ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ∅ ⟩ ⟩) $ by u1_sgstep_elim [#4]
n1: $ G , ⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ A ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn E) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ E ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ A ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn E) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ E ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩ $ by ax
n2: $ G , ⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ A ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn E) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ E ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ A $ by and_elim_l [n1]
n3: $ G , ⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ A ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn E) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ E ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ j ∊ fseq (crn E) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ E ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩ $ by and_elim_r [n1]
n4: $ G , ⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ A ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn E) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ E ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ j ∊ fseq (crn E) $ by and_elim_l [n3]
n5: $ G , ⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ A ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn E) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ E ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ E ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩ $ by and_elim_r [n3]
n6: $ G , ⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ A ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn E) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ E ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ cdm j = cdm a $ by and_elim_l [n5]
n7: $ G , ⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ A ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn E) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ E ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ szip a j ⊆ E ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩ $ by and_elim_r [n5]
n8: $ G , ⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ A ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn E) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ E ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ szip a j ⊆ E $ by and_elim_l [n7]
n9: $ G , ⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ A ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn E) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ E ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩ $ by and_elim_r [n7]
n10: $ G , ⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ A ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn E) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ E ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ A ⊆ B $ by weaken [#1]
n11: $ G , ⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ A ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn E) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ E ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ B $ by wcel_subset [n10, n2]
n12: $ G , ⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ A ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn E) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ E ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ E ⊆ F $ by weaken [#3]
n13: $ G , ⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ A ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn E) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ E ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ crn E ⊆ crn F $ by crn_mono [n12]
n14: $ G , ⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ A ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn E) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ E ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ fseq (crn E) ⊆ fseq (crn F) $ by fseq_mono [n13]
n15: $ G , ⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ A ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn E) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ E ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ j ∊ fseq (crn F) $ by subset_elim [n14, n4]
n16: $ G , ⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ A ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn E) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ E ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ szip a j ⊆ F $ by subset_trans [n8, n12]
n17: $ G , ⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ A ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn E) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ E ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩ ∈ sgstep B D F $ by u1_sgstep_node [n11, n15, n6, n16]
n18: $ G , ⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ A ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn E) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ E ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩ = z $ by eq_sym [n9]
n19: $ G , ⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ A ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn E) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ E ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ z ∈ sgstep B D F $ by wcel_eq_l [n18, n17]
n20: $ G , ⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ A ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn E) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ E ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ z ∊ sgstep B D F $ by wcel_welc [n19]
e1: $ G , ∃ j (⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ A ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn E) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ E ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩) ⇒ ∃ j (⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ A ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn E) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ E ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩) $ by ax
e2: $ G , ∃ j (⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ A ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn E) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ E ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩) ⇒ z ∊ sgstep B D F $ by ex_elim [e1, n20]
e3: $ G , ∃ a ∃ j (⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ A ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn E) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ E ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩) ⇒ ∃ a ∃ j (⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ A ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn E) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ E ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩) $ by ax
e4: $ G , ∃ a ∃ j (⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ A ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn E) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ E ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩) ⇒ z ∊ sgstep B D F $ by ex_elim [e3, e2]
e5: $ G , ∃ k ∃ a ∃ j (⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ A ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn E) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ E ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩) ⇒ ∃ k ∃ a ∃ j (⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ A ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn E) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ E ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩) $ by ax
e6: $ G , ∃ k ∃ a ∃ j (⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ A ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn E) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ E ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩) ⇒ z ∊ sgstep B D F $ by ex_elim [e5, e4]
e7: $ G , ∃ c ∃ k ∃ a ∃ j (⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ A ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn E) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ E ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩) ⇒ ∃ c ∃ k ∃ a ∃ j (⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ A ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn E) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ E ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩) $ by ax
e8: $ G , ∃ c ∃ k ∃ a ∃ j (⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ A ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn E) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ E ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩) ⇒ z ∊ sgstep B D F $ by ex_elim [e7, e6]
p1: $ G , k ∊ C ∧ i ∊ ω ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ k ∊ C ∧ i ∊ ω ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ $ by ax
p2: $ G , k ∊ C ∧ i ∊ ω ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ k ∊ C $ by and_elim_l [p1]
p3: $ G , k ∊ C ∧ i ∊ ω ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ i ∊ ω ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ $ by and_elim_r [p1]
p4: $ G , k ∊ C ∧ i ∊ ω ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ i ∊ ω $ by and_elim_l [p3]
p5: $ G , k ∊ C ∧ i ∊ ω ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ $ by and_elim_r [p3]
p6: $ G , k ∊ C ∧ i ∊ ω ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ C ⊆ D $ by weaken [#2]
p7: $ G , k ∊ C ∧ i ∊ ω ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ k ∊ D $ by subset_elim [p6, p2]
p8: $ G , k ∊ C ∧ i ∊ ω ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ sgstep B D F $ by u1_sgstep_leaf [p7, p4]
p9: $ G , k ∊ C ∧ i ∊ ω ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ = z $ by eq_sym [p5]
p10: $ G , k ∊ C ∧ i ∊ ω ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ z ∈ sgstep B D F $ by wcel_eq_l [p9, p8]
p11: $ G , k ∊ C ∧ i ∊ ω ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ z ∊ sgstep B D F $ by wcel_welc [p10]
q1: $ G , ∃ i (k ∊ C ∧ i ∊ ω ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ∅ ⟩ ⟩) ⇒ ∃ i (k ∊ C ∧ i ∊ ω ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ∅ ⟩ ⟩) $ by ax
q2: $ G , ∃ i (k ∊ C ∧ i ∊ ω ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ∅ ⟩ ⟩) ⇒ z ∊ sgstep B D F $ by ex_elim [q1, p11]
q3: $ G , ∃ k ∃ i (k ∊ C ∧ i ∊ ω ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ∅ ⟩ ⟩) ⇒ ∃ k ∃ i (k ∊ C ∧ i ∊ ω ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ∅ ⟩ ⟩) $ by ax
q4: $ G , ∃ k ∃ i (k ∊ C ∧ i ∊ ω ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ∅ ⟩ ⟩) ⇒ z ∊ sgstep B D F $ by ex_elim [q3, q2]
r1: $ G ⇒ z ∊ sgstep B D F $ by or_elim [t1, e8, q4]

lemma u1_sgstep_subset (G: hyps) (A B C D E F: class):
  $ G ⇒ A ⊆ B $ > $ G ⇒ C ⊆ D $ > $ G ⇒ E ⊆ F $ > $ G ⇒ sgstep A C E ⊆ sgstep B D F $
----
l1: $ G , z ∊ sgstep A C E ⇒ z ∊ sgstep A C E $ by ax
l2: $ G , z ∊ sgstep A C E ⇒ A ⊆ B $ by weaken [#1]
l3: $ G , z ∊ sgstep A C E ⇒ C ⊆ D $ by weaken [#2]
l4: $ G , z ∊ sgstep A C E ⇒ E ⊆ F $ by weaken [#3]
l5: $ G , z ∊ sgstep A C E ⇒ z ∊ sgstep B D F $ by u1_sgstep_sub [l2, l3, l4, l1]
l6: $ G ⇒ sgstep A C E ⊆ sgstep B D F $ by subset_intro [l5]

sgstep_eq
---------
l1: $ G ⇒ A ⊆ B $ by eq_subset [#1]
l2: $ G ⇒ C ⊆ D $ by eq_subset [#2]
l3: $ G ⇒ E ⊆ F $ by eq_subset [#3]
l4: $ G ⇒ sgstep A C E ⊆ sgstep B D F $ by u1_sgstep_subset [l1, l2, l3]
l5: $ G ⇒ B = A $ by eq_sym [#1]
l6: $ G ⇒ D = C $ by eq_sym [#2]
l7: $ G ⇒ F = E $ by eq_sym [#3]
l8: $ G ⇒ B ⊆ A $ by eq_subset [l5]
l9: $ G ⇒ D ⊆ C $ by eq_subset [l6]
l10: $ G ⇒ F ⊆ E $ by eq_subset [l7]
l11: $ G ⇒ sgstep B D F ⊆ sgstep A C E $ by u1_sgstep_subset [l8, l9, l10]
l12: $ G ⇒ sgstep A C E = sgstep B D F $ by subset_antisym [l4, l11]

sb_c_sgstep
-----------
l1: $ (⟦ x / t ⟧ {z | ∃ c ∃ k ∃ a ∃ j (⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ A ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn C) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ C ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩) ∨ ∃ k ∃ i (k ∊ B ∧ i ∊ ω ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ∅ ⟩ ⟩)}) ≐ {z | ∃ c ∃ k ∃ a ∃ j (⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ (⟦ x / t ⟧ A) ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn (⟦ x / t ⟧ C)) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ (⟦ x / t ⟧ C) ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩) ∨ ∃ k ∃ i (k ∊ (⟦ x / t ⟧ B) ∧ i ∊ ω ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ∅ ⟩ ⟩)} $ by ceqt_refl

sgstep_node
-----------
l1: $ G ⇒ ⟨ k , ⟨ c , s ⟩ ⟩ ∈ sgstep T O X $ by u1_sgstep_node [#1, #2, #3, #4]

sgstep_leaf
-----------
l1: $ G ⇒ ⟨ k , ⟨ n , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ sgstep T O X $ by u1_sgstep_leaf [#1, #2]

sgstep_elim
-----------
l1: $ G ⇒ ∃ c ∃ k ∃ a ∃ s (⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ s ∊ fseq (crn X) ∧ cdm s = cdm a ∧ szip a s ⊆ X ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , s ⟩ ⟩) ∨ ∃ k ∃ n (k ∊ O ∧ n ∊ ω ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ n , ∅ ⟩ ⟩) $ by u1_sgstep_elim [#1]

sgstep_mono
-----------
l1: $ G , u ⊆ v ⇒ u ⊆ v $ by ax
l2: $ G , u ⊆ v ⇒ T ⊆ T $ by subset_refl
l3: $ G , u ⊆ v ⇒ O ⊆ O $ by subset_refl
l4: $ G , u ⊆ v ⇒ sgstep T O u ⊆ sgstep T O v $ by u1_sgstep_subset [l2, l3, l1]
l5: $ G ⇒ mono x (sgstep T O x) $ by mono_intro [l4]

--| The step lies in `ω × (ω × fseq (crn X))`: the labels are in `ω`, the
--| children in the range of `X`.
lemma u1_sgstep_bound (G: hyps) (T O X: class):
  $ G ⇒ sig T O $ > $ G ⇒ sgstep T O X ⊆ ω × (ω × fseq (crn X)) $
----
t0: $ G , z ∊ sgstep T O X ⇒ z ∊ sgstep T O X $ by ax
t1: $ G , z ∊ sgstep T O X ⇒ ∃ c ∃ k ∃ a ∃ j (⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn X) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ X ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩) ∨ ∃ k ∃ i (k ∊ O ∧ i ∊ ω ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ∅ ⟩ ⟩) $ by sgstep_elim [t0]
n1: $ G , z ∊ sgstep T O X , ⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn X) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ X ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn X) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ X ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩ $ by ax
n2: $ G , z ∊ sgstep T O X , ⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn X) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ X ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T $ by and_elim_l [n1]
n3: $ G , z ∊ sgstep T O X , ⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn X) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ X ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ j ∊ fseq (crn X) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ X ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩ $ by and_elim_r [n1]
n4: $ G , z ∊ sgstep T O X , ⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn X) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ X ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ j ∊ fseq (crn X) $ by and_elim_l [n3]
n5: $ G , z ∊ sgstep T O X , ⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn X) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ X ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ X ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩ $ by and_elim_r [n3]
n7: $ G , z ∊ sgstep T O X , ⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn X) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ X ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ szip a j ⊆ X ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩ $ by and_elim_r [n5]
n9: $ G , z ∊ sgstep T O X , ⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn X) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ X ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩ $ by and_elim_r [n7]
n10: $ G , z ∊ sgstep T O X , ⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn X) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ X ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ sig T O $ by weaken [#1]
n11: $ G , z ∊ sgstep T O X , ⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn X) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ X ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ c ∊ ω ∧ k ∊ ω ∧ a ∊ fseq ω $ by sig_entry [n10, n2]
n12: $ G , z ∊ sgstep T O X , ⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn X) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ X ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ c ∊ ω $ by and_elim_l [n11]
n13: $ G , z ∊ sgstep T O X , ⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn X) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ X ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ k ∊ ω ∧ a ∊ fseq ω $ by and_elim_r [n11]
n14: $ G , z ∊ sgstep T O X , ⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn X) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ X ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ k ∊ ω $ by and_elim_l [n13]
n15: $ G , z ∊ sgstep T O X , ⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn X) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ X ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ c , j ⟩ ∈ ω × fseq (crn X) $ by cxp_intro [n12, n4]
n16: $ G , z ∊ sgstep T O X , ⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn X) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ X ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ k ∈ ω $ by welc_wcel [n14]
n17: $ G , z ∊ sgstep T O X , ⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn X) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ X ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩ ∈ ω × (ω × fseq (crn X)) $ by cxp_intro_c [n16, n15]
n18: $ G , z ∊ sgstep T O X , ⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn X) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ X ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩ = z $ by eq_sym [n9]
n19: $ G , z ∊ sgstep T O X , ⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn X) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ X ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ z ∈ ω × (ω × fseq (crn X)) $ by wcel_eq_l [n18, n17]
n20: $ G , z ∊ sgstep T O X , ⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn X) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ X ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ z ∊ ω × (ω × fseq (crn X)) $ by wcel_welc [n19]
e1: $ G , z ∊ sgstep T O X , ∃ j (⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn X) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ X ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩) ⇒ ∃ j (⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn X) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ X ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩) $ by ax
e2: $ G , z ∊ sgstep T O X , ∃ j (⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn X) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ X ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩) ⇒ z ∊ ω × (ω × fseq (crn X)) $ by ex_elim [e1, n20]
e3: $ G , z ∊ sgstep T O X , ∃ a ∃ j (⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn X) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ X ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩) ⇒ ∃ a ∃ j (⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn X) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ X ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩) $ by ax
e4: $ G , z ∊ sgstep T O X , ∃ a ∃ j (⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn X) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ X ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩) ⇒ z ∊ ω × (ω × fseq (crn X)) $ by ex_elim [e3, e2]
e5: $ G , z ∊ sgstep T O X , ∃ k ∃ a ∃ j (⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn X) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ X ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩) ⇒ ∃ k ∃ a ∃ j (⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn X) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ X ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩) $ by ax
e6: $ G , z ∊ sgstep T O X , ∃ k ∃ a ∃ j (⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn X) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ X ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩) ⇒ z ∊ ω × (ω × fseq (crn X)) $ by ex_elim [e5, e4]
e7: $ G , z ∊ sgstep T O X , ∃ c ∃ k ∃ a ∃ j (⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn X) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ X ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩) ⇒ ∃ c ∃ k ∃ a ∃ j (⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn X) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ X ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩) $ by ax
e8: $ G , z ∊ sgstep T O X , ∃ c ∃ k ∃ a ∃ j (⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn X) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ X ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩) ⇒ z ∊ ω × (ω × fseq (crn X)) $ by ex_elim [e7, e6]
p1: $ G , z ∊ sgstep T O X , k ∊ O ∧ i ∊ ω ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ k ∊ O ∧ i ∊ ω ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ $ by ax
p2: $ G , z ∊ sgstep T O X , k ∊ O ∧ i ∊ ω ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ k ∊ O $ by and_elim_l [p1]
p3: $ G , z ∊ sgstep T O X , k ∊ O ∧ i ∊ ω ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ i ∊ ω ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ $ by and_elim_r [p1]
p4: $ G , z ∊ sgstep T O X , k ∊ O ∧ i ∊ ω ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ i ∊ ω $ by and_elim_l [p3]
p5: $ G , z ∊ sgstep T O X , k ∊ O ∧ i ∊ ω ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ $ by and_elim_r [p3]
p6a: $ G , z ∊ sgstep T O X , k ∊ O ∧ i ∊ ω ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ sig T O $ by weaken [#1]
p6: $ G , z ∊ sgstep T O X , k ∊ O ∧ i ∊ ω ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ O ⊆ ω $ by sig_open [p6a]
p7: $ G , z ∊ sgstep T O X , k ∊ O ∧ i ∊ ω ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ k ∊ ω $ by subset_elim [p6, p2]
p8: $ G , z ∊ sgstep T O X , k ∊ O ∧ i ∊ ω ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ k ∈ ω $ by welc_wcel [p7]
p9: $ G , z ∊ sgstep T O X , k ∊ O ∧ i ∊ ω ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ i ∈ ω $ by welc_wcel [p4]
p10: $ G , z ∊ sgstep T O X , k ∊ O ∧ i ∊ ω ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ ∅ ∈ fseq (crn X) $ by fseq_empty
p11: $ G , z ∊ sgstep T O X , k ∊ O ∧ i ∊ ω ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ i , ∅ ⟩ ∈ ω × fseq (crn X) $ by cxp_intro_c [p9, p10]
p12: $ G , z ∊ sgstep T O X , k ∊ O ∧ i ∊ ω ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ ω × (ω × fseq (crn X)) $ by cxp_intro_c [p8, p11]
p13: $ G , z ∊ sgstep T O X , k ∊ O ∧ i ∊ ω ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ = z $ by eq_sym [p5]
p14: $ G , z ∊ sgstep T O X , k ∊ O ∧ i ∊ ω ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ z ∈ ω × (ω × fseq (crn X)) $ by wcel_eq_l [p13, p12]
p15: $ G , z ∊ sgstep T O X , k ∊ O ∧ i ∊ ω ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ z ∊ ω × (ω × fseq (crn X)) $ by wcel_welc [p14]
q1: $ G , z ∊ sgstep T O X , ∃ i (k ∊ O ∧ i ∊ ω ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ∅ ⟩ ⟩) ⇒ ∃ i (k ∊ O ∧ i ∊ ω ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ∅ ⟩ ⟩) $ by ax
q2: $ G , z ∊ sgstep T O X , ∃ i (k ∊ O ∧ i ∊ ω ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ∅ ⟩ ⟩) ⇒ z ∊ ω × (ω × fseq (crn X)) $ by ex_elim [q1, p15]
q3: $ G , z ∊ sgstep T O X , ∃ k ∃ i (k ∊ O ∧ i ∊ ω ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ∅ ⟩ ⟩) ⇒ ∃ k ∃ i (k ∊ O ∧ i ∊ ω ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ∅ ⟩ ⟩) $ by ax
q4: $ G , z ∊ sgstep T O X , ∃ k ∃ i (k ∊ O ∧ i ∊ ω ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ∅ ⟩ ⟩) ⇒ z ∊ ω × (ω × fseq (crn X)) $ by ex_elim [q3, q2]
r1: $ G , z ∊ sgstep T O X ⇒ z ∊ ω × (ω × fseq (crn X)) $ by or_elim [t1, e8, q4]
r2: $ G ⇒ sgstep T O X ⊆ ω × (ω × fseq (crn X)) $ by subset_intro [r1]

sgstep_setop
------------
s1: $ sig T O ⇒ sig T O $ by ax
s2: $ sig T O ⇒ sgstep T O x ⊆ ω × (ω × fseq (crn x)) $ by u1_sgstep_bound [s1]
s3: $ sig T O ⇒ isset ω $ by omega_set
s4: $ sig T O ⇒ isset x $ by isset_var
s5: $ sig T O ⇒ isset (crn x) $ by crn_set [s4]
s6: $ sig T O ⇒ isset (fseq (crn x)) $ by fseq_set [s5]
s7: $ sig T O ⇒ isset (ω × fseq (crn x)) $ by cxp_set [s3, s6]
s8: $ sig T O ⇒ isset (ω × (ω × fseq (crn x))) $ by cxp_set [s3, s7]
s9: $ sig T O ⇒ isset (sgstep T O x) $ by subset_isset [s8, s2]
s10: $ sig T O ⇒ setop x (sgstep T O x) $ by setop_intro [s9]
s11: $ _ ⇒ sig T O → setop x (sgstep T O x) $ by imp_intro [s10]
s12: $ G ⇒ sig T O → setop x (sgstep T O x) $ by weaken [s11]
s13: $ G ⇒ setop x (sgstep T O x) $ by imp_elim [s12, #1]

--| The graph of `y ↦ ⟨ fv a y , fv s y ⟩` on `cdm a` has the zip as its range.
lemma u1_crn_gr {y: set} (G: hyps y) (a s: set):
  $ G ⇒ crn (cres (cgr y ⟨ fv a y , fv s y ⟩) (cdm a)) = szip a s $
----
f0: $ G , w ∊ crn (cres (cgr y ⟨ fv a y , fv s y ⟩) (cdm a)) ⇒ w ∊ crn (cres (cgr y ⟨ fv a y , fv s y ⟩) (cdm a)) $ by ax
f1: $ G , ⟨ x , w ⟩ ∈ (cres (cgr y ⟨ fv a y , fv s y ⟩) (cdm a)) ⇒ ⟨ x , w ⟩ ∈ (cres (cgr y ⟨ fv a y , fv s y ⟩) (cdm a)) $ by ax
f2: $ G , ⟨ x , w ⟩ ∈ (cres (cgr y ⟨ fv a y , fv s y ⟩) (cdm a)) ⇒ x ∊ cdm a ∧ ⟨ x , w ⟩ ∈ cgr y ⟨ fv a y , fv s y ⟩ $ by cres_elim [f1]
f3: $ G , ⟨ x , w ⟩ ∈ (cres (cgr y ⟨ fv a y , fv s y ⟩) (cdm a)) ⇒ x ∊ cdm a $ by and_elim_l [f2]
f4: $ G , ⟨ x , w ⟩ ∈ (cres (cgr y ⟨ fv a y , fv s y ⟩) (cdm a)) ⇒ ⟨ x , w ⟩ ∈ cgr y ⟨ fv a y , fv s y ⟩ $ by and_elim_r [f2]
f5: $ G , ⟨ x , w ⟩ ∈ (cres (cgr y ⟨ fv a y , fv s y ⟩) (cdm a)) ⇒ w = ⟨ fv a x , fv s x ⟩ $ by cgr_elim [f4]
f6: $ G , ⟨ x , w ⟩ ∈ (cres (cgr y ⟨ fv a y , fv s y ⟩) (cdm a)) ⇒ ⟨ fv a x , fv s x ⟩ ∈ szip a s $ by szip_intro [f3]
f7: $ G , ⟨ x , w ⟩ ∈ (cres (cgr y ⟨ fv a y , fv s y ⟩) (cdm a)) ⇒ ⟨ fv a x , fv s x ⟩ = w $ by eq_sym [f5]
f8: $ G , ⟨ x , w ⟩ ∈ (cres (cgr y ⟨ fv a y , fv s y ⟩) (cdm a)) ⇒ w ∈ szip a s $ by wcel_eq_l [f7, f6]
f9: $ G , ⟨ x , w ⟩ ∈ (cres (cgr y ⟨ fv a y , fv s y ⟩) (cdm a)) ⇒ w ∊ szip a s $ by wcel_welc [f8]
f10: $ G , w ∊ crn (cres (cgr y ⟨ fv a y , fv s y ⟩) (cdm a)) ⇒ w ∊ szip a s $ by crn_elim [f0, f9]
b0: $ G , w ∊ szip a s ⇒ w ∊ szip a s $ by ax
b1: $ G , w ∊ szip a s ⇒ ∃ i (i ∊ cdm a ∧ w = ⟨ fv a i , fv s i ⟩) $ by szip_elim [b0]
b2: $ G , i ∊ cdm a ∧ w = ⟨ fv a i , fv s i ⟩ ⇒ i ∊ cdm a ∧ w = ⟨ fv a i , fv s i ⟩ $ by ax
b3: $ G , i ∊ cdm a ∧ w = ⟨ fv a i , fv s i ⟩ ⇒ i ∊ cdm a $ by and_elim_l [b2]
b4: $ G , i ∊ cdm a ∧ w = ⟨ fv a i , fv s i ⟩ ⇒ w = ⟨ fv a i , fv s i ⟩ $ by and_elim_r [b2]
b5: $ G , i ∊ cdm a ∧ w = ⟨ fv a i , fv s i ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ i , w ⟩ ∈ cgr y ⟨ fv a y , fv s y ⟩ $ by cgr_intro [b4]
b6: $ G , i ∊ cdm a ∧ w = ⟨ fv a i , fv s i ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ i , w ⟩ ∈ (cres (cgr y ⟨ fv a y , fv s y ⟩) (cdm a)) $ by cres_intro [b3, b5]
b7: $ G , i ∊ cdm a ∧ w = ⟨ fv a i , fv s i ⟩ ⇒ w ∊ crn (cres (cgr y ⟨ fv a y , fv s y ⟩) (cdm a)) $ by crn_intro [b6]
b8: $ G , w ∊ szip a s ⇒ w ∊ crn (cres (cgr y ⟨ fv a y , fv s y ⟩) (cdm a)) $ by ex_elim [b1, b7]
b9: $ G ⇒ crn (cres (cgr y ⟨ fv a y , fv s y ⟩) (cdm a)) = szip a s $ by eq_intro [f10, b8]

lemma u1_functional_empty (G: hyps): $ G ⇒ functional ∅ $
----
l1: $ G , ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ ∅ , ⟨ x , z ⟩ ∈ ∅ ⇒ ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ ∅ $ by ax
l2: $ G , ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ ∅ , ⟨ x , z ⟩ ∈ ∅ , w = ⟨ x , y ⟩ , w ∊ ∅ ⇒ w ∊ ∅ $ by ax
l3: $ G , ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ ∅ , ⟨ x , z ⟩ ∈ ∅ , w = ⟨ x , y ⟩ , w ∊ ∅ ⇒ ⊥ $ by empty_elim [l2]
l4: $ G , ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ ∅ , ⟨ x , z ⟩ ∈ ∅ ⇒ ⊥ $ by wcel_elim [l1, l3]
l5: $ G , ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ ∅ , ⟨ x , z ⟩ ∈ ∅ ⇒ y = z $ by bot_elim [l4]
l6: $ G ⇒ functional ∅ $ by functional_intro [l5]

lemma u1_crn_empty (G: hyps): $ G ⇒ crn ∅ = ∅ $
----
l1: $ G , y ∊ crn ∅ ⇒ y ∊ crn ∅ $ by ax
l2: $ G , ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ ∅ ⇒ ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ ∅ $ by ax
l3: $ G , ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ ∅ , w = ⟨ x , y ⟩ , w ∊ ∅ ⇒ w ∊ ∅ $ by ax
l4: $ G , ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ ∅ , w = ⟨ x , y ⟩ , w ∊ ∅ ⇒ ⊥ $ by empty_elim [l3]
l5: $ G , ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ ∅ ⇒ ⊥ $ by wcel_elim [l2, l4]
l6: $ G , y ∊ crn ∅ ⇒ ⊥ $ by crn_elim [l1, l5]
l7: $ G ⇒ crn ∅ = ∅ $ by empty_eq_intro [l6]

sgstep_cont
-----------
k0: $ G , z ∊ sgstep T O u ⇒ z ∊ sgstep T O u $ by ax
k1: $ G , z ∊ sgstep T O u ⇒ ∃ c ∃ k ∃ a ∃ j (⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn u) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ u ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩) ∨ ∃ k ∃ i (k ∊ O ∧ i ∊ ω ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ∅ ⟩ ⟩) $ by sgstep_elim [k0]
n1: $ G , z ∊ sgstep T O u , ⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn u) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ u ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn u) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ u ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩ $ by ax
n2: $ G , z ∊ sgstep T O u , ⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn u) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ u ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T $ by and_elim_l [n1]
n3: $ G , z ∊ sgstep T O u , ⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn u) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ u ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ j ∊ fseq (crn u) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ u ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩ $ by and_elim_r [n1]
n4: $ G , z ∊ sgstep T O u , ⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn u) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ u ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ j ∊ fseq (crn u) $ by and_elim_l [n3]
n5: $ G , z ∊ sgstep T O u , ⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn u) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ u ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ u ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩ $ by and_elim_r [n3]
n6: $ G , z ∊ sgstep T O u , ⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn u) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ u ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ cdm j = cdm a $ by and_elim_l [n5]
n7: $ G , z ∊ sgstep T O u , ⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn u) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ u ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ szip a j ⊆ u ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩ $ by and_elim_r [n5]
n8: $ G , z ∊ sgstep T O u , ⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn u) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ u ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ szip a j ⊆ u $ by and_elim_l [n7]
n9: $ G , z ∊ sgstep T O u , ⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn u) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ u ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩ $ by and_elim_r [n7]
n10: $ G , z ∊ sgstep T O u , ⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn u) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ u ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ functional (cgr y ⟨ fv a y , fv j y ⟩) $ by cgr_functional
n11: $ G , z ∊ sgstep T O u , ⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn u) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ u ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ functional (cres (cgr y ⟨ fv a y , fv j y ⟩) (cdm a)) $ by functional_cres [n10]
n12a: $ G , z ∊ sgstep T O u , ⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn u) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ u ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ isset a $ by isset_var
n12: $ G , z ∊ sgstep T O u , ⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn u) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ u ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ isset (cdm a) $ by cdm_set [n12a]
n13: $ G , z ∊ sgstep T O u , ⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn u) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ u ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ isset (cres (cgr y ⟨ fv a y , fv j y ⟩) (cdm a)) $ by cres_set [n10, n12]
g1: $ G , z ∊ sgstep T O u , ⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn u) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ u ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩ , g = (cres (cgr y ⟨ fv a y , fv j y ⟩) (cdm a)) ⇒ g = (cres (cgr y ⟨ fv a y , fv j y ⟩) (cdm a)) $ by ax
g2: $ G , z ∊ sgstep T O u , ⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn u) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ u ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩ , g = (cres (cgr y ⟨ fv a y , fv j y ⟩) (cdm a)) ⇒ (cres (cgr y ⟨ fv a y , fv j y ⟩) (cdm a)) = g $ by eq_sym [g1]
