g22: $ G , z ∊ sgstep T O u , ⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn u) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ u ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩ , g = (cres (cgr y ⟨ fv a y , fv j y ⟩) (cdm a)) ⇒ crn g ⊆ u ∧ z ∊ cap x (sgstep T O x) (crn g) $ by and_intro [g20, g21]
g23: $ G , z ∊ sgstep T O u , ⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn u) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ u ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩ , g = (cres (cgr y ⟨ fv a y , fv j y ⟩) (cdm a)) ⇒ cdm g ⊆ ω ∧ crn g ⊆ u ∧ z ∊ cap x (sgstep T O x) (crn g) $ by and_intro [g14, g22]
g24: $ G , z ∊ sgstep T O u , ⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn u) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ u ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩ , g = (cres (cgr y ⟨ fv a y , fv j y ⟩) (cdm a)) ⇒ functional g ∧ cdm g ⊆ ω ∧ crn g ⊆ u ∧ z ∊ cap x (sgstep T O x) (crn g) $ by and_intro [g3, g23]
g25: $ G , z ∊ sgstep T O u , ⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn u) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ u ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩ , g = (cres (cgr y ⟨ fv a y , fv j y ⟩) (cdm a)) ⇒ ∃ f (functional f ∧ cdm f ⊆ ω ∧ crn f ⊆ u ∧ z ∊ cap x (sgstep T O x) (crn f)) $ by ex_intro [g24]
