v3: $ G , z ∊ sgstep T O u , k ∊ O ∧ i ∊ ω ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ , g = ∅ , v = crn g ⇒ i ∊ ω $ by weaken [p4]
