q1: $ G , z ∊ sgstep T O u , ∃ i (k ∊ O ∧ i ∊ ω ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ∅ ⟩ ⟩) ⇒ ∃ i (k ∊ O ∧ i ∊ ω ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ∅ ⟩ ⟩) $ by ax
q2: $ G , z ∊ sgstep T O u , ∃ i (k ∊ O ∧ i ∊ ω ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ∅ ⟩ ⟩) ⇒ ∃ f (functional f ∧ cdm f ⊆ ω ∧ crn f ⊆ u ∧ z ∊ cap x (sgstep T O x) (crn f)) $ by ex_elim [q1, p6]
q3: $ G , z ∊ sgstep T O u , ∃ k ∃ i (k ∊ O ∧ i ∊ ω ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ∅ ⟩ ⟩) ⇒ ∃ k ∃ i (k ∊ O ∧ i ∊ ω ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ∅ ⟩ ⟩) $ by ax
q4: $ G , z ∊ sgstep T O u , ∃ k ∃ i (k ∊ O ∧ i ∊ ω ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ∅ ⟩ ⟩) ⇒ ∃ f (functional f ∧ cdm f ⊆ ω ∧ crn f ⊆ u ∧ z ∊ cap x (sgstep T O x) (crn f)) $ by ex_elim [q3, q2]
r1: $ G , z ∊ sgstep T O u ⇒ ∃ f (functional f ∧ cdm f ⊆ ω ∧ crn f ⊆ u ∧ z ∊ cap x (sgstep T O x) (crn f)) $ by or_elim [k1, e8, q4]
r2: $ G ⇒ cont x (sgstep T O x) ω $ by cont_intro [r1]

--| The range of a subclass of a product lies in the second factor.
lemma u1_crn_sub_cxp (G: hyps) (X A B: class): $ G ⇒ X ⊆ A × B $ > $ G ⇒ crn X ⊆ B $
----
l1: $ G , y ∊ crn X ⇒ y ∊ crn X $ by ax
l2: $ G , ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ X ⇒ ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ X $ by ax
l3: $ G , ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ X ⇒ X ⊆ A × B $ by weaken [#1]
l4: $ G , ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ X ⇒ ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ A × B $ by wcel_subset [l3, l2]
l5: $ G , ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ X ⇒ x ∊ A ∧ y ∊ B $ by cxp_elim_pair [l4]
l6: $ G , ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ X ⇒ y ∊ B $ by and_elim_r [l5]
l7: $ G , y ∊ crn X ⇒ y ∊ B $ by crn_elim [l1, l6]
l8: $ G ⇒ crn X ⊆ B $ by subset_intro [l7]

--| `trees_intro` at the labels `ω` (a class, named by a variable).
lemma u1_trees_intro_om (G: hyps) (k j: set):
  $ G ⇒ k ∊ ω $ > $ G ⇒ j ∊ fseq (trees ω) $ > $ G ⇒ ⟨ k , j ⟩ ∈ trees ω $
----
l1: $ G ⇒ isset ω $ by omega_set
l2: $ G , b = ω ⇒ b = ω $ by ax
l3: $ G , b = ω ⇒ ω = b $ by eq_sym [l2]
l4: $ G , b = ω ⇒ k ∊ ω $ by weaken [#1]
l5: $ G , b = ω ⇒ k ∊ b $ by welc_eq [l3, l4]
l6: $ G , b = ω ⇒ trees ω = trees b $ by trees_eq [l3]
l7: $ G , b = ω ⇒ fseq (trees ω) = fseq (trees b) $ by fseq_eq [l6]
l8: $ G , b = ω ⇒ j ∊ fseq (trees ω) $ by weaken [#2]
l9: $ G , b = ω ⇒ j ∊ fseq (trees b) $ by welc_eq [l7, l8]
l10: $ G , b = ω ⇒ ⟨ k , j ⟩ ∈ trees b $ by trees_intro [l5, l9]
l11: $ G , b = ω ⇒ trees b = trees ω $ by trees_eq [l2]
l12: $ G , b = ω ⇒ ⟨ k , j ⟩ ∈ trees ω $ by wcel_eq_r [l11, l10]
l13: $ G ⇒ ⟨ k , j ⟩ ∈ trees ω $ by isset_elim [l1, l12]

--| A leaf `⟨ i , ∅ ⟩` with `i ∊ ω` is a tree over `ω`.
lemma u1_trees_leaf_om (G: hyps) (i: set): $ G ⇒ i ∊ ω $ > $ G ⇒ ⟨ i , ∅ ⟩ ∈ trees ω $
----
l1: $ G ⇒ isset ∅ $ by ax_empty
l2: $ G , g = ∅ ⇒ g = ∅ $ by ax
l3: $ G , g = ∅ ⇒ ∅ = g $ by eq_sym [l2]
l4: $ G , g = ∅ ⇒ ∅ ∈ fseq (trees ω) $ by fseq_empty
l5: $ G , g = ∅ ⇒ g ∈ fseq (trees ω) $ by wcel_eq_l [l3, l4]
l6: $ G , g = ∅ ⇒ g ∊ fseq (trees ω) $ by wcel_welc [l5]
l7: $ G , g = ∅ ⇒ i ∊ ω $ by weaken [#1]
l8: $ G , g = ∅ ⇒ ⟨ i , g ⟩ ∈ trees ω $ by u1_trees_intro_om [l7, l6]
l9: $ G , g = ∅ ⇒ i = i $ by eq_refl
l10: $ G , g = ∅ ⇒ ⟨ i , g ⟩ = ⟨ i , ∅ ⟩ $ by opair_eq [l9, l2]
l11: $ G , g = ∅ ⇒ ⟨ i , ∅ ⟩ ∈ trees ω $ by wcel_eq_l [l10, l8]
l12: $ G ⇒ ⟨ i , ∅ ⟩ ∈ trees ω $ by isset_elim [l1, l11]

sgstep_trees
------------
t0: $ G , z ∊ sgstep T O X ⇒ z ∊ sgstep T O X $ by ax
t1: $ G , z ∊ sgstep T O X ⇒ ∃ c ∃ k ∃ a ∃ j (⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn X) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ X ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩) ∨ ∃ k ∃ i (k ∊ O ∧ i ∊ ω ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ∅ ⟩ ⟩) $ by sgstep_elim [t0]
n1: $ G , z ∊ sgstep T O X , ⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn X) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ X ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn X) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ X ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩ $ by ax
n2: $ G , z ∊ sgstep T O X , ⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn X) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ X ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T $ by and_elim_l [n1]
n3: $ G , z ∊ sgstep T O X , ⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn X) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ X ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ j ∊ fseq (crn X) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ X ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩ $ by and_elim_r [n1]
n4: $ G , z ∊ sgstep T O X , ⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn X) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ X ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ j ∊ fseq (crn X) $ by and_elim_l [n3]
n5: $ G , z ∊ sgstep T O X , ⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn X) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ X ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ X ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩ $ by and_elim_r [n3]
n7: $ G , z ∊ sgstep T O X , ⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn X) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ X ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ szip a j ⊆ X ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩ $ by and_elim_r [n5]
n9: $ G , z ∊ sgstep T O X , ⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn X) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ X ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩ $ by and_elim_r [n7]
n10: $ G , z ∊ sgstep T O X , ⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn X) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ X ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ sig T O $ by weaken [#1]
n11: $ G , z ∊ sgstep T O X , ⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn X) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ X ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ c ∊ ω ∧ k ∊ ω ∧ a ∊ fseq ω $ by sig_entry [n10, n2]
n12: $ G , z ∊ sgstep T O X , ⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn X) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ X ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ c ∊ ω $ by and_elim_l [n11]
n13: $ G , z ∊ sgstep T O X , ⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn X) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ X ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ k ∊ ω ∧ a ∊ fseq ω $ by and_elim_r [n11]
n14: $ G , z ∊ sgstep T O X , ⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn X) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ X ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ k ∊ ω $ by and_elim_l [n13]
n15a: $ G , z ∊ sgstep T O X , ⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn X) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ X ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ X ⊆ ω × trees ω $ by weaken [#2]
n15b: $ G , z ∊ sgstep T O X , ⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn X) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ X ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ crn X ⊆ trees ω $ by u1_crn_sub_cxp [n15a]
n15c: $ G , z ∊ sgstep T O X , ⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn X) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ X ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ fseq (crn X) ⊆ fseq (trees ω) $ by fseq_mono [n15b]
n15: $ G , z ∊ sgstep T O X , ⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn X) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ X ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ j ∊ fseq (trees ω) $ by subset_elim [n15c, n4]
n16: $ G , z ∊ sgstep T O X , ⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn X) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ X ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ c , j ⟩ ∈ trees ω $ by u1_trees_intro_om [n12, n15]
n16b: $ G , z ∊ sgstep T O X , ⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn X) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ X ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ k ∈ ω $ by welc_wcel [n14]
n17: $ G , z ∊ sgstep T O X , ⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn X) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ X ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩ ∈ ω × trees ω $ by cxp_intro_c [n16b, n16]
n18: $ G , z ∊ sgstep T O X , ⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn X) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ X ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩ = z $ by eq_sym [n9]
n19: $ G , z ∊ sgstep T O X , ⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn X) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ X ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ z ∈ ω × trees ω $ by wcel_eq_l [n18, n17]
n20: $ G , z ∊ sgstep T O X , ⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn X) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ X ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ z ∊ ω × trees ω $ by wcel_welc [n19]
e1: $ G , z ∊ sgstep T O X , ∃ j (⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn X) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ X ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩) ⇒ ∃ j (⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn X) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ X ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩) $ by ax
e2: $ G , z ∊ sgstep T O X , ∃ j (⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn X) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ X ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩) ⇒ z ∊ ω × trees ω $ by ex_elim [e1, n20]
e3: $ G , z ∊ sgstep T O X , ∃ a ∃ j (⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn X) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ X ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩) ⇒ ∃ a ∃ j (⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn X) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ X ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩) $ by ax
e4: $ G , z ∊ sgstep T O X , ∃ a ∃ j (⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn X) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ X ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩) ⇒ z ∊ ω × trees ω $ by ex_elim [e3, e2]
e5: $ G , z ∊ sgstep T O X , ∃ k ∃ a ∃ j (⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn X) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ X ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩) ⇒ ∃ k ∃ a ∃ j (⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn X) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ X ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩) $ by ax
e6: $ G , z ∊ sgstep T O X , ∃ k ∃ a ∃ j (⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn X) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ X ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩) ⇒ z ∊ ω × trees ω $ by ex_elim [e5, e4]
e7: $ G , z ∊ sgstep T O X , ∃ c ∃ k ∃ a ∃ j (⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn X) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ X ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩) ⇒ ∃ c ∃ k ∃ a ∃ j (⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn X) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ X ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩) $ by ax
e8: $ G , z ∊ sgstep T O X , ∃ c ∃ k ∃ a ∃ j (⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ j ∊ fseq (crn X) ∧ cdm j = cdm a ∧ szip a j ⊆ X ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ c , j ⟩ ⟩) ⇒ z ∊ ω × trees ω $ by ex_elim [e7, e6]
p1: $ G , z ∊ sgstep T O X , k ∊ O ∧ i ∊ ω ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ k ∊ O ∧ i ∊ ω ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ $ by ax
p2: $ G , z ∊ sgstep T O X , k ∊ O ∧ i ∊ ω ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ k ∊ O $ by and_elim_l [p1]
p3: $ G , z ∊ sgstep T O X , k ∊ O ∧ i ∊ ω ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ i ∊ ω ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ $ by and_elim_r [p1]
p4: $ G , z ∊ sgstep T O X , k ∊ O ∧ i ∊ ω ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ i ∊ ω $ by and_elim_l [p3]
p5: $ G , z ∊ sgstep T O X , k ∊ O ∧ i ∊ ω ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ $ by and_elim_r [p3]
p6a: $ G , z ∊ sgstep T O X , k ∊ O ∧ i ∊ ω ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ sig T O $ by weaken [#1]
p6: $ G , z ∊ sgstep T O X , k ∊ O ∧ i ∊ ω ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ O ⊆ ω $ by sig_open [p6a]
p7: $ G , z ∊ sgstep T O X , k ∊ O ∧ i ∊ ω ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ k ∊ ω $ by subset_elim [p6, p2]
p8: $ G , z ∊ sgstep T O X , k ∊ O ∧ i ∊ ω ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ k ∈ ω $ by welc_wcel [p7]
p11: $ G , z ∊ sgstep T O X , k ∊ O ∧ i ∊ ω ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ i , ∅ ⟩ ∈ trees ω $ by u1_trees_leaf_om [p4]
p12: $ G , z ∊ sgstep T O X , k ∊ O ∧ i ∊ ω ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ ω × trees ω $ by cxp_intro_c [p8, p11]
p13: $ G , z ∊ sgstep T O X , k ∊ O ∧ i ∊ ω ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ = z $ by eq_sym [p5]
p14: $ G , z ∊ sgstep T O X , k ∊ O ∧ i ∊ ω ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ z ∈ ω × trees ω $ by wcel_eq_l [p13, p12]
p15: $ G , z ∊ sgstep T O X , k ∊ O ∧ i ∊ ω ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ z ∊ ω × trees ω $ by wcel_welc [p14]
q1: $ G , z ∊ sgstep T O X , ∃ i (k ∊ O ∧ i ∊ ω ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ∅ ⟩ ⟩) ⇒ ∃ i (k ∊ O ∧ i ∊ ω ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ∅ ⟩ ⟩) $ by ax
q2: $ G , z ∊ sgstep T O X , ∃ i (k ∊ O ∧ i ∊ ω ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ∅ ⟩ ⟩) ⇒ z ∊ ω × trees ω $ by ex_elim [q1, p15]
q3: $ G , z ∊ sgstep T O X , ∃ k ∃ i (k ∊ O ∧ i ∊ ω ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ∅ ⟩ ⟩) ⇒ ∃ k ∃ i (k ∊ O ∧ i ∊ ω ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ∅ ⟩ ⟩) $ by ax
q4: $ G , z ∊ sgstep T O X , ∃ k ∃ i (k ∊ O ∧ i ∊ ω ∧ z = ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ∅ ⟩ ⟩) ⇒ z ∊ ω × trees ω $ by ex_elim [q3, q2]
r1: $ G , z ∊ sgstep T O X ⇒ z ∊ ω × trees ω $ by or_elim [t1, e8, q4]
r2: $ G ⇒ sgstep T O X ⊆ ω × trees ω $ by subset_intro [r1]

sorted_congr
------------
l0: $ cv x ≐ cv x $ by ceqt_refl
l1: $ sgstep A C x ≐ sgstep B D x $ by sgstep_congr [#1, #2, l0]
l2: $ lfp x (sgstep A C x) ≐ lfp x (sgstep B D x) $ by lfp_congr [l1]

--| The sorting operator at equal signatures, elementwise.
lemma u2_cap_sg_sub {x: set} (G: hyps) (A B C D Y: class) (y: set):
  $ G ⇒ A = B $ > $ G ⇒ C = D $ > $ G , y ∊ cap x (sgstep A C x) Y ⇒ y ∊ cap x (sgstep B D x) Y $
----
c1: $ G , y ∊ cap x (sgstep A C x) Y ⇒ y ∊ cap x (sgstep A C x) Y $ by ax
c2: $ G , y ∊ cap x (sgstep A C x) Y ⇒ isset Y $ by cap_elim_isset [c1]
c3: $ G , y ∊ cap x (sgstep A C x) Y , u = Y ⇒ u = Y $ by ax
c4: $ G , y ∊ cap x (sgstep A C x) Y , u = Y ⇒ cap x (sgstep A C x) Y = sgstep A C u $ by cap_eq [c3]
c5: $ G , y ∊ cap x (sgstep A C x) Y , u = Y ⇒ y ∊ cap x (sgstep A C x) Y $ by ax
c6: $ G , y ∊ cap x (sgstep A C x) Y , u = Y ⇒ y ∊ sgstep A C u $ by welc_eq [c4, c5]
c7: $ G , y ∊ cap x (sgstep A C x) Y , u = Y ⇒ A = B $ by weaken [#1]
c8: $ G , y ∊ cap x (sgstep A C x) Y , u = Y ⇒ C = D $ by weaken [#2]
c9: $ G , y ∊ cap x (sgstep A C x) Y , u = Y ⇒ cv u = cv u $ by eq_refl
c10: $ G , y ∊ cap x (sgstep A C x) Y , u = Y ⇒ sgstep A C u = sgstep B D u $ by sgstep_eq [c7, c8, c9]
c11: $ G , y ∊ cap x (sgstep A C x) Y , u = Y ⇒ y ∊ sgstep B D u $ by welc_eq [c10, c6]
c12: $ G , y ∊ cap x (sgstep A C x) Y , u = Y ⇒ y ∊ cap x (sgstep B D x) Y $ by cap_intro [c3, c11]
c13: $ G , y ∊ cap x (sgstep A C x) Y ⇒ y ∊ cap x (sgstep B D x) Y $ by isset_elim [c2, c12]

lemma u2_cap_sg_eq {x: set} (G: hyps) (A B C D Y: class):
  $ G ⇒ A = B $ > $ G ⇒ C = D $ > $ G ⇒ cap x (sgstep A C x) Y = cap x (sgstep B D x) Y $
----
d1: $ G , y ∊ cap x (sgstep A C x) Y ⇒ y ∊ cap x (sgstep B D x) Y $ by u2_cap_sg_sub [#1, #2]
d2: $ G ⇒ B = A $ by eq_sym [#1]
d3: $ G ⇒ D = C $ by eq_sym [#2]
d4: $ G , y ∊ cap x (sgstep B D x) Y ⇒ y ∊ cap x (sgstep A C x) Y $ by u2_cap_sg_sub [d2, d3]
d5: $ G ⇒ cap x (sgstep A C x) Y = cap x (sgstep B D x) Y $ by eq_intro [d1, d4]

--| `sorted` at equal signatures, elementwise.
lemma u2_sorted_sub (G: hyps) (A B C D: class) (y: set):
  $ G ⇒ A = B $ > $ G ⇒ C = D $ > $ G , y ∊ sorted A C ⇒ y ∊ sorted B D $
----
s1: $ G ⇒ cap x (sgstep A C x) (⋃ (crn g)) = cap x (sgstep B D x) (⋃ (crn g)) $ by u2_cap_sg_eq [#1, #2]
s2: $ G ⇒ ∀ g (cap x (sgstep A C x) (⋃ (crn g)) = cap x (sgstep B D x) (⋃ (crn g))) $ by all_intro [s1]
s3: $ G ⇒ cgr g (cap x (sgstep A C x) (⋃ (crn g))) = cgr g (cap x (sgstep B D x) (⋃ (crn g))) $ by cgr_eq [s2]
s6: $ G ⇒ trec (cgr g (cap x (sgstep A C x) (⋃ (crn g)))) = trec (cgr g (cap x (sgstep B D x) (⋃ (crn g)))) $ by trec_eq_cong [s3]
t1: $ G , y ∊ lfp x (sgstep A C x) ⇒ y ∊ lfp x (sgstep A C x) $ by ax
t2: $ G , y ∊ lfp x (sgstep A C x) ⇒ ∃ a (ord a ∧ y ∊ fv (stg x (sgstep A C x)) a) $ by lfp_elim [t1]
t3: $ G , ord a ∧ y ∊ fv (stg x (sgstep A C x)) a ⇒ ord a ∧ y ∊ fv (stg x (sgstep A C x)) a $ by ax
t4: $ G , ord a ∧ y ∊ fv (stg x (sgstep A C x)) a ⇒ ord a $ by and_elim_l [t3]
t5: $ G , ord a ∧ y ∊ fv (stg x (sgstep A C x)) a ⇒ y ∊ fv (stg x (sgstep A C x)) a $ by and_elim_r [t3]
t6: $ G , ord a ∧ y ∊ fv (stg x (sgstep A C x)) a ⇒ stg x (sgstep A C x) = stg x (sgstep B D x) $ by weaken [s6]
t7: $ G , ord a ∧ y ∊ fv (stg x (sgstep A C x)) a ⇒ a = a $ by eq_refl
t8: $ G , ord a ∧ y ∊ fv (stg x (sgstep A C x)) a ⇒ fv (stg x (sgstep A C x)) a = fv (stg x (sgstep B D x)) a $ by fv_eq [t6, t7]
t9: $ G , ord a ∧ y ∊ fv (stg x (sgstep A C x)) a ⇒ y ∊ fv (stg x (sgstep B D x)) a $ by welc_eq [t8, t5]
t10: $ G , ord a ∧ y ∊ fv (stg x (sgstep A C x)) a ⇒ y ∊ lfp x (sgstep B D x) $ by lfp_intro [t4, t9]
t11: $ G , y ∊ lfp x (sgstep A C x) ⇒ y ∊ lfp x (sgstep B D x) $ by ex_elim [t2, t10]

sorted_eq
---------
l1: $ G , y ∊ sorted A C ⇒ y ∊ sorted B D $ by u2_sorted_sub [#1, #2]
l2: $ G ⇒ B = A $ by eq_sym [#1]
l3: $ G ⇒ D = C $ by eq_sym [#2]
l4: $ G , y ∊ sorted B D ⇒ y ∊ sorted A C $ by u2_sorted_sub [l2, l3]
l5: $ G ⇒ sorted A C = sorted B D $ by eq_intro [l1, l4]

sb_c_sorted
-----------
l1: $ (⟦ x / t ⟧ (lfp y (sgstep A B y))) ≐ lfp y (sgstep (⟦ x / t ⟧ A) (⟦ x / t ⟧ B) y) $ by ceqt_refl

--| The sorting operator is continuous at a name of `ω`.
lemma u2_sg_cont {x: set} (G: hyps x) (T O: class) (w: set):
  $ G ⇒ w = ω $ > $ G ⇒ cont x (sgstep T O x) w $
----
f3: $ G ⇒ cont x (sgstep T O x) ω $ by sgstep_cont
f6: $ G ⇒ ω = w $ by eq_sym [#1]
f7: $ G ⇒ ω ⊆ w $ by eq_subset [f6]
f8: $ G ⇒ cont x (sgstep T O x) w $ by cont_mono_index [f3, f7]

sorted_fix
----------
f0: $ G , w = ω ⇒ sig T O $ by weaken [#1]
f1: $ G , w = ω ⇒ mono x (sgstep T O x) $ by sgstep_mono
f2: $ G , w = ω ⇒ setop x (sgstep T O x) $ by sgstep_setop [f0]
f5: $ G , w = ω ⇒ w = ω $ by ax
f8: $ G , w = ω ⇒ cont x (sgstep T O x) w $ by u2_sg_cont [f5]
f9: $ G , w = ω ⇒ cap x (sgstep T O x) (sorted T O) = sorted T O $ by lfp_cont_fix [f1, f2, f8]
f10: $ G , w = ω ⇒ isset (sorted T O) $ by lfp_cont_set [f1, f2, f8]
g1: $ G , w = ω , a = sorted T O ⇒ a = sorted T O $ by ax
g2: $ G , w = ω , a = sorted T O ⇒ cap x (sgstep T O x) (sorted T O) = sgstep T O a $ by cap_eq [g1]
g3: $ G , w = ω , a = sorted T O ⇒ sgstep T O a = cap x (sgstep T O x) (sorted T O) $ by eq_sym [g2]
g4: $ G , w = ω , a = sorted T O ⇒ cap x (sgstep T O x) (sorted T O) = sorted T O $ by weaken [f9]
g5: $ G , w = ω , a = sorted T O ⇒ sgstep T O a = sorted T O $ by eq_trans [g3, g4]
g6: $ G , w = ω , a = sorted T O ⇒ sorted T O = a $ by eq_sym [g1]
g7: $ G , w = ω , a = sorted T O ⇒ T = T $ by eq_refl
g8: $ G , w = ω , a = sorted T O ⇒ O = O $ by eq_refl
g9: $ G , w = ω , a = sorted T O ⇒ sgstep T O (sorted T O) = sgstep T O a $ by sgstep_eq [g7, g8, g6]
g10: $ G , w = ω , a = sorted T O ⇒ sgstep T O (sorted T O) = sorted T O $ by eq_trans [g9, g5]
g11: $ G , w = ω ⇒ sgstep T O (sorted T O) = sorted T O $ by isset_elim [f10, g10]
f4: $ G ⇒ isset ω $ by omega_set
g12: $ G ⇒ sgstep T O (sorted T O) = sorted T O $ by isset_elim [f4, g11]

sorted_set
----------
f0: $ G , w = ω ⇒ sig T O $ by weaken [#1]
f1: $ G , w = ω ⇒ mono x (sgstep T O x) $ by sgstep_mono
f2: $ G , w = ω ⇒ setop x (sgstep T O x) $ by sgstep_setop [f0]
f5: $ G , w = ω ⇒ w = ω $ by ax
f8: $ G , w = ω ⇒ cont x (sgstep T O x) w $ by u2_sg_cont [f5]
f10: $ G , w = ω ⇒ isset (sorted T O) $ by lfp_cont_set [f1, f2, f8]
f4: $ G ⇒ isset ω $ by omega_set
f11: $ G ⇒ isset (sorted T O) $ by isset_elim [f4, f10]

sorted_sub
----------
b0: $ G , u ⊆ ω × trees ω ⇒ sig T O $ by weaken [#1]
b1: $ G , u ⊆ ω × trees ω ⇒ u ⊆ ω × trees ω $ by ax
b2: $ G , u ⊆ ω × trees ω ⇒ sgstep T O u ⊆ ω × trees ω $ by sgstep_trees [b0, b1]
b3: $ G ⇒ bounded x (sgstep T O x) (ω × trees ω) $ by bounded_intro [b2]
b4: $ G ⇒ setop x (sgstep T O x) $ by sgstep_setop [#1]
b5: $ G ⇒ sorted T O ⊆ ω × trees ω $ by lfp_bounded [b3, b4]

--| The range of a product is in its second factor.
lemma u2_crn_cxp_sub (G: hyps) (A B: class): $ G ⇒ crn (A × B) ⊆ B $
----
r1: $ G , y ∊ crn (A × B) ⇒ y ∊ crn (A × B) $ by ax
r2: $ G , ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ A × B ⇒ ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ A × B $ by ax
r3: $ G , ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ A × B ⇒ x ∊ A ∧ y ∊ B $ by cxp_elim_pair [r2]
r4: $ G , ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ A × B ⇒ y ∊ B $ by and_elim_r [r3]
r5: $ G , y ∊ crn (A × B) ⇒ y ∊ B $ by crn_elim [r1, r4]
r6: $ G ⇒ crn (A × B) ⊆ B $ by subset_intro [r5]

--| The trees of the sorted pairs are trees of `ω`.
lemma u2_crn_sorted (G: hyps) (T O: class): $ G ⇒ sig T O $ > $ G ⇒ crn (sorted T O) ⊆ trees ω $
----
m1: $ G ⇒ sorted T O ⊆ ω × trees ω $ by sorted_sub [#1]
m2: $ G ⇒ crn (sorted T O) ⊆ crn (ω × trees ω) $ by crn_mono [m1]
m3: $ G ⇒ crn (ω × trees ω) ⊆ trees ω $ by u2_crn_cxp_sub
m4: $ G ⇒ crn (sorted T O) ⊆ trees ω $ by subset_trans [m2, m3]

sorted_node
-----------
n1: $ G ⇒ functional s $ by fseq_functional [#3]
n2: $ G ⇒ rel s $ by fseq_rel [#3]
n3: $ G ⇒ cdm s ∈ ω $ by fseq_len [#3]
n4: $ G ⇒ cdm a = cdm s $ by eq_sym [#4]
n5: $ G ⇒ crn (szip a s) = crn s $ by crn_szip [#3, n4]
n6: $ G ⇒ crn (szip a s) ⊆ crn (sorted T O) $ by crn_mono [#5]
n7: $ G ⇒ crn s ⊆ crn (sorted T O) $ by subset_eq_l [n5, n6]
n8: $ G ⇒ s ∊ fseq (crn (sorted T O)) $ by fseq_of_fn [n1, n2, n3, n7]
n9: $ G ⇒ ⟨ k , ⟨ c , s ⟩ ⟩ ∈ sgstep T O (sorted T O) $ by sgstep_node [#2, n8, #4, #5]
n10: $ G ⇒ sgstep T O (sorted T O) = sorted T O $ by sorted_fix [#1]
n11: $ G ⇒ ⟨ k , ⟨ c , s ⟩ ⟩ ∈ sorted T O $ by wcel_eq_r [n10, n9]

sorted_leaf
-----------
n9: $ G ⇒ ⟨ k , ⟨ n , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ sgstep T O (sorted T O) $ by sgstep_leaf [#2, #3]
n10: $ G ⇒ sgstep T O (sorted T O) = sorted T O $ by sorted_fix [#1]
n11: $ G ⇒ ⟨ k , ⟨ n , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ sorted T O $ by wcel_eq_r [n10, n9]

--| `sorted_elim`, the constructor case.
lemma u2_elim_node {c a s: set} (G: hyps) (T O: class) (k t i j f g: set):
  $ G ⇒ sig T O $ > $ G ⇒ ⟨ k , t ⟩ = ⟨ j , ⟨ i , g ⟩ ⟩ $ > $ G ⇒ ⟨ i , ⟨ j , f ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T $ >
  $ G ⇒ g ∊ fseq (crn (sorted T O)) $ > $ G ⇒ cdm g = cdm f $ > $ G ⇒ szip f g ⊆ sorted T O $ >
  $ G ⇒ ∃ c ∃ a ∃ s (⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ s ∊ fseq (trees ω) ∧ cdm s = cdm a ∧ szip a s ⊆ sorted T O ∧ t = ⟨ c , s ⟩) $
----
p0: $ G ⇒ isset k $ by isset_var
p0a: $ G ⇒ isset t $ by isset_var
p0b: $ G ⇒ isset j $ by isset_var
p0c: $ G ⇒ isset ⟨ i , g ⟩ $ by opair_isset
p1: $ G ⇒ k = j ∧ t = ⟨ i , g ⟩ $ by opair_inj_c [#2, p0, p0a, p0b, p0c]
p2: $ G ⇒ k = j $ by and_elim_l [p1]
p3: $ G ⇒ t = ⟨ i , g ⟩ $ by and_elim_r [p1]
p4: $ G ⇒ j = k $ by eq_sym [p2]
p4a: $ G ⇒ f = f $ by eq_refl
p4b: $ G ⇒ i = i $ by eq_refl
p5: $ G ⇒ ⟨ j , f ⟩ = ⟨ k , f ⟩ $ by opair_eq [p4, p4a]
p6: $ G ⇒ ⟨ i , ⟨ j , f ⟩ ⟩ = ⟨ i , ⟨ k , f ⟩ ⟩ $ by opair_eq [p4b, p5]
p7: $ G ⇒ ⟨ i , ⟨ k , f ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T $ by wcel_eq_l [p6, #3]
p8: $ G ⇒ crn (sorted T O) ⊆ trees ω $ by u2_crn_sorted [#1]
p9: $ G ⇒ fseq (crn (sorted T O)) ⊆ fseq (trees ω) $ by fseq_mono [p8]
p10: $ G ⇒ g ∊ fseq (trees ω) $ by subset_elim [p9, #4]
p11: $ G ⇒ szip f g ⊆ sorted T O ∧ t = ⟨ i , g ⟩ $ by and_intro [#6, p3]
p12: $ G ⇒ cdm g = cdm f ∧ szip f g ⊆ sorted T O ∧ t = ⟨ i , g ⟩ $ by and_intro [#5, p11]
p13: $ G ⇒ g ∊ fseq (trees ω) ∧ cdm g = cdm f ∧ szip f g ⊆ sorted T O ∧ t = ⟨ i , g ⟩ $ by and_intro [p10, p12]
p14: $ G ⇒ ⟨ i , ⟨ k , f ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ g ∊ fseq (trees ω) ∧ cdm g = cdm f ∧ szip f g ⊆ sorted T O ∧ t = ⟨ i , g ⟩ $ by and_intro [p7, p13]
p15: $ G ⇒ ∃ s (⟨ i , ⟨ k , f ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ s ∊ fseq (trees ω) ∧ cdm s = cdm f ∧ szip f s ⊆ sorted T O ∧ t = ⟨ i , s ⟩) $ by ex_intro [p14]
p16: $ G ⇒ ∃ a ∃ s (⟨ i , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ s ∊ fseq (trees ω) ∧ cdm s = cdm a ∧ szip a s ⊆ sorted T O ∧ t = ⟨ i , s ⟩) $ by ex_intro [p15]
p17: $ G ⇒ ∃ c ∃ a ∃ s (⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ s ∊ fseq (trees ω) ∧ cdm s = cdm a ∧ szip a s ⊆ sorted T O ∧ t = ⟨ c , s ⟩) $ by ex_intro [p16]

--| `sorted_elim`, the leaf case.
lemma u2_elim_leaf {n: set} (G: hyps) (O: class) (k t j v: set):
  $ G ⇒ ⟨ k , t ⟩ = ⟨ j , ⟨ v , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ $ > $ G ⇒ j ∊ O $ > $ G ⇒ v ∊ ω $ > $ G ⇒ k ∊ O ∧ ∃ n (n ∊ ω ∧ t = ⟨ n , ∅ ⟩) $
----
p0: $ G ⇒ isset k $ by isset_var
p0a: $ G ⇒ isset t $ by isset_var
p0b: $ G ⇒ isset j $ by isset_var
p0c: $ G ⇒ isset ⟨ v , ∅ ⟩ $ by opair_isset
p1: $ G ⇒ k = j ∧ t = ⟨ v , ∅ ⟩ $ by opair_inj_c [#1, p0, p0a, p0b, p0c]
p2: $ G ⇒ k = j $ by and_elim_l [p1]
p3: $ G ⇒ t = ⟨ v , ∅ ⟩ $ by and_elim_r [p1]
p4: $ G ⇒ j = k $ by eq_sym [p2]
p5: $ G ⇒ k ∊ O $ by welc_eq_set [p4, #2]
p6: $ G ⇒ v ∊ ω ∧ t = ⟨ v , ∅ ⟩ $ by and_intro [#3, p3]
p7: $ G ⇒ ∃ n (n ∊ ω ∧ t = ⟨ n , ∅ ⟩) $ by ex_intro [p6]
p8: $ G ⇒ k ∊ O ∧ ∃ n (n ∊ ω ∧ t = ⟨ n , ∅ ⟩) $ by and_intro [p5, p7]

sorted_elim
-----------
e1: $ G ⇒ sgstep T O (sorted T O) = sorted T O $ by sorted_fix [#1]
e2: $ G ⇒ sorted T O = sgstep T O (sorted T O) $ by eq_sym [e1]
e3: $ G ⇒ ⟨ k , t ⟩ ∈ sgstep T O (sorted T O) $ by wcel_eq_r [e2, #2]
e4: $ G , z = ⟨ k , t ⟩ , z ∊ sgstep T O (sorted T O) ⇒ z ∊ sgstep T O (sorted T O) $ by ax
e5: $ G , z = ⟨ k , t ⟩ , z ∊ sgstep T O (sorted T O) ⇒ ∃ i ∃ j ∃ f ∃ g (⟨ i , ⟨ j , f ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ g ∊ fseq (crn (sorted T O)) ∧ cdm g = cdm f ∧ szip f g ⊆ sorted T O ∧ z = ⟨ j , ⟨ i , g ⟩ ⟩) ∨ ∃ j ∃ v (j ∊ O ∧ v ∊ ω ∧ z = ⟨ j , ⟨ v , ∅ ⟩ ⟩) $ by sgstep_elim [e4]
k1: $ G , z = ⟨ k , t ⟩ , ⟨ i , ⟨ j , f ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ g ∊ fseq (crn (sorted T O)) ∧ cdm g = cdm f ∧ szip f g ⊆ sorted T O ∧ z = ⟨ j , ⟨ i , g ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ i , ⟨ j , f ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ g ∊ fseq (crn (sorted T O)) ∧ cdm g = cdm f ∧ szip f g ⊆ sorted T O ∧ z = ⟨ j , ⟨ i , g ⟩ ⟩ $ by ax
k2: $ G , z = ⟨ k , t ⟩ , ⟨ i , ⟨ j , f ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ g ∊ fseq (crn (sorted T O)) ∧ cdm g = cdm f ∧ szip f g ⊆ sorted T O ∧ z = ⟨ j , ⟨ i , g ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ i , ⟨ j , f ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T $ by and_elim_l [k1]
k3: $ G , z = ⟨ k , t ⟩ , ⟨ i , ⟨ j , f ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ g ∊ fseq (crn (sorted T O)) ∧ cdm g = cdm f ∧ szip f g ⊆ sorted T O ∧ z = ⟨ j , ⟨ i , g ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ g ∊ fseq (crn (sorted T O)) ∧ cdm g = cdm f ∧ szip f g ⊆ sorted T O ∧ z = ⟨ j , ⟨ i , g ⟩ ⟩ $ by and_elim_r [k1]
k4: $ G , z = ⟨ k , t ⟩ , ⟨ i , ⟨ j , f ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ g ∊ fseq (crn (sorted T O)) ∧ cdm g = cdm f ∧ szip f g ⊆ sorted T O ∧ z = ⟨ j , ⟨ i , g ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ g ∊ fseq (crn (sorted T O)) $ by and_elim_l [k3]
k5: $ G , z = ⟨ k , t ⟩ , ⟨ i , ⟨ j , f ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ g ∊ fseq (crn (sorted T O)) ∧ cdm g = cdm f ∧ szip f g ⊆ sorted T O ∧ z = ⟨ j , ⟨ i , g ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ cdm g = cdm f ∧ szip f g ⊆ sorted T O ∧ z = ⟨ j , ⟨ i , g ⟩ ⟩ $ by and_elim_r [k3]
k6: $ G , z = ⟨ k , t ⟩ , ⟨ i , ⟨ j , f ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ g ∊ fseq (crn (sorted T O)) ∧ cdm g = cdm f ∧ szip f g ⊆ sorted T O ∧ z = ⟨ j , ⟨ i , g ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ cdm g = cdm f $ by and_elim_l [k5]
k7: $ G , z = ⟨ k , t ⟩ , ⟨ i , ⟨ j , f ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ g ∊ fseq (crn (sorted T O)) ∧ cdm g = cdm f ∧ szip f g ⊆ sorted T O ∧ z = ⟨ j , ⟨ i , g ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ szip f g ⊆ sorted T O ∧ z = ⟨ j , ⟨ i , g ⟩ ⟩ $ by and_elim_r [k5]
k8: $ G , z = ⟨ k , t ⟩ , ⟨ i , ⟨ j , f ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ g ∊ fseq (crn (sorted T O)) ∧ cdm g = cdm f ∧ szip f g ⊆ sorted T O ∧ z = ⟨ j , ⟨ i , g ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ szip f g ⊆ sorted T O $ by and_elim_l [k7]
k9: $ G , z = ⟨ k , t ⟩ , ⟨ i , ⟨ j , f ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ g ∊ fseq (crn (sorted T O)) ∧ cdm g = cdm f ∧ szip f g ⊆ sorted T O ∧ z = ⟨ j , ⟨ i , g ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ z = ⟨ j , ⟨ i , g ⟩ ⟩ $ by and_elim_r [k7]
k10: $ G , z = ⟨ k , t ⟩ , ⟨ i , ⟨ j , f ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ g ∊ fseq (crn (sorted T O)) ∧ cdm g = cdm f ∧ szip f g ⊆ sorted T O ∧ z = ⟨ j , ⟨ i , g ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ z = ⟨ k , t ⟩ $ by ax
k11: $ G , z = ⟨ k , t ⟩ , ⟨ i , ⟨ j , f ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ g ∊ fseq (crn (sorted T O)) ∧ cdm g = cdm f ∧ szip f g ⊆ sorted T O ∧ z = ⟨ j , ⟨ i , g ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ k , t ⟩ = z $ by eq_sym [k10]
k12: $ G , z = ⟨ k , t ⟩ , ⟨ i , ⟨ j , f ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ g ∊ fseq (crn (sorted T O)) ∧ cdm g = cdm f ∧ szip f g ⊆ sorted T O ∧ z = ⟨ j , ⟨ i , g ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ k , t ⟩ = ⟨ j , ⟨ i , g ⟩ ⟩ $ by eq_trans [k11, k9]
k13: $ G , z = ⟨ k , t ⟩ , ⟨ i , ⟨ j , f ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ g ∊ fseq (crn (sorted T O)) ∧ cdm g = cdm f ∧ szip f g ⊆ sorted T O ∧ z = ⟨ j , ⟨ i , g ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ sig T O $ by weaken [#1]
k14: $ G , z = ⟨ k , t ⟩ , ⟨ i , ⟨ j , f ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ g ∊ fseq (crn (sorted T O)) ∧ cdm g = cdm f ∧ szip f g ⊆ sorted T O ∧ z = ⟨ j , ⟨ i , g ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ ∃ c ∃ a ∃ s (⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ s ∊ fseq (trees ω) ∧ cdm s = cdm a ∧ szip a s ⊆ sorted T O ∧ t = ⟨ c , s ⟩) $ by u2_elim_node [k13, k12, k2, k4, k6, k8]
k15: $ G , z = ⟨ k , t ⟩ , ⟨ i , ⟨ j , f ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ g ∊ fseq (crn (sorted T O)) ∧ cdm g = cdm f ∧ szip f g ⊆ sorted T O ∧ z = ⟨ j , ⟨ i , g ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ ∃ c ∃ a ∃ s (⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ s ∊ fseq (trees ω) ∧ cdm s = cdm a ∧ szip a s ⊆ sorted T O ∧ t = ⟨ c , s ⟩) ∨ (k ∊ O ∧ ∃ n (n ∊ ω ∧ t = ⟨ n , ∅ ⟩)) $ by or_intro_l [k14]
k16: $ G , z = ⟨ k , t ⟩ , ∃ g (⟨ i , ⟨ j , f ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ g ∊ fseq (crn (sorted T O)) ∧ cdm g = cdm f ∧ szip f g ⊆ sorted T O ∧ z = ⟨ j , ⟨ i , g ⟩ ⟩) ⇒ ∃ g (⟨ i , ⟨ j , f ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ g ∊ fseq (crn (sorted T O)) ∧ cdm g = cdm f ∧ szip f g ⊆ sorted T O ∧ z = ⟨ j , ⟨ i , g ⟩ ⟩) $ by ax
k17: $ G , z = ⟨ k , t ⟩ , ∃ g (⟨ i , ⟨ j , f ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ g ∊ fseq (crn (sorted T O)) ∧ cdm g = cdm f ∧ szip f g ⊆ sorted T O ∧ z = ⟨ j , ⟨ i , g ⟩ ⟩) ⇒ ∃ c ∃ a ∃ s (⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ s ∊ fseq (trees ω) ∧ cdm s = cdm a ∧ szip a s ⊆ sorted T O ∧ t = ⟨ c , s ⟩) ∨ (k ∊ O ∧ ∃ n (n ∊ ω ∧ t = ⟨ n , ∅ ⟩)) $ by ex_elim [k16, k15]
k18: $ G , z = ⟨ k , t ⟩ , ∃ f ∃ g (⟨ i , ⟨ j , f ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ g ∊ fseq (crn (sorted T O)) ∧ cdm g = cdm f ∧ szip f g ⊆ sorted T O ∧ z = ⟨ j , ⟨ i , g ⟩ ⟩) ⇒ ∃ f ∃ g (⟨ i , ⟨ j , f ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ g ∊ fseq (crn (sorted T O)) ∧ cdm g = cdm f ∧ szip f g ⊆ sorted T O ∧ z = ⟨ j , ⟨ i , g ⟩ ⟩) $ by ax
k19: $ G , z = ⟨ k , t ⟩ , ∃ f ∃ g (⟨ i , ⟨ j , f ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ g ∊ fseq (crn (sorted T O)) ∧ cdm g = cdm f ∧ szip f g ⊆ sorted T O ∧ z = ⟨ j , ⟨ i , g ⟩ ⟩) ⇒ ∃ c ∃ a ∃ s (⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ s ∊ fseq (trees ω) ∧ cdm s = cdm a ∧ szip a s ⊆ sorted T O ∧ t = ⟨ c , s ⟩) ∨ (k ∊ O ∧ ∃ n (n ∊ ω ∧ t = ⟨ n , ∅ ⟩)) $ by ex_elim [k18, k17]
k20: $ G , z = ⟨ k , t ⟩ , ∃ j ∃ f ∃ g (⟨ i , ⟨ j , f ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ g ∊ fseq (crn (sorted T O)) ∧ cdm g = cdm f ∧ szip f g ⊆ sorted T O ∧ z = ⟨ j , ⟨ i , g ⟩ ⟩) ⇒ ∃ j ∃ f ∃ g (⟨ i , ⟨ j , f ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ g ∊ fseq (crn (sorted T O)) ∧ cdm g = cdm f ∧ szip f g ⊆ sorted T O ∧ z = ⟨ j , ⟨ i , g ⟩ ⟩) $ by ax
k21: $ G , z = ⟨ k , t ⟩ , ∃ j ∃ f ∃ g (⟨ i , ⟨ j , f ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ g ∊ fseq (crn (sorted T O)) ∧ cdm g = cdm f ∧ szip f g ⊆ sorted T O ∧ z = ⟨ j , ⟨ i , g ⟩ ⟩) ⇒ ∃ c ∃ a ∃ s (⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ s ∊ fseq (trees ω) ∧ cdm s = cdm a ∧ szip a s ⊆ sorted T O ∧ t = ⟨ c , s ⟩) ∨ (k ∊ O ∧ ∃ n (n ∊ ω ∧ t = ⟨ n , ∅ ⟩)) $ by ex_elim [k20, k19]
k22: $ G , z = ⟨ k , t ⟩ , ∃ i ∃ j ∃ f ∃ g (⟨ i , ⟨ j , f ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ g ∊ fseq (crn (sorted T O)) ∧ cdm g = cdm f ∧ szip f g ⊆ sorted T O ∧ z = ⟨ j , ⟨ i , g ⟩ ⟩) ⇒ ∃ i ∃ j ∃ f ∃ g (⟨ i , ⟨ j , f ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ g ∊ fseq (crn (sorted T O)) ∧ cdm g = cdm f ∧ szip f g ⊆ sorted T O ∧ z = ⟨ j , ⟨ i , g ⟩ ⟩) $ by ax
k23: $ G , z = ⟨ k , t ⟩ , ∃ i ∃ j ∃ f ∃ g (⟨ i , ⟨ j , f ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ g ∊ fseq (crn (sorted T O)) ∧ cdm g = cdm f ∧ szip f g ⊆ sorted T O ∧ z = ⟨ j , ⟨ i , g ⟩ ⟩) ⇒ ∃ c ∃ a ∃ s (⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ s ∊ fseq (trees ω) ∧ cdm s = cdm a ∧ szip a s ⊆ sorted T O ∧ t = ⟨ c , s ⟩) ∨ (k ∊ O ∧ ∃ n (n ∊ ω ∧ t = ⟨ n , ∅ ⟩)) $ by ex_elim [k22, k21]
k24: $ G , z = ⟨ k , t ⟩ , z ∊ sgstep T O (sorted T O) , ∃ i ∃ j ∃ f ∃ g (⟨ i , ⟨ j , f ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ g ∊ fseq (crn (sorted T O)) ∧ cdm g = cdm f ∧ szip f g ⊆ sorted T O ∧ z = ⟨ j , ⟨ i , g ⟩ ⟩) ⇒ ∃ c ∃ a ∃ s (⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ s ∊ fseq (trees ω) ∧ cdm s = cdm a ∧ szip a s ⊆ sorted T O ∧ t = ⟨ c , s ⟩) ∨ (k ∊ O ∧ ∃ n (n ∊ ω ∧ t = ⟨ n , ∅ ⟩)) $ by weaken [k23]
m1: $ G , z = ⟨ k , t ⟩ , j ∊ O ∧ v ∊ ω ∧ z = ⟨ j , ⟨ v , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ j ∊ O ∧ v ∊ ω ∧ z = ⟨ j , ⟨ v , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ $ by ax
m2: $ G , z = ⟨ k , t ⟩ , j ∊ O ∧ v ∊ ω ∧ z = ⟨ j , ⟨ v , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ j ∊ O $ by and_elim_l [m1]
m3: $ G , z = ⟨ k , t ⟩ , j ∊ O ∧ v ∊ ω ∧ z = ⟨ j , ⟨ v , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ v ∊ ω ∧ z = ⟨ j , ⟨ v , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ $ by and_elim_r [m1]
m4: $ G , z = ⟨ k , t ⟩ , j ∊ O ∧ v ∊ ω ∧ z = ⟨ j , ⟨ v , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ v ∊ ω $ by and_elim_l [m3]
m5: $ G , z = ⟨ k , t ⟩ , j ∊ O ∧ v ∊ ω ∧ z = ⟨ j , ⟨ v , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ z = ⟨ j , ⟨ v , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ $ by and_elim_r [m3]
m6: $ G , z = ⟨ k , t ⟩ , j ∊ O ∧ v ∊ ω ∧ z = ⟨ j , ⟨ v , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ z = ⟨ k , t ⟩ $ by ax
m7: $ G , z = ⟨ k , t ⟩ , j ∊ O ∧ v ∊ ω ∧ z = ⟨ j , ⟨ v , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ k , t ⟩ = z $ by eq_sym [m6]
m8: $ G , z = ⟨ k , t ⟩ , j ∊ O ∧ v ∊ ω ∧ z = ⟨ j , ⟨ v , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ k , t ⟩ = ⟨ j , ⟨ v , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ $ by eq_trans [m7, m5]
m9: $ G , z = ⟨ k , t ⟩ , j ∊ O ∧ v ∊ ω ∧ z = ⟨ j , ⟨ v , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ k ∊ O ∧ ∃ n (n ∊ ω ∧ t = ⟨ n , ∅ ⟩) $ by u2_elim_leaf [m8, m2, m4]
m10: $ G , z = ⟨ k , t ⟩ , j ∊ O ∧ v ∊ ω ∧ z = ⟨ j , ⟨ v , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ ∃ c ∃ a ∃ s (⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ s ∊ fseq (trees ω) ∧ cdm s = cdm a ∧ szip a s ⊆ sorted T O ∧ t = ⟨ c , s ⟩) ∨ (k ∊ O ∧ ∃ n (n ∊ ω ∧ t = ⟨ n , ∅ ⟩)) $ by or_intro_r [m9]
m11: $ G , z = ⟨ k , t ⟩ , ∃ v (j ∊ O ∧ v ∊ ω ∧ z = ⟨ j , ⟨ v , ∅ ⟩ ⟩) ⇒ ∃ v (j ∊ O ∧ v ∊ ω ∧ z = ⟨ j , ⟨ v , ∅ ⟩ ⟩) $ by ax
m12: $ G , z = ⟨ k , t ⟩ , ∃ v (j ∊ O ∧ v ∊ ω ∧ z = ⟨ j , ⟨ v , ∅ ⟩ ⟩) ⇒ ∃ c ∃ a ∃ s (⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ s ∊ fseq (trees ω) ∧ cdm s = cdm a ∧ szip a s ⊆ sorted T O ∧ t = ⟨ c , s ⟩) ∨ (k ∊ O ∧ ∃ n (n ∊ ω ∧ t = ⟨ n , ∅ ⟩)) $ by ex_elim [m11, m10]
m13: $ G , z = ⟨ k , t ⟩ , ∃ j ∃ v (j ∊ O ∧ v ∊ ω ∧ z = ⟨ j , ⟨ v , ∅ ⟩ ⟩) ⇒ ∃ j ∃ v (j ∊ O ∧ v ∊ ω ∧ z = ⟨ j , ⟨ v , ∅ ⟩ ⟩) $ by ax
m14: $ G , z = ⟨ k , t ⟩ , ∃ j ∃ v (j ∊ O ∧ v ∊ ω ∧ z = ⟨ j , ⟨ v , ∅ ⟩ ⟩) ⇒ ∃ c ∃ a ∃ s (⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ s ∊ fseq (trees ω) ∧ cdm s = cdm a ∧ szip a s ⊆ sorted T O ∧ t = ⟨ c , s ⟩) ∨ (k ∊ O ∧ ∃ n (n ∊ ω ∧ t = ⟨ n , ∅ ⟩)) $ by ex_elim [m13, m12]
m15: $ G , z = ⟨ k , t ⟩ , z ∊ sgstep T O (sorted T O) , ∃ j ∃ v (j ∊ O ∧ v ∊ ω ∧ z = ⟨ j , ⟨ v , ∅ ⟩ ⟩) ⇒ ∃ c ∃ a ∃ s (⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ s ∊ fseq (trees ω) ∧ cdm s = cdm a ∧ szip a s ⊆ sorted T O ∧ t = ⟨ c , s ⟩) ∨ (k ∊ O ∧ ∃ n (n ∊ ω ∧ t = ⟨ n , ∅ ⟩)) $ by weaken [m14]
e6: $ G , z = ⟨ k , t ⟩ , z ∊ sgstep T O (sorted T O) ⇒ ∃ c ∃ a ∃ s (⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ s ∊ fseq (trees ω) ∧ cdm s = cdm a ∧ szip a s ⊆ sorted T O ∧ t = ⟨ c , s ⟩) ∨ (k ∊ O ∧ ∃ n (n ∊ ω ∧ t = ⟨ n , ∅ ⟩)) $ by or_elim [e5, k24, m15]
e7: $ G ⇒ ∃ c ∃ a ∃ s (⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ s ∊ fseq (trees ω) ∧ cdm s = cdm a ∧ szip a s ⊆ sorted T O ∧ t = ⟨ c , s ⟩) ∨ (k ∊ O ∧ ∃ n (n ∊ ω ∧ t = ⟨ n , ∅ ⟩)) $ by wcel_elim [e3, e6]

--| The abstraction of membership in a class is included in it.
lemma u2_cab_welc_subset {y: set} (G: hyps y) (P: class): $ G ⇒ {y | y ∊ P} ⊆ P $
----
l1: $ G , c ∊ {y | y ∊ P} ⇒ c ∊ {y | y ∊ P} $ by ax
l2: $ G , c ∊ {y | y ∊ P} ⇒ c ∊ P $ by cab_elim [l1]
l3: $ G ⇒ {y | y ∊ P} ⊆ P $ by subset_intro [l2]

--| `sorted_ind`, the constructor case.
lemma u2_ind_node {c k a s: set} (G: hyps) (T O P: class) (u i j f g: set):
  $ G ⇒ sig T O $ > $ G ⇒ ∀ c ∀ k ∀ a ∀ s (⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T → s ∊ fseq (trees ω) → cdm s = cdm a → szip a s ⊆ sorted T O ∩ P → ⟨ k , ⟨ c , s ⟩ ⟩ ∈ P) $ >
  $ G ⇒ u ⊆ sorted T O $ > $ G ⇒ u ⊆ P $ > $ G ⇒ ⟨ i , ⟨ j , f ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T $ > $ G ⇒ g ∊ fseq (crn u) $ >
  $ G ⇒ cdm g = cdm f $ > $ G ⇒ szip f g ⊆ u $ > $ G ⇒ ⟨ j , ⟨ i , g ⟩ ⟩ ∈ P $
----
q1: $ G , y ∊ u ⇒ y ∊ u $ by ax
q2: $ G , y ∊ u ⇒ u ⊆ sorted T O $ by weaken [#3]
q3: $ G , y ∊ u ⇒ y ∊ sorted T O $ by subset_elim [q2, q1]
q4: $ G , y ∊ u ⇒ u ⊆ P $ by weaken [#4]
q5: $ G , y ∊ u ⇒ y ∊ P $ by subset_elim [q4, q1]
q6: $ G , y ∊ u ⇒ y ∊ sorted T O ∩ P $ by cin_intro [q3, q5]
q7: $ G ⇒ u ⊆ sorted T O ∩ P $ by subset_intro [q6]
q8: $ G ⇒ szip f g ⊆ sorted T O ∩ P $ by subset_trans [#8, q7]
q9: $ G ⇒ crn u ⊆ crn (sorted T O) $ by crn_mono [#3]
q10: $ G ⇒ crn (sorted T O) ⊆ trees ω $ by u2_crn_sorted [#1]
q11: $ G ⇒ crn u ⊆ trees ω $ by subset_trans [q9, q10]
q12: $ G ⇒ fseq (crn u) ⊆ fseq (trees ω) $ by fseq_mono [q11]
q13: $ G ⇒ g ∊ fseq (trees ω) $ by subset_elim [q12, #6]
q14: $ G ⇒ ∀ k ∀ a ∀ s (⟨ i , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T → s ∊ fseq (trees ω) → cdm s = cdm a → szip a s ⊆ sorted T O ∩ P → ⟨ k , ⟨ i , s ⟩ ⟩ ∈ P) $ by all_elim [#2]
q15: $ G ⇒ ∀ a ∀ s (⟨ i , ⟨ j , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T → s ∊ fseq (trees ω) → cdm s = cdm a → szip a s ⊆ sorted T O ∩ P → ⟨ j , ⟨ i , s ⟩ ⟩ ∈ P) $ by all_elim [q14]
q16: $ G ⇒ ∀ s (⟨ i , ⟨ j , f ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T → s ∊ fseq (trees ω) → cdm s = cdm f → szip f s ⊆ sorted T O ∩ P → ⟨ j , ⟨ i , s ⟩ ⟩ ∈ P) $ by all_elim [q15]
q17: $ G ⇒ ⟨ i , ⟨ j , f ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T → g ∊ fseq (trees ω) → cdm g = cdm f → szip f g ⊆ sorted T O ∩ P → ⟨ j , ⟨ i , g ⟩ ⟩ ∈ P $ by all_elim [q16]
q18: $ G ⇒ g ∊ fseq (trees ω) → cdm g = cdm f → szip f g ⊆ sorted T O ∩ P → ⟨ j , ⟨ i , g ⟩ ⟩ ∈ P $ by imp_elim [q17, #5]
q19: $ G ⇒ cdm g = cdm f → szip f g ⊆ sorted T O ∩ P → ⟨ j , ⟨ i , g ⟩ ⟩ ∈ P $ by imp_elim [q18, q13]
q20: $ G ⇒ szip f g ⊆ sorted T O ∩ P → ⟨ j , ⟨ i , g ⟩ ⟩ ∈ P $ by imp_elim [q19, #7]
q21: $ G ⇒ ⟨ j , ⟨ i , g ⟩ ⟩ ∈ P $ by imp_elim [q20, q8]

sorted_ind
----------
e4: $ G , u ⊆ sorted T O , u ⊆ {y | y ∊ P} , z ∊ sgstep T O u ⇒ z ∊ sgstep T O u $ by ax
e5: $ G , u ⊆ sorted T O , u ⊆ {y | y ∊ P} , z ∊ sgstep T O u ⇒ ∃ i ∃ j ∃ f ∃ g (⟨ i , ⟨ j , f ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ g ∊ fseq (crn u) ∧ cdm g = cdm f ∧ szip f g ⊆ u ∧ z = ⟨ j , ⟨ i , g ⟩ ⟩) ∨ ∃ j ∃ v (j ∊ O ∧ v ∊ ω ∧ z = ⟨ j , ⟨ v , ∅ ⟩ ⟩) $ by sgstep_elim [e4]
k1: $ G , u ⊆ sorted T O , u ⊆ {y | y ∊ P} , ⟨ i , ⟨ j , f ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ g ∊ fseq (crn u) ∧ cdm g = cdm f ∧ szip f g ⊆ u ∧ z = ⟨ j , ⟨ i , g ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ i , ⟨ j , f ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ g ∊ fseq (crn u) ∧ cdm g = cdm f ∧ szip f g ⊆ u ∧ z = ⟨ j , ⟨ i , g ⟩ ⟩ $ by ax
k2: $ G , u ⊆ sorted T O , u ⊆ {y | y ∊ P} , ⟨ i , ⟨ j , f ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ g ∊ fseq (crn u) ∧ cdm g = cdm f ∧ szip f g ⊆ u ∧ z = ⟨ j , ⟨ i , g ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ i , ⟨ j , f ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T $ by and_elim_l [k1]
k3: $ G , u ⊆ sorted T O , u ⊆ {y | y ∊ P} , ⟨ i , ⟨ j , f ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ g ∊ fseq (crn u) ∧ cdm g = cdm f ∧ szip f g ⊆ u ∧ z = ⟨ j , ⟨ i , g ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ g ∊ fseq (crn u) ∧ cdm g = cdm f ∧ szip f g ⊆ u ∧ z = ⟨ j , ⟨ i , g ⟩ ⟩ $ by and_elim_r [k1]
k4: $ G , u ⊆ sorted T O , u ⊆ {y | y ∊ P} , ⟨ i , ⟨ j , f ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ g ∊ fseq (crn u) ∧ cdm g = cdm f ∧ szip f g ⊆ u ∧ z = ⟨ j , ⟨ i , g ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ g ∊ fseq (crn u) $ by and_elim_l [k3]
k5: $ G , u ⊆ sorted T O , u ⊆ {y | y ∊ P} , ⟨ i , ⟨ j , f ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ g ∊ fseq (crn u) ∧ cdm g = cdm f ∧ szip f g ⊆ u ∧ z = ⟨ j , ⟨ i , g ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ cdm g = cdm f ∧ szip f g ⊆ u ∧ z = ⟨ j , ⟨ i , g ⟩ ⟩ $ by and_elim_r [k3]
k6: $ G , u ⊆ sorted T O , u ⊆ {y | y ∊ P} , ⟨ i , ⟨ j , f ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ g ∊ fseq (crn u) ∧ cdm g = cdm f ∧ szip f g ⊆ u ∧ z = ⟨ j , ⟨ i , g ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ cdm g = cdm f $ by and_elim_l [k5]
k7: $ G , u ⊆ sorted T O , u ⊆ {y | y ∊ P} , ⟨ i , ⟨ j , f ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ g ∊ fseq (crn u) ∧ cdm g = cdm f ∧ szip f g ⊆ u ∧ z = ⟨ j , ⟨ i , g ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ szip f g ⊆ u ∧ z = ⟨ j , ⟨ i , g ⟩ ⟩ $ by and_elim_r [k5]
k8: $ G , u ⊆ sorted T O , u ⊆ {y | y ∊ P} , ⟨ i , ⟨ j , f ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ g ∊ fseq (crn u) ∧ cdm g = cdm f ∧ szip f g ⊆ u ∧ z = ⟨ j , ⟨ i , g ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ szip f g ⊆ u $ by and_elim_l [k7]
k9: $ G , u ⊆ sorted T O , u ⊆ {y | y ∊ P} , ⟨ i , ⟨ j , f ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ g ∊ fseq (crn u) ∧ cdm g = cdm f ∧ szip f g ⊆ u ∧ z = ⟨ j , ⟨ i , g ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ z = ⟨ j , ⟨ i , g ⟩ ⟩ $ by and_elim_r [k7]
k10: $ G , u ⊆ sorted T O , u ⊆ {y | y ∊ P} , ⟨ i , ⟨ j , f ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ g ∊ fseq (crn u) ∧ cdm g = cdm f ∧ szip f g ⊆ u ∧ z = ⟨ j , ⟨ i , g ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ sig T O $ by weaken [#1]
k11: $ G , u ⊆ sorted T O , u ⊆ {y | y ∊ P} , ⟨ i , ⟨ j , f ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ g ∊ fseq (crn u) ∧ cdm g = cdm f ∧ szip f g ⊆ u ∧ z = ⟨ j , ⟨ i , g ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ ∀ c ∀ k ∀ a ∀ s (⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T → s ∊ fseq (trees ω) → cdm s = cdm a → szip a s ⊆ sorted T O ∩ P → ⟨ k , ⟨ c , s ⟩ ⟩ ∈ P) $ by weaken [#2]
k12: $ G , u ⊆ sorted T O , u ⊆ {y | y ∊ P} , ⟨ i , ⟨ j , f ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ g ∊ fseq (crn u) ∧ cdm g = cdm f ∧ szip f g ⊆ u ∧ z = ⟨ j , ⟨ i , g ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ u ⊆ sorted T O $ by ax
k13: $ G , u ⊆ sorted T O , u ⊆ {y | y ∊ P} , ⟨ i , ⟨ j , f ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ g ∊ fseq (crn u) ∧ cdm g = cdm f ∧ szip f g ⊆ u ∧ z = ⟨ j , ⟨ i , g ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ u ⊆ {y | y ∊ P} $ by ax
k14: $ G , u ⊆ sorted T O , u ⊆ {y | y ∊ P} , ⟨ i , ⟨ j , f ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ g ∊ fseq (crn u) ∧ cdm g = cdm f ∧ szip f g ⊆ u ∧ z = ⟨ j , ⟨ i , g ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ {y | y ∊ P} ⊆ P $ by u2_cab_welc_subset
k15: $ G , u ⊆ sorted T O , u ⊆ {y | y ∊ P} , ⟨ i , ⟨ j , f ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ g ∊ fseq (crn u) ∧ cdm g = cdm f ∧ szip f g ⊆ u ∧ z = ⟨ j , ⟨ i , g ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ u ⊆ P $ by subset_trans [k13, k14]
k16: $ G , u ⊆ sorted T O , u ⊆ {y | y ∊ P} , ⟨ i , ⟨ j , f ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ g ∊ fseq (crn u) ∧ cdm g = cdm f ∧ szip f g ⊆ u ∧ z = ⟨ j , ⟨ i , g ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ j , ⟨ i , g ⟩ ⟩ ∈ P $ by u2_ind_node [k10, k11, k12, k15, k2, k4, k6, k8]
k17: $ G , u ⊆ sorted T O , u ⊆ {y | y ∊ P} , ⟨ i , ⟨ j , f ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ g ∊ fseq (crn u) ∧ cdm g = cdm f ∧ szip f g ⊆ u ∧ z = ⟨ j , ⟨ i , g ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ j , ⟨ i , g ⟩ ⟩ = z $ by eq_sym [k9]
k18: $ G , u ⊆ sorted T O , u ⊆ {y | y ∊ P} , ⟨ i , ⟨ j , f ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ g ∊ fseq (crn u) ∧ cdm g = cdm f ∧ szip f g ⊆ u ∧ z = ⟨ j , ⟨ i , g ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ z ∈ P $ by wcel_eq_l [k17, k16]
k19: $ G , u ⊆ sorted T O , u ⊆ {y | y ∊ P} , ⟨ i , ⟨ j , f ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ g ∊ fseq (crn u) ∧ cdm g = cdm f ∧ szip f g ⊆ u ∧ z = ⟨ j , ⟨ i , g ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ z ∊ P $ by wcel_welc [k18]
k20: $ G , u ⊆ sorted T O , u ⊆ {y | y ∊ P} , ∃ g (⟨ i , ⟨ j , f ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ g ∊ fseq (crn u) ∧ cdm g = cdm f ∧ szip f g ⊆ u ∧ z = ⟨ j , ⟨ i , g ⟩ ⟩) ⇒ ∃ g (⟨ i , ⟨ j , f ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ g ∊ fseq (crn u) ∧ cdm g = cdm f ∧ szip f g ⊆ u ∧ z = ⟨ j , ⟨ i , g ⟩ ⟩) $ by ax
k21: $ G , u ⊆ sorted T O , u ⊆ {y | y ∊ P} , ∃ g (⟨ i , ⟨ j , f ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ g ∊ fseq (crn u) ∧ cdm g = cdm f ∧ szip f g ⊆ u ∧ z = ⟨ j , ⟨ i , g ⟩ ⟩) ⇒ z ∊ P $ by ex_elim [k20, k19]
k22: $ G , u ⊆ sorted T O , u ⊆ {y | y ∊ P} , ∃ f ∃ g (⟨ i , ⟨ j , f ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ g ∊ fseq (crn u) ∧ cdm g = cdm f ∧ szip f g ⊆ u ∧ z = ⟨ j , ⟨ i , g ⟩ ⟩) ⇒ ∃ f ∃ g (⟨ i , ⟨ j , f ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ g ∊ fseq (crn u) ∧ cdm g = cdm f ∧ szip f g ⊆ u ∧ z = ⟨ j , ⟨ i , g ⟩ ⟩) $ by ax
k23: $ G , u ⊆ sorted T O , u ⊆ {y | y ∊ P} , ∃ f ∃ g (⟨ i , ⟨ j , f ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ g ∊ fseq (crn u) ∧ cdm g = cdm f ∧ szip f g ⊆ u ∧ z = ⟨ j , ⟨ i , g ⟩ ⟩) ⇒ z ∊ P $ by ex_elim [k22, k21]
k24: $ G , u ⊆ sorted T O , u ⊆ {y | y ∊ P} , ∃ j ∃ f ∃ g (⟨ i , ⟨ j , f ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ g ∊ fseq (crn u) ∧ cdm g = cdm f ∧ szip f g ⊆ u ∧ z = ⟨ j , ⟨ i , g ⟩ ⟩) ⇒ ∃ j ∃ f ∃ g (⟨ i , ⟨ j , f ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ g ∊ fseq (crn u) ∧ cdm g = cdm f ∧ szip f g ⊆ u ∧ z = ⟨ j , ⟨ i , g ⟩ ⟩) $ by ax
k25: $ G , u ⊆ sorted T O , u ⊆ {y | y ∊ P} , ∃ j ∃ f ∃ g (⟨ i , ⟨ j , f ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ g ∊ fseq (crn u) ∧ cdm g = cdm f ∧ szip f g ⊆ u ∧ z = ⟨ j , ⟨ i , g ⟩ ⟩) ⇒ z ∊ P $ by ex_elim [k24, k23]
k26: $ G , u ⊆ sorted T O , u ⊆ {y | y ∊ P} , ∃ i ∃ j ∃ f ∃ g (⟨ i , ⟨ j , f ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ g ∊ fseq (crn u) ∧ cdm g = cdm f ∧ szip f g ⊆ u ∧ z = ⟨ j , ⟨ i , g ⟩ ⟩) ⇒ ∃ i ∃ j ∃ f ∃ g (⟨ i , ⟨ j , f ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ g ∊ fseq (crn u) ∧ cdm g = cdm f ∧ szip f g ⊆ u ∧ z = ⟨ j , ⟨ i , g ⟩ ⟩) $ by ax
k27: $ G , u ⊆ sorted T O , u ⊆ {y | y ∊ P} , ∃ i ∃ j ∃ f ∃ g (⟨ i , ⟨ j , f ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ g ∊ fseq (crn u) ∧ cdm g = cdm f ∧ szip f g ⊆ u ∧ z = ⟨ j , ⟨ i , g ⟩ ⟩) ⇒ z ∊ P $ by ex_elim [k26, k25]
k28: $ G , u ⊆ sorted T O , u ⊆ {y | y ∊ P} , z ∊ sgstep T O u , ∃ i ∃ j ∃ f ∃ g (⟨ i , ⟨ j , f ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T ∧ g ∊ fseq (crn u) ∧ cdm g = cdm f ∧ szip f g ⊆ u ∧ z = ⟨ j , ⟨ i , g ⟩ ⟩) ⇒ z ∊ P $ by weaken [k27]
m1: $ G , u ⊆ sorted T O , u ⊆ {y | y ∊ P} , j ∊ O ∧ v ∊ ω ∧ z = ⟨ j , ⟨ v , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ j ∊ O ∧ v ∊ ω ∧ z = ⟨ j , ⟨ v , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ $ by ax
m2: $ G , u ⊆ sorted T O , u ⊆ {y | y ∊ P} , j ∊ O ∧ v ∊ ω ∧ z = ⟨ j , ⟨ v , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ j ∊ O $ by and_elim_l [m1]
m3: $ G , u ⊆ sorted T O , u ⊆ {y | y ∊ P} , j ∊ O ∧ v ∊ ω ∧ z = ⟨ j , ⟨ v , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ v ∊ ω ∧ z = ⟨ j , ⟨ v , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ $ by and_elim_r [m1]
m4: $ G , u ⊆ sorted T O , u ⊆ {y | y ∊ P} , j ∊ O ∧ v ∊ ω ∧ z = ⟨ j , ⟨ v , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ v ∊ ω $ by and_elim_l [m3]
m5: $ G , u ⊆ sorted T O , u ⊆ {y | y ∊ P} , j ∊ O ∧ v ∊ ω ∧ z = ⟨ j , ⟨ v , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ z = ⟨ j , ⟨ v , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ $ by and_elim_r [m3]
m6: $ G , u ⊆ sorted T O , u ⊆ {y | y ∊ P} , j ∊ O ∧ v ∊ ω ∧ z = ⟨ j , ⟨ v , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ ∀ k ∀ n (k ∊ O → n ∊ ω → ⟨ k , ⟨ n , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ P) $ by weaken [#3]
m7: $ G , u ⊆ sorted T O , u ⊆ {y | y ∊ P} , j ∊ O ∧ v ∊ ω ∧ z = ⟨ j , ⟨ v , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ ∀ n (j ∊ O → n ∊ ω → ⟨ j , ⟨ n , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ P) $ by all_elim [m6]
m8: $ G , u ⊆ sorted T O , u ⊆ {y | y ∊ P} , j ∊ O ∧ v ∊ ω ∧ z = ⟨ j , ⟨ v , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ j ∊ O → v ∊ ω → ⟨ j , ⟨ v , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ P $ by all_elim [m7]
m9: $ G , u ⊆ sorted T O , u ⊆ {y | y ∊ P} , j ∊ O ∧ v ∊ ω ∧ z = ⟨ j , ⟨ v , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ v ∊ ω → ⟨ j , ⟨ v , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ P $ by imp_elim [m8, m2]
m10: $ G , u ⊆ sorted T O , u ⊆ {y | y ∊ P} , j ∊ O ∧ v ∊ ω ∧ z = ⟨ j , ⟨ v , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ j , ⟨ v , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ P $ by imp_elim [m9, m4]
m11: $ G , u ⊆ sorted T O , u ⊆ {y | y ∊ P} , j ∊ O ∧ v ∊ ω ∧ z = ⟨ j , ⟨ v , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ j , ⟨ v , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ = z $ by eq_sym [m5]
m12: $ G , u ⊆ sorted T O , u ⊆ {y | y ∊ P} , j ∊ O ∧ v ∊ ω ∧ z = ⟨ j , ⟨ v , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ z ∈ P $ by wcel_eq_l [m11, m10]
m13: $ G , u ⊆ sorted T O , u ⊆ {y | y ∊ P} , j ∊ O ∧ v ∊ ω ∧ z = ⟨ j , ⟨ v , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ z ∊ P $ by wcel_welc [m12]
m14: $ G , u ⊆ sorted T O , u ⊆ {y | y ∊ P} , ∃ v (j ∊ O ∧ v ∊ ω ∧ z = ⟨ j , ⟨ v , ∅ ⟩ ⟩) ⇒ ∃ v (j ∊ O ∧ v ∊ ω ∧ z = ⟨ j , ⟨ v , ∅ ⟩ ⟩) $ by ax
m15: $ G , u ⊆ sorted T O , u ⊆ {y | y ∊ P} , ∃ v (j ∊ O ∧ v ∊ ω ∧ z = ⟨ j , ⟨ v , ∅ ⟩ ⟩) ⇒ z ∊ P $ by ex_elim [m14, m13]
m16: $ G , u ⊆ sorted T O , u ⊆ {y | y ∊ P} , ∃ j ∃ v (j ∊ O ∧ v ∊ ω ∧ z = ⟨ j , ⟨ v , ∅ ⟩ ⟩) ⇒ ∃ j ∃ v (j ∊ O ∧ v ∊ ω ∧ z = ⟨ j , ⟨ v , ∅ ⟩ ⟩) $ by ax
m17: $ G , u ⊆ sorted T O , u ⊆ {y | y ∊ P} , ∃ j ∃ v (j ∊ O ∧ v ∊ ω ∧ z = ⟨ j , ⟨ v , ∅ ⟩ ⟩) ⇒ z ∊ P $ by ex_elim [m16, m15]
m18: $ G , u ⊆ sorted T O , u ⊆ {y | y ∊ P} , z ∊ sgstep T O u , ∃ j ∃ v (j ∊ O ∧ v ∊ ω ∧ z = ⟨ j , ⟨ v , ∅ ⟩ ⟩) ⇒ z ∊ P $ by weaken [m17]
e6: $ G , u ⊆ sorted T O , u ⊆ {y | y ∊ P} , z ∊ sgstep T O u ⇒ z ∊ P $ by or_elim [e5, k28, m18]
e7: $ G , u ⊆ sorted T O , u ⊆ {y | y ∊ P} , z ∊ sgstep T O u ⇒ z ∊ {y | y ∊ P} $ by cab_intro [e6]
r3: $ G , u ⊆ sorted T O , u ⊆ {y | y ∊ P} ⇒ sgstep T O u ⊆ {y | y ∊ P} $ by subset_intro [e7]
r4: $ G , u ⊆ sorted T O ⇒ u ⊆ {y | y ∊ P} → sgstep T O u ⊆ {y | y ∊ P} $ by imp_intro [r3]
r5: $ G ⇒ u ⊆ sorted T O → u ⊆ {y | y ∊ P} → sgstep T O u ⊆ {y | y ∊ P} $ by imp_intro [r4]
r6: $ G ⇒ ∀ u (u ⊆ sorted T O → u ⊆ {y | y ∊ P} → sgstep T O u ⊆ {y | y ∊ P}) $ by all_intro [r5]
r6w: $ G , w = ω ⇒ ∀ u (u ⊆ sorted T O → u ⊆ {y | y ∊ P} → sgstep T O u ⊆ {y | y ∊ P}) $ by weaken [r6]
f0: $ G , w = ω ⇒ sig T O $ by weaken [#1]
f1: $ G , w = ω ⇒ mono x (sgstep T O x) $ by sgstep_mono
f2: $ G , w = ω ⇒ setop x (sgstep T O x) $ by sgstep_setop [f0]
f5: $ G , w = ω ⇒ w = ω $ by ax
f8: $ G , w = ω ⇒ cont x (sgstep T O x) w $ by u2_sg_cont [f5]
r7: $ G , w = ω ⇒ sorted T O ⊆ {y | y ∊ P} $ by lfp_cont_ind [f1, f2, f8, r6w]
r8: $ G , w = ω ⇒ {y | y ∊ P} ⊆ P $ by u2_cab_welc_subset
r9: $ G , w = ω ⇒ sorted T O ⊆ P $ by subset_trans [r7, r8]
f4: $ G ⇒ isset ω $ by omega_set
r10: $ G ⇒ sorted T O ⊆ P $ by isset_elim [f4, r9]

sorted_universe
---------------
v0: $ G ⇒ isset ω $ by omega_set
v1: $ G , w = ω ⇒ w = ω $ by ax
v2: $ G , w = ω ⇒ ω = w $ by eq_sym [v1]
v3: $ G , w = ω ⇒ ω ∈ U $ by weaken [#3]
v4: $ G , w = ω ⇒ w ∈ U $ by wcel_eq_l [v2, v3]
v5: $ G , w = ω ⇒ w ∊ U $ by wcel_welc [v4]
v6: $ G , w = ω ⇒ universe U $ by weaken [#2]
v7: $ G , w = ω ⇒ trees w ∈ U $ by trees_universe [v6, v3, v5]
v8: $ G , w = ω ⇒ trees w = trees ω $ by trees_eq [v1]
v9: $ G , w = ω ⇒ trees ω ∈ U $ by wcel_eq_l [v8, v7]
v10: $ G , w = ω ⇒ ω × trees ω ∈ U $ by universe_cxp_c [v6, v3, v9]
v11: $ G , w = ω ⇒ sig T O $ by weaken [#1]
v12: $ G , w = ω ⇒ sorted T O ⊆ ω × trees ω $ by sorted_sub [v11]
v13: $ G , w = ω ⇒ sorted T O ∈ U $ by universe_subset_c [v6, v10, v12]
v14: $ G ⇒ sorted T O ∈ U $ by isset_elim [v0, v13]

ofsort_congr
------------
l0: $ cv y ≐ cv y $ by ceqt_refl
l1: $ ⟨ E , y ⟩ ≐ ⟨ F , y ⟩ $ by opair_congr [#3, l0]
l2: $ sorted A C ≐ sorted B D $ by sorted_congr [#1, #2]
l3: $ (⟨ E , y ⟩ ∈ sorted A C) ⟺ (⟨ F , y ⟩ ∈ sorted B D) $ by wcel_congr [l1, l2]
l4: $ {y | ⟨ E , y ⟩ ∈ sorted A C} ≐ {y | ⟨ F , y ⟩ ∈ sorted B D} $ by cab_congr [l3]

--| `ofsort` at equal arguments, elementwise.
lemma u2_ofsort_sub (G: hyps) (A B C D E F: class) (y: set):
  $ G ⇒ A = B $ > $ G ⇒ C = D $ > $ G ⇒ E = F $ > $ G , y ∊ ofsort A C E ⇒ y ∊ ofsort B D F $
----
o1: $ G , y ∊ ofsort A C E ⇒ y ∊ ofsort A C E $ by ax
o2: $ G , y ∊ ofsort A C E ⇒ ⟨ E , y ⟩ ∈ sorted A C $ by cab_elim [o1]
o3: $ G , y ∊ ofsort A C E ⇒ A = B $ by weaken [#1]
o4: $ G , y ∊ ofsort A C E ⇒ C = D $ by weaken [#2]
o5: $ G , y ∊ ofsort A C E ⇒ E = F $ by weaken [#3]
o6: $ G , y ∊ ofsort A C E ⇒ sorted A C = sorted B D $ by sorted_eq [o3, o4]
o7: $ G , y ∊ ofsort A C E ⇒ y = y $ by eq_refl
o8: $ G , y ∊ ofsort A C E ⇒ ⟨ E , y ⟩ = ⟨ F , y ⟩ $ by opair_eq [o5, o7]
o9: $ G , y ∊ ofsort A C E ⇒ ⟨ F , y ⟩ ∈ sorted A C $ by wcel_eq_l [o8, o2]
o10: $ G , y ∊ ofsort A C E ⇒ ⟨ F , y ⟩ ∈ sorted B D $ by wcel_eq_r [o6, o9]
o11: $ G , y ∊ ofsort A C E ⇒ y ∊ ofsort B D F $ by cab_intro [o10]

ofsort_eq
---------
l1: $ G , y ∊ ofsort A C E ⇒ y ∊ ofsort B D F $ by u2_ofsort_sub [#1, #2, #3]
l2: $ G ⇒ B = A $ by eq_sym [#1]
l3: $ G ⇒ D = C $ by eq_sym [#2]
l4: $ G ⇒ F = E $ by eq_sym [#3]
l5: $ G , y ∊ ofsort B D F ⇒ y ∊ ofsort A C E $ by u2_ofsort_sub [l2, l3, l4]
l6: $ G ⇒ ofsort A C E = ofsort B D F $ by eq_intro [l1, l5]

sb_c_ofsort
-----------
l1: $ (⟦ x / t ⟧ {y | ⟨ C , y ⟩ ∈ sorted A B}) ≐ {y | ⟨ (⟦ x / t ⟧ C) , y ⟩ ∈ sorted (⟦ x / t ⟧ A) (⟦ x / t ⟧ B)} $ by ceqt_refl

ofsort_intro
------------
l1: $ G ⇒ t ∊ {y | ⟨ K , y ⟩ ∈ sorted T O} $ by cab_intro [#1]

ofsort_elim
-----------
l1: $ G ⇒ ⟨ K , t ⟩ ∈ sorted T O $ by cab_elim [#1]

ofsort_mem_elim
---------------
l1: $ G , y = A , y ∊ ofsort T O K ⇒ y ∊ ofsort T O K $ by ax
l2: $ G , y = A , y ∊ ofsort T O K ⇒ ⟨ K , y ⟩ ∈ sorted T O $ by ofsort_elim [l1]
l3: $ G , y = A , y ∊ ofsort T O K ⇒ y = A $ by ax
l4: $ G , y = A , y ∊ ofsort T O K ⇒ K = K $ by eq_refl
l5: $ G , y = A , y ∊ ofsort T O K ⇒ ⟨ K , y ⟩ = ⟨ K , A ⟩ $ by opair_eq [l4, l3]
l6: $ G , y = A , y ∊ ofsort T O K ⇒ ⟨ K , A ⟩ ∈ sorted T O $ by wcel_eq_l [l5, l2]
l7: $ G ⇒ ⟨ K , A ⟩ ∈ sorted T O $ by wcel_elim [#1, l6]

--| A pair equal to a pair of sets has a set as first component.
lemma u2_opair_eq_isset (G: hyps) (A B: class) (x y: set): $ G ⇒ ⟨ A , B ⟩ = ⟨ x , y ⟩ $ > $ G ⇒ isset A $
----
a1: $ G ⇒ isset (csn A) $ by cpr_isset
a2: $ G ⇒ csn A ∈ ⟨ A , B ⟩ $ by cpr_intro_l_c [a1]
a3: $ G ⇒ csn A ∈ ⟨ x , y ⟩ $ by wcel_eq_r [#1, a2]
a4: $ G , w = csn A , w ∊ ⟨ x , y ⟩ ⇒ w ∊ ⟨ x , y ⟩ $ by ax
a5: $ G , w = csn A , w ∊ ⟨ x , y ⟩ ⇒ w = csn x ∨ w = cpr x y $ by cpr_elim [a4]
b1: $ G , w = csn A , w ∊ ⟨ x , y ⟩ , w = csn x ⇒ w = csn x $ by ax
b2: $ G , w = csn A , w ∊ ⟨ x , y ⟩ , w = csn x ⇒ csn x = w $ by eq_sym [b1]
b3: $ G , w = csn A , w ∊ ⟨ x , y ⟩ , w = csn x ⇒ x ∊ csn x $ by csn_intro_var
b4: $ G , w = csn A , w ∊ ⟨ x , y ⟩ , w = csn x ⇒ x ∊ w $ by welc_eq [b2, b3]
b5: $ G , w = csn A , w ∊ ⟨ x , y ⟩ , w = cpr x y ⇒ w = cpr x y $ by ax
b6: $ G , w = csn A , w ∊ ⟨ x , y ⟩ , w = cpr x y ⇒ cpr x y = w $ by eq_sym [b5]
b7: $ G , w = csn A , w ∊ ⟨ x , y ⟩ , w = cpr x y ⇒ x ∊ cpr x y $ by cpr_intro_l
b8: $ G , w = csn A , w ∊ ⟨ x , y ⟩ , w = cpr x y ⇒ x ∊ w $ by welc_eq [b6, b7]
a6: $ G , w = csn A , w ∊ ⟨ x , y ⟩ ⇒ x ∊ w $ by or_elim [a5, b4, b8]
a7: $ G , w = csn A , w ∊ ⟨ x , y ⟩ ⇒ w = csn A $ by ax
a8: $ G , w = csn A , w ∊ ⟨ x , y ⟩ ⇒ x ∊ csn A $ by welc_eq [a7, a6]
a9: $ G , w = csn A , w ∊ ⟨ x , y ⟩ ⇒ x = A $ by csn_elim [a8]
a10: $ G , w = csn A , w ∊ ⟨ x , y ⟩ ⇒ isset A $ by isset_intro [a9]
a11: $ G ⇒ isset A $ by wcel_elim [a3, a10]

--| A pair in a product has a set as first component.
lemma u2_cxp_isset (G: hyps) (A B C D: class): $ G ⇒ ⟨ A , B ⟩ ∈ C × D $ > $ G ⇒ isset A $
----
b1: $ G , z = ⟨ A , B ⟩ , z ∊ C × D ⇒ z ∊ C × D $ by ax
b2: $ G , z = ⟨ A , B ⟩ , z ∊ C × D , z = ⟨ x , y ⟩ , x ∊ C , y ∊ D ⇒ z = ⟨ A , B ⟩ $ by ax
b3: $ G , z = ⟨ A , B ⟩ , z ∊ C × D , z = ⟨ x , y ⟩ , x ∊ C , y ∊ D ⇒ ⟨ A , B ⟩ = z $ by eq_sym [b2]
b4: $ G , z = ⟨ A , B ⟩ , z ∊ C × D , z = ⟨ x , y ⟩ , x ∊ C , y ∊ D ⇒ z = ⟨ x , y ⟩ $ by ax
b5: $ G , z = ⟨ A , B ⟩ , z ∊ C × D , z = ⟨ x , y ⟩ , x ∊ C , y ∊ D ⇒ ⟨ A , B ⟩ = ⟨ x , y ⟩ $ by eq_trans [b3, b4]
b6: $ G , z = ⟨ A , B ⟩ , z ∊ C × D , z = ⟨ x , y ⟩ , x ∊ C , y ∊ D ⇒ isset A $ by u2_opair_eq_isset [b5]
b7: $ G , z = ⟨ A , B ⟩ , z ∊ C × D ⇒ isset A $ by cxp_elim [b1, b6]
b8: $ G ⇒ isset A $ by wcel_elim [#1, b7]

--| Class form of `cxp_elim_pair` (the second component a set).
lemma u2_cxp_elim_c (G: hyps) (A B C D: class):
  $ G ⇒ ⟨ A , B ⟩ ∈ C × D $ > $ G ⇒ isset B $ > $ G ⇒ A ∈ C ∧ B ∈ D $
----
c0: $ G ⇒ isset A $ by u2_cxp_isset [#1]
c1: $ G , u = A , v = B ⇒ u = A $ by ax
c2: $ G , u = A , v = B ⇒ v = B $ by ax
c3: $ G , u = A , v = B ⇒ ⟨ u , v ⟩ = ⟨ A , B ⟩ $ by opair_eq [c1, c2]
c4: $ G , u = A , v = B ⇒ ⟨ A , B ⟩ = ⟨ u , v ⟩ $ by eq_sym [c3]
c5: $ G , u = A , v = B ⇒ ⟨ A , B ⟩ ∈ C × D $ by weaken [#1]
c6: $ G , u = A , v = B ⇒ ⟨ u , v ⟩ ∈ C × D $ by wcel_eq_l [c4, c5]
c7: $ G , u = A , v = B ⇒ u ∊ C ∧ v ∊ D $ by cxp_elim_pair [c6]
c8: $ G , u = A , v = B ⇒ u ∊ C $ by and_elim_l [c7]
c9: $ G , u = A , v = B ⇒ v ∊ D $ by and_elim_r [c7]
c10: $ G , u = A , v = B ⇒ u ∈ C $ by welc_wcel [c8]
c11: $ G , u = A , v = B ⇒ v ∈ D $ by welc_wcel [c9]
c12: $ G , u = A , v = B ⇒ A ∈ C $ by wcel_eq_l [c1, c10]
c13: $ G , u = A , v = B ⇒ B ∈ D $ by wcel_eq_l [c2, c11]
c14: $ G , u = A , v = B ⇒ A ∈ C ∧ B ∈ D $ by and_intro [c12, c13]
c15: $ G , u = A ⇒ A ∈ C ∧ B ∈ D $ by isset_elim [#2, c14]
c16: $ G ⇒ A ∈ C ∧ B ∈ D $ by isset_elim [c0, c15]

ofsort_trees
------------
t1: $ G , y ∊ ofsort T O K ⇒ y ∊ ofsort T O K $ by ax
t2: $ G , y ∊ ofsort T O K ⇒ ⟨ K , y ⟩ ∈ sorted T O $ by ofsort_elim [t1]
t0: $ G , y ∊ ofsort T O K ⇒ sig T O $ by weaken [#1]
t3: $ G , y ∊ ofsort T O K ⇒ sorted T O ⊆ ω × trees ω $ by sorted_sub [t0]
t4: $ G , y ∊ ofsort T O K ⇒ ⟨ K , y ⟩ ∈ ω × trees ω $ by wcel_subset [t3, t2]
t5: $ G , y ∊ ofsort T O K ⇒ isset y $ by isset_var
t6: $ G , y ∊ ofsort T O K ⇒ K ∈ ω ∧ y ∈ trees ω $ by u2_cxp_elim_c [t4, t5]
t7: $ G , y ∊ ofsort T O K ⇒ y ∈ trees ω $ by and_elim_r [t6]
t8: $ G , y ∊ ofsort T O K ⇒ y ∊ trees ω $ by wcel_welc [t7]
t9: $ G ⇒ ofsort T O K ⊆ trees ω $ by subset_intro [t8]

lemma u2_trees_omega_set (G: hyps): $ G ⇒ isset (trees ω) $
----
w0: $ G ⇒ isset ω $ by omega_set
w1: $ G , w = ω ⇒ w = ω $ by ax
w2: $ G , w = ω ⇒ isset (trees w) $ by trees_set
w3: $ G , w = ω ⇒ trees w = trees ω $ by trees_eq [w1]
w4: $ G , w = ω ⇒ isset (trees ω) $ by isset_eq [w3, w2]
w5: $ G ⇒ isset (trees ω) $ by isset_elim [w0, w4]

ofsort_set
----------
l1: $ G ⇒ ofsort T O K ⊆ trees ω $ by ofsort_trees [#1]
l2: $ G ⇒ isset (trees ω) $ by u2_trees_omega_set
l3: $ G ⇒ isset (ofsort T O K) $ by subset_isset [l2, l1]

ofsort_mem
----------
m0: $ G , u = A ⇒ u = A $ by ax
m1: $ G , u = A ⇒ K = K $ by eq_refl
m2: $ G , u = A ⇒ ⟨ K , u ⟩ = ⟨ K , A ⟩ $ by opair_eq [m1, m0]
m3: $ G , u = A ⇒ ⟨ K , A ⟩ = ⟨ K , u ⟩ $ by eq_sym [m2]
m4: $ G , u = A ⇒ ⟨ K , A ⟩ ∈ sorted T O $ by weaken [#1]
m5: $ G , u = A ⇒ ⟨ K , u ⟩ ∈ sorted T O $ by wcel_eq_l [m3, m4]
m6: $ G , u = A ⇒ u ∊ ofsort T O K $ by ofsort_intro [m5]
m7: $ G , u = A ⇒ A ∈ ofsort T O K $ by wcel_intro [m0, m6]
m8: $ G ⇒ A ∈ ofsort T O K $ by isset_elim [#2, m7]

ofsort_leaf
-----------
o0: $ G , k = K , k ∊ O ⇒ sig T O $ by weaken [#1]
o1: $ G , k = K , k ∊ O ⇒ k ∊ O $ by ax
o2: $ G , k = K , k ∊ O ⇒ n ∊ ω $ by weaken [#3]
o3: $ G , k = K , k ∊ O ⇒ ⟨ k , ⟨ n , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ sorted T O $ by sorted_leaf [o0, o1, o2]
o4: $ G , k = K , k ∊ O ⇒ k = K $ by ax
o5: $ G , k = K , k ∊ O ⇒ ⟨ n , ∅ ⟩ = ⟨ n , ∅ ⟩ $ by eq_refl
o6: $ G , k = K , k ∊ O ⇒ ⟨ k , ⟨ n , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ = ⟨ K , ⟨ n , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ $ by opair_eq [o4, o5]
o7: $ G , k = K , k ∊ O ⇒ ⟨ K , ⟨ n , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ sorted T O $ by wcel_eq_l [o6, o3]
o8: $ G , k = K , k ∊ O ⇒ isset ⟨ n , ∅ ⟩ $ by opair_isset
o9: $ G , k = K , k ∊ O ⇒ ⟨ n , ∅ ⟩ ∈ ofsort T O K $ by ofsort_mem [o7, o8]
o10: $ G ⇒ ⟨ n , ∅ ⟩ ∈ ofsort T O K $ by wcel_elim [#2, o9]

--| Class form of `scons_fseq`.
lemma u2_scons_fseq_c (G: hyps) (W K S: class):
  $ G ⇒ K ∈ W $ > $ G ⇒ S ∈ fseq W $ > $ G ⇒ scons K S ∈ fseq W $
----
s1: $ G , u = K , u ∊ W , v = S , v ∊ fseq W ⇒ u ∊ W $ by ax
s2: $ G , u = K , u ∊ W , v = S , v ∊ fseq W ⇒ v ∊ fseq W $ by ax
s3: $ G , u = K , u ∊ W , v = S , v ∊ fseq W ⇒ scons u v ∈ fseq W $ by scons_fseq [s1, s2]
s4: $ G , u = K , u ∊ W , v = S , v ∊ fseq W ⇒ u = K $ by ax
s5: $ G , u = K , u ∊ W , v = S , v ∊ fseq W ⇒ v = S $ by ax
s6: $ G , u = K , u ∊ W , v = S , v ∊ fseq W ⇒ scons u v = scons K S $ by scons_eq [s4, s5]
s7: $ G , u = K , u ∊ W , v = S , v ∊ fseq W ⇒ scons K S ∈ fseq W $ by wcel_eq_l [s6, s3]
s8: $ G , u = K , u ∊ W ⇒ scons K S ∈ fseq W $ by wcel_elim [#2, s7]
s9: $ G ⇒ scons K S ∈ fseq W $ by wcel_elim [#1, s8]

--| Class form of `scons_len`.
lemma u2_scons_len_c (G: hyps) (W K S: class):
  $ G ⇒ isset K $ > $ G ⇒ S ∈ fseq W $ > $ G ⇒ cdm (scons K S) = suc (cdm S) $
----
n0: $ G , u = K , v = S , v ∊ fseq W ⇒ v ∊ fseq W $ by ax
n1: $ G , u = K , v = S , v ∊ fseq W ⇒ cdm (scons u v) = suc (cdm v) $ by scons_len [n0]
n2: $ G , u = K , v = S , v ∊ fseq W ⇒ u = K $ by ax
n3: $ G , u = K , v = S , v ∊ fseq W ⇒ v = S $ by ax
n4: $ G , u = K , v = S , v ∊ fseq W ⇒ scons u v = scons K S $ by scons_eq [n2, n3]
n5: $ G , u = K , v = S , v ∊ fseq W ⇒ cdm (scons u v) = cdm (scons K S) $ by cdm_eq [n4]
n6: $ G , u = K , v = S , v ∊ fseq W ⇒ cdm v = cdm S $ by cdm_eq [n3]
n7: $ G , u = K , v = S , v ∊ fseq W ⇒ suc (cdm v) = suc (cdm S) $ by suc_eq [n6]
n8: $ G , u = K , v = S , v ∊ fseq W ⇒ cdm (scons K S) = cdm (scons u v) $ by eq_sym [n5]
n9: $ G , u = K , v = S , v ∊ fseq W ⇒ cdm (scons K S) = suc (cdm v) $ by eq_trans [n8, n1]
n10: $ G , u = K , v = S , v ∊ fseq W ⇒ cdm (scons K S) = suc (cdm S) $ by eq_trans [n9, n7]
n11: $ G , u = K ⇒ cdm (scons K S) = suc (cdm S) $ by wcel_elim [#2, n10]
n12: $ G ⇒ cdm (scons K S) = suc (cdm S) $ by isset_elim [#1, n11]

--| Class form of `szip_scons`.
lemma u2_szip_scons_c (G: hyps) (W K A L S: class):
  $ G ⇒ isset K $ > $ G ⇒ isset A $ > $ G ⇒ L ∈ fseq W $ > $ G ⇒ isset S $ >
  $ G ⇒ szip (scons K L) (scons A S) = csn ⟨ K , A ⟩ ∪ szip L S $
----
z0: $ G , u = K , v = A , f = L , f ∊ fseq W , g = S ⇒ f ∊ fseq W $ by ax
z1: $ G , u = K , v = A , f = L , f ∊ fseq W , g = S ⇒ szip (scons u f) (scons v g) = csn ⟨ u , v ⟩ ∪ szip f g $ by szip_scons [z0]
zu: $ G , u = K , v = A , f = L , f ∊ fseq W , g = S ⇒ u = K $ by ax
zv: $ G , u = K , v = A , f = L , f ∊ fseq W , g = S ⇒ v = A $ by ax
zf: $ G , u = K , v = A , f = L , f ∊ fseq W , g = S ⇒ f = L $ by ax
zg: $ G , u = K , v = A , f = L , f ∊ fseq W , g = S ⇒ g = S $ by ax
z2: $ G , u = K , v = A , f = L , f ∊ fseq W , g = S ⇒ scons u f = scons K L $ by scons_eq [zu, zf]
z3: $ G , u = K , v = A , f = L , f ∊ fseq W , g = S ⇒ scons v g = scons A S $ by scons_eq [zv, zg]
z4: $ G , u = K , v = A , f = L , f ∊ fseq W , g = S ⇒ szip (scons u f) (scons v g) = szip (scons K L) (scons A S) $ by szip_eq [z2, z3]
z5: $ G , u = K , v = A , f = L , f ∊ fseq W , g = S ⇒ ⟨ u , v ⟩ = ⟨ K , A ⟩ $ by opair_eq [zu, zv]
z6: $ G , u = K , v = A , f = L , f ∊ fseq W , g = S ⇒ csn ⟨ u , v ⟩ = csn ⟨ K , A ⟩ $ by csn_eq [z5]
z7: $ G , u = K , v = A , f = L , f ∊ fseq W , g = S ⇒ szip f g = szip L S $ by szip_eq [zf, zg]
z8: $ G , u = K , v = A , f = L , f ∊ fseq W , g = S ⇒ csn ⟨ u , v ⟩ ∪ szip f g = csn ⟨ K , A ⟩ ∪ szip L S $ by cun_eq [z6, z7]
z9: $ G , u = K , v = A , f = L , f ∊ fseq W , g = S ⇒ szip (scons K L) (scons A S) = szip (scons u f) (scons v g) $ by eq_sym [z4]
z10: $ G , u = K , v = A , f = L , f ∊ fseq W , g = S ⇒ szip (scons K L) (scons A S) = csn ⟨ u , v ⟩ ∪ szip f g $ by eq_trans [z9, z1]
z11: $ G , u = K , v = A , f = L , f ∊ fseq W , g = S ⇒ szip (scons K L) (scons A S) = csn ⟨ K , A ⟩ ∪ szip L S $ by eq_trans [z10, z8]
z12: $ G , u = K , v = A , f = L , f ∊ fseq W ⇒ szip (scons K L) (scons A S) = csn ⟨ K , A ⟩ ∪ szip L S $ by isset_elim [#4, z11]
z13: $ G , u = K , v = A ⇒ szip (scons K L) (scons A S) = csn ⟨ K , A ⟩ ∪ szip L S $ by wcel_elim [#3, z12]
z14: $ G , u = K ⇒ szip (scons K L) (scons A S) = csn ⟨ K , A ⟩ ∪ szip L S $ by isset_elim [#2, z13]
z15: $ G ⇒ szip (scons K L) (scons A S) = csn ⟨ K , A ⟩ ∪ szip L S $ by isset_elim [#1, z14]

--| Class form of `csn_subset`.
lemma u2_csn_sub_c (G: hyps) (C X: class): $ G ⇒ C ∈ X $ > $ G ⇒ csn C ⊆ X $
----
y1: $ G , y ∊ csn C ⇒ y ∊ csn C $ by ax
y2: $ G , y ∊ csn C ⇒ y = C $ by csn_elim [y1]
y3: $ G , y ∊ csn C ⇒ C = y $ by eq_sym [y2]
y4: $ G , y ∊ csn C ⇒ C ∈ X $ by weaken [#1]
y5: $ G , y ∊ csn C ⇒ y ∈ X $ by wcel_eq_l [y3, y4]
y6: $ G , y ∊ csn C ⇒ y ∊ X $ by wcel_welc [y5]
y7: $ G ⇒ csn C ⊆ X $ by subset_intro [y6]

--| The children of a node, as an argument-sort list and a tree list: the empty lists.
lemma u2_inv_base (G: hyps) (T O: class): $ G ⇒ ∅ ∈ fseq ω ∧ ∅ ∈ fseq (trees ω) ∧ cdm ∅ = cdm ∅ ∧ szip ∅ ∅ ⊆ sorted T O $
----
i1: $ G ⇒ ∅ ∈ fseq ω $ by fseq_empty
i2: $ G ⇒ ∅ ∈ fseq (trees ω) $ by fseq_empty
i3: $ G ⇒ cdm ∅ = cdm ∅ $ by eq_refl
i4: $ G ⇒ szip ∅ ∅ = ∅ $ by szip_empty
i5: $ G ⇒ ∅ ⊆ sorted T O $ by empty_subset
i6: $ G ⇒ ∅ = szip ∅ ∅ $ by eq_sym [i4]
i7: $ G ⇒ szip ∅ ∅ ⊆ sorted T O $ by subset_eq_l [i6, i5]
i8: $ G ⇒ cdm ∅ = cdm ∅ ∧ szip ∅ ∅ ⊆ sorted T O $ by and_intro [i3, i7]
i9: $ G ⇒ ∅ ∈ fseq (trees ω) ∧ cdm ∅ = cdm ∅ ∧ szip ∅ ∅ ⊆ sorted T O $ by and_intro [i2, i8]
i10: $ G ⇒ ∅ ∈ fseq ω ∧ ∅ ∈ fseq (trees ω) ∧ cdm ∅ = cdm ∅ ∧ szip ∅ ∅ ⊆ sorted T O $ by and_intro [i1, i9]

--| The children of a node: one more child.
lemma u2_inv_step (G: hyps) (T O K A L S: class):
  $ G ⇒ sig T O $ > $ G ⇒ A ∈ ofsort T O K $ > $ G ⇒ L ∈ fseq ω ∧ S ∈ fseq (trees ω) ∧ cdm S = cdm L ∧ szip L S ⊆ sorted T O $ >
  $ G ⇒ (scons K L) ∈ fseq ω ∧ (scons A S) ∈ fseq (trees ω) ∧ cdm (scons A S) = cdm (scons K L) ∧ szip (scons K L) (scons A S) ⊆ sorted T O $
----
a1: $ G ⇒ ⟨ K , A ⟩ ∈ sorted T O $ by ofsort_mem_elim [#2]
a2: $ G ⇒ isset A $ by wcel_isset [#2]
a3: $ G ⇒ sorted T O ⊆ ω × trees ω $ by sorted_sub [#1]
a4: $ G ⇒ ⟨ K , A ⟩ ∈ ω × trees ω $ by wcel_subset [a3, a1]
a5: $ G ⇒ K ∈ ω ∧ A ∈ trees ω $ by u2_cxp_elim_c [a4, a2]
a6: $ G ⇒ K ∈ ω $ by and_elim_l [a5]
a7: $ G ⇒ A ∈ trees ω $ by and_elim_r [a5]
a8: $ G ⇒ isset K $ by wcel_isset [a6]
b1: $ G ⇒ L ∈ fseq ω $ by and_elim_l [#3]
b1r: $ G ⇒ S ∈ fseq (trees ω) ∧ cdm S = cdm L ∧ szip L S ⊆ sorted T O $ by and_elim_r [#3]
b2: $ G ⇒ S ∈ fseq (trees ω) $ by and_elim_l [b1r]
b2r: $ G ⇒ cdm S = cdm L ∧ szip L S ⊆ sorted T O $ by and_elim_r [b1r]
b3: $ G ⇒ cdm S = cdm L $ by and_elim_l [b2r]
b4: $ G ⇒ szip L S ⊆ sorted T O $ by and_elim_r [b2r]
b5: $ G ⇒ isset S $ by wcel_isset [b2]
c1: $ G ⇒ scons K L ∈ fseq ω $ by u2_scons_fseq_c [a6, b1]
c2: $ G ⇒ scons A S ∈ fseq (trees ω) $ by u2_scons_fseq_c [a7, b2]
d1: $ G ⇒ cdm (scons A S) = suc (cdm S) $ by u2_scons_len_c [a2, b2]
d2: $ G ⇒ cdm (scons K L) = suc (cdm L) $ by u2_scons_len_c [a8, b1]
d3: $ G ⇒ suc (cdm S) = suc (cdm L) $ by suc_eq [b3]
d4: $ G ⇒ suc (cdm L) = cdm (scons K L) $ by eq_sym [d2]
d5: $ G ⇒ cdm (scons A S) = suc (cdm L) $ by eq_trans [d1, d3]
d6: $ G ⇒ cdm (scons A S) = cdm (scons K L) $ by eq_trans [d5, d4]
e1: $ G ⇒ szip (scons K L) (scons A S) = csn ⟨ K , A ⟩ ∪ szip L S $ by u2_szip_scons_c [a8, a2, b1, b5]
e2: $ G ⇒ csn ⟨ K , A ⟩ ⊆ sorted T O $ by u2_csn_sub_c [a1]
e3: $ G ⇒ csn ⟨ K , A ⟩ ∪ szip L S ⊆ sorted T O $ by cun_least [e2, b4]
e4: $ G ⇒ csn ⟨ K , A ⟩ ∪ szip L S = szip (scons K L) (scons A S) $ by eq_sym [e1]
e5: $ G ⇒ szip (scons K L) (scons A S) ⊆ sorted T O $ by subset_eq_l [e4, e3]
f1: $ G ⇒ cdm (scons A S) = cdm (scons K L) ∧ szip (scons K L) (scons A S) ⊆ sorted T O $ by and_intro [d6, e5]
f2: $ G ⇒ scons A S ∈ fseq (trees ω) ∧ cdm (scons A S) = cdm (scons K L) ∧ szip (scons K L) (scons A S) ⊆ sorted T O $ by and_intro [c2, f1]
f3: $ G ⇒ (scons K L) ∈ fseq ω ∧ (scons A S) ∈ fseq (trees ω) ∧ cdm (scons A S) = cdm (scons K L) ∧ szip (scons K L) (scons A S) ⊆ sorted T O $ by and_intro [c1, f2]

--| A constructor node from its children.
lemma u2_inv_fin (G: hyps) (T O C K L S: class):
  $ G ⇒ sig T O $ > $ G ⇒ ⟨ C , ⟨ K , L ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T $ > $ G ⇒ L ∈ fseq ω ∧ S ∈ fseq (trees ω) ∧ cdm S = cdm L ∧ szip L S ⊆ sorted T O $ >
  $ G ⇒ ⟨ C , S ⟩ ∈ ofsort T O K $
----
b1: $ G ⇒ L ∈ fseq ω $ by and_elim_l [#3]
b1r: $ G ⇒ S ∈ fseq (trees ω) ∧ cdm S = cdm L ∧ szip L S ⊆ sorted T O $ by and_elim_r [#3]
b2: $ G ⇒ S ∈ fseq (trees ω) $ by and_elim_l [b1r]
b2r: $ G ⇒ cdm S = cdm L ∧ szip L S ⊆ sorted T O $ by and_elim_r [b1r]
b3: $ G ⇒ cdm S = cdm L $ by and_elim_l [b2r]
b4: $ G ⇒ szip L S ⊆ sorted T O $ by and_elim_r [b2r]
iS: $ G ⇒ isset S $ by wcel_isset [b2]
iL: $ G ⇒ isset L $ by wcel_isset [b1]
i1: $ G ⇒ T ⊆ ω × (ω × fseq ω) $ by sig_table [#1]
i2: $ G ⇒ ⟨ C , ⟨ K , L ⟩ ⟩ ∈ ω × (ω × fseq ω) $ by wcel_subset [i1, #2]
i3: $ G ⇒ isset ⟨ K , L ⟩ $ by opair_isset
i4: $ G ⇒ C ∈ ω ∧ ⟨ K , L ⟩ ∈ ω × fseq ω $ by u2_cxp_elim_c [i2, i3]
i5: $ G ⇒ ⟨ K , L ⟩ ∈ ω × fseq ω $ by and_elim_r [i4]
iK: $ G ⇒ isset K $ by u2_cxp_isset [i5]
i6: $ G ⇒ C ∈ ω $ by and_elim_l [i4]
iC: $ G ⇒ isset C $ by wcel_isset [i6]
j0c: $ G , c = C , k = K , a = L , g = S ⇒ c = C $ by ax
j0k: $ G , c = C , k = K , a = L , g = S ⇒ k = K $ by ax
j0a: $ G , c = C , k = K , a = L , g = S ⇒ a = L $ by ax
j0g: $ G , c = C , k = K , a = L , g = S ⇒ g = S $ by ax
j1: $ G , c = C , k = K , a = L , g = S ⇒ ⟨ k , a ⟩ = ⟨ K , L ⟩ $ by opair_eq [j0k, j0a]
j1b: $ G , c = C , k = K , a = L , g = S ⇒ ⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ = ⟨ C , ⟨ K , L ⟩ ⟩ $ by opair_eq [j0c, j1]
j2: $ G , c = C , k = K , a = L , g = S ⇒ ⟨ C , ⟨ K , L ⟩ ⟩ = ⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ $ by eq_sym [j1b]
j2b: $ G , c = C , k = K , a = L , g = S ⇒ ⟨ C , ⟨ K , L ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T $ by weaken [#2]
j3: $ G , c = C , k = K , a = L , g = S ⇒ ⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ T $ by wcel_eq_l [j2, j2b]
j4: $ G , c = C , k = K , a = L , g = S ⇒ S = g $ by eq_sym [j0g]
j4b: $ G , c = C , k = K , a = L , g = S ⇒ S ∈ fseq (trees ω) $ by weaken [b2]
j5: $ G , c = C , k = K , a = L , g = S ⇒ g ∈ fseq (trees ω) $ by wcel_eq_l [j4, j4b]
j6: $ G , c = C , k = K , a = L , g = S ⇒ g ∊ fseq (trees ω) $ by wcel_welc [j5]
j7: $ G , c = C , k = K , a = L , g = S ⇒ cdm g = cdm S $ by cdm_eq [j0g]
j8: $ G , c = C , k = K , a = L , g = S ⇒ cdm S = cdm L $ by weaken [b3]
j9: $ G , c = C , k = K , a = L , g = S ⇒ L = a $ by eq_sym [j0a]
j10: $ G , c = C , k = K , a = L , g = S ⇒ cdm L = cdm a $ by cdm_eq [j9]
j11: $ G , c = C , k = K , a = L , g = S ⇒ cdm g = cdm L $ by eq_trans [j7, j8]
j12: $ G , c = C , k = K , a = L , g = S ⇒ cdm g = cdm a $ by eq_trans [j11, j10]
j13: $ G , c = C , k = K , a = L , g = S ⇒ szip a g = szip L S $ by szip_eq [j0a, j0g]
j14: $ G , c = C , k = K , a = L , g = S ⇒ szip L S = szip a g $ by eq_sym [j13]
j14b: $ G , c = C , k = K , a = L , g = S ⇒ szip L S ⊆ sorted T O $ by weaken [b4]
j15: $ G , c = C , k = K , a = L , g = S ⇒ szip a g ⊆ sorted T O $ by subset_eq_l [j14, j14b]
j15b: $ G , c = C , k = K , a = L , g = S ⇒ sig T O $ by weaken [#1]
j16: $ G , c = C , k = K , a = L , g = S ⇒ ⟨ k , ⟨ c , g ⟩ ⟩ ∈ sorted T O $ by sorted_node [j15b, j3, j6, j12, j15]
j17: $ G , c = C , k = K , a = L , g = S ⇒ ⟨ c , g ⟩ = ⟨ C , S ⟩ $ by opair_eq [j0c, j0g]
j18: $ G , c = C , k = K , a = L , g = S ⇒ ⟨ k , ⟨ c , g ⟩ ⟩ = ⟨ K , ⟨ C , S ⟩ ⟩ $ by opair_eq [j0k, j17]
j19: $ G , c = C , k = K , a = L , g = S ⇒ ⟨ K , ⟨ C , S ⟩ ⟩ ∈ sorted T O $ by wcel_eq_l [j18, j16]
j20: $ G , c = C , k = K , a = L , g = S ⇒ isset ⟨ C , S ⟩ $ by opair_isset
j21: $ G , c = C , k = K , a = L , g = S ⇒ ⟨ C , S ⟩ ∈ ofsort T O K $ by ofsort_mem [j19, j20]
j22: $ G , c = C , k = K , a = L ⇒ ⟨ C , S ⟩ ∈ ofsort T O K $ by isset_elim [iS, j21]
j23: $ G , c = C , k = K ⇒ ⟨ C , S ⟩ ∈ ofsort T O K $ by isset_elim [iL, j22]
j24: $ G , c = C ⇒ ⟨ C , S ⟩ ∈ ofsort T O K $ by isset_elim [iK, j23]
j25: $ G ⇒ ⟨ C , S ⟩ ∈ ofsort T O K $ by isset_elim [iC, j24]

