p0: $ G ⇒ ∅ ∈ fseq ω ∧ ∅ ∈ fseq (trees ω) ∧ cdm ∅ = cdm ∅ ∧ szip ∅ ∅ ⊆ sorted T O $ by u2_inv_base
p1: $ G ⇒ (scons K2 ∅) ∈ fseq ω ∧ (scons A2 ∅) ∈ fseq (trees ω) ∧ cdm (scons A2 ∅) = cdm (scons K2 ∅) ∧ szip (scons K2 ∅) (scons A2 ∅) ⊆ sorted T O $ by u2_inv_step [#1, #4, p0]
p2: $ G ⇒ (scons K1 (scons K2 ∅)) ∈ fseq ω ∧ (scons A1 (scons A2 ∅)) ∈ fseq (trees ω) ∧ cdm (scons A1 (scons A2 ∅)) = cdm (scons K1 (scons K2 ∅)) ∧ szip (scons K1 (scons K2 ∅)) (scons A1 (scons A2 ∅)) ⊆ sorted T O $ by u2_inv_step [#1, #3, p1]
q1: $ G ⇒ ⟨ C , scons A1 (scons A2 ∅) ⟩ ∈ ofsort T O K $ by u2_inv_fin [#1, #2, p2]

