------------
p0: $ G ⇒ ∅ ∈ fseq ω ∧ ∅ ∈ fseq (trees ω) ∧ cdm ∅ = cdm ∅ ∧ szip ∅ ∅ ⊆ sorted T O $ by u2_inv_base
