b1: $ G , s = scons i j ∧ j ∊ fseq (trees ω) ∧ cdm j = cdm ∅ ∧ szip ∅ j ⊆ X ∧ ⟨ K1 , i ⟩ ∈ X ⇒ s = scons i j ∧ j ∊ fseq (trees ω) ∧ cdm j = cdm ∅ ∧ szip ∅ j ⊆ X ∧ ⟨ K1 , i ⟩ ∈ X $ by ax
b2: $ G , s = scons i j ∧ j ∊ fseq (trees ω) ∧ cdm j = cdm ∅ ∧ szip ∅ j ⊆ X ∧ ⟨ K1 , i ⟩ ∈ X ⇒ s = scons i j $ by and_elim_l [b1]
b3: $ G , s = scons i j ∧ j ∊ fseq (trees ω) ∧ cdm j = cdm ∅ ∧ szip ∅ j ⊆ X ∧ ⟨ K1 , i ⟩ ∈ X ⇒ j ∊ fseq (trees ω) ∧ cdm j = cdm ∅ ∧ szip ∅ j ⊆ X ∧ ⟨ K1 , i ⟩ ∈ X $ by and_elim_r [b1]
b4: $ G , s = scons i j ∧ j ∊ fseq (trees ω) ∧ cdm j = cdm ∅ ∧ szip ∅ j ⊆ X ∧ ⟨ K1 , i ⟩ ∈ X ⇒ j ∊ fseq (trees ω) $ by and_elim_l [b3]
b5: $ G , s = scons i j ∧ j ∊ fseq (trees ω) ∧ cdm j = cdm ∅ ∧ szip ∅ j ⊆ X ∧ ⟨ K1 , i ⟩ ∈ X ⇒ cdm j = cdm ∅ ∧ szip ∅ j ⊆ X ∧ ⟨ K1 , i ⟩ ∈ X $ by and_elim_r [b3]
b6: $ G , s = scons i j ∧ j ∊ fseq (trees ω) ∧ cdm j = cdm ∅ ∧ szip ∅ j ⊆ X ∧ ⟨ K1 , i ⟩ ∈ X ⇒ cdm j = cdm ∅ $ by and_elim_l [b5]
b7: $ G , s = scons i j ∧ j ∊ fseq (trees ω) ∧ cdm j = cdm ∅ ∧ szip ∅ j ⊆ X ∧ ⟨ K1 , i ⟩ ∈ X ⇒ szip ∅ j ⊆ X ∧ ⟨ K1 , i ⟩ ∈ X $ by and_elim_r [b5]
b8: $ G , s = scons i j ∧ j ∊ fseq (trees ω) ∧ cdm j = cdm ∅ ∧ szip ∅ j ⊆ X ∧ ⟨ K1 , i ⟩ ∈ X ⇒ szip ∅ j ⊆ X $ by and_elim_l [b7]
b9: $ G , s = scons i j ∧ j ∊ fseq (trees ω) ∧ cdm j = cdm ∅ ∧ szip ∅ j ⊆ X ∧ ⟨ K1 , i ⟩ ∈ X ⇒ ⟨ K1 , i ⟩ ∈ X $ by and_elim_r [b7]
c1: $ G , s = scons i j ∧ j ∊ fseq (trees ω) ∧ cdm j = cdm ∅ ∧ szip ∅ j ⊆ X ∧ ⟨ K1 , i ⟩ ∈ X ⇒ j = ∅ $ by szip_args0 [b4, b6]
c2: $ G , s = scons i j ∧ j ∊ fseq (trees ω) ∧ cdm j = cdm ∅ ∧ szip ∅ j ⊆ X ∧ ⟨ K1 , i ⟩ ∈ X ⇒ i = i $ by eq_refl
c3: $ G , s = scons i j ∧ j ∊ fseq (trees ω) ∧ cdm j = cdm ∅ ∧ szip ∅ j ⊆ X ∧ ⟨ K1 , i ⟩ ∈ X ⇒ scons i j = scons i ∅ $ by scons_eq [c2, c1]
c4: $ G , s = scons i j ∧ j ∊ fseq (trees ω) ∧ cdm j = cdm ∅ ∧ szip ∅ j ⊆ X ∧ ⟨ K1 , i ⟩ ∈ X ⇒ s = scons i ∅ $ by eq_trans [b2, c3]
c5: $ G , s = scons i j ∧ j ∊ fseq (trees ω) ∧ cdm j = cdm ∅ ∧ szip ∅ j ⊆ X ∧ ⟨ K1 , i ⟩ ∈ X ⇒ s = scons i ∅ ∧ ⟨ K1 , i ⟩ ∈ X $ by and_intro [c4, b9]
c6: $ G , s = scons i j ∧ j ∊ fseq (trees ω) ∧ cdm j = cdm ∅ ∧ szip ∅ j ⊆ X ∧ ⟨ K1 , i ⟩ ∈ X ⇒ ∃ x (s = scons x ∅ ∧ ⟨ K1 , x ⟩ ∈ X) $ by ex_intro [c5]
z1a: $ G , ∃ j (s = scons i j ∧ j ∊ fseq (trees ω) ∧ cdm j = cdm ∅ ∧ szip ∅ j ⊆ X ∧ ⟨ K1 , i ⟩ ∈ X) ⇒ ∃ j (s = scons i j ∧ j ∊ fseq (trees ω) ∧ cdm j = cdm ∅ ∧ szip ∅ j ⊆ X ∧ ⟨ K1 , i ⟩ ∈ X) $ by ax
z1b: $ G , ∃ j (s = scons i j ∧ j ∊ fseq (trees ω) ∧ cdm j = cdm ∅ ∧ szip ∅ j ⊆ X ∧ ⟨ K1 , i ⟩ ∈ X) ⇒ ∃ x (s = scons x ∅ ∧ ⟨ K1 , x ⟩ ∈ X) $ by ex_elim [z1a, c6]
z0: $ G ⇒ ∃ x (s = scons x ∅ ∧ ⟨ K1 , x ⟩ ∈ X) $ by ex_elim [a2, z1b]

