b2: $ G , s = scons i j ∧ j ∊ fseq (trees ω) ∧ cdm j = cdm (scons K2 ∅) ∧ szip (scons K2 ∅) j ⊆ X ∧ ⟨ K1 , i ⟩ ∈ X ⇒ s = scons i j $ by and_elim_l [b1]
